(window.AeroSenseTranslations ||= []).push({"Inspect the endpoint analysis of 25 fluorescence fields across 12 conditions. Reusable scripts and machine-readable tables connect each image to its QC decisions, DAPI-object measurements, reporter thresholds and exclusions.":"檢視 12 種條件、25 個螢光視野的終點影像分析。可重用的程式與機器可讀表格，將每張影像連結至其品管決策、DAPI 物件量測、報導訊號門檻與排除項目。","Reuse the kinetic odor assays":"重用氣味動態試驗","The Test 1 source index links 32 original exports, 3,840 fluorescence readings and 96 well summaries from one HEK293 plate. It includes a standalone analysis script, QC exclusions, English figures and the executed method. The archive retains all raw readings, including the two rows excluded from the corrected comparison.":"Test 1 來源索引連結同一塊 HEK293 培養盤的 32 份原始匯出檔、3,840 筆螢光讀值與 96 份孔位摘要，並包含獨立分析程式、品管排除項目、英文圖表及實際執行的方法。封存資料保留全部原始讀值，包括校正比較中排除的兩列。","Construct maps, Registry records and exploratory fluorescence assays connect the OR/Orco design to its experimental evidence.":"構築圖譜、Registry 紀錄與探索性螢光試驗，將 OR／Orco 設計連結至實驗證據。","Designs and exploratory measurements.":"設計與探索性量測。","Explore:":"探索：","Fusion reporter design":"融合報導蛋白設計","Orco agonist reference":"Orco 致效劑參考資料","Annotated construct maps":"具註解的構築圖譜","Maps of the receptor-expression cassette and the GCaMP6f–Orco reporter.":"受體表現盒與 GCaMP6f–Orco 報導模組的圖譜。","Biological control plan":"生物對照規劃","Ionomycin × VUAA1 diagnostic logic connects reporter performance to Orco agonist response in the engineering record.":"工程紀錄中的 ionomycin × VUAA1 診斷邏輯，將報導蛋白表現連結至 Orco 致效劑反應。","Reporter architecture and troubleshooting notes":"報導架構與故障排查紀錄","Engineering records the earlier IRES-driven reporter investigation and the rationale for the GCaMP6f–Orco fusion.":"工程頁記錄早期 IRES 驅動報導蛋白的研究，以及改採 GCaMP6f–Orco 融合蛋白的理由。","Optical readout, fluorescent-standard tests and reusable calibration records.":"光學讀取、螢光標準品測試與可重用的校正紀錄。","A documented four-channel reader with fluorescent-standard measurements, calibration analysis and measured cross-talk correction.":"具完整文件的四通道讀取器，包含螢光標準品量測、校正分析及實測串擾修正。","Built and tested with standards.":"已製作並以標準品測試。","reports 58 fluorescein acquisitions, calibration coefficients and a measured channel-mixing matrix.":"報告 58 次螢光素擷取、校正係數與實測通道混合矩陣。","traces the corresponding circuit and enclosure decisions. The":"追溯相應的電路與外殼設計決策。","connect those measurements to the build files and analysis.":"將這些量測連結至製作檔案與分析。","An ESP32 handles acquisition, modulation, embedded processing and wireless communication in the current reader; higher-level inference remains off-board. Engineering retains the earlier Raspberry Pi comparison and the rationale for consolidating these functions.":"目前讀取器由 ESP32 負責擷取、調變、嵌入式處理與無線通訊；高階推論仍在板外執行。工程紀錄保留先前與 Raspberry Pi 的比較，以及整合這些功能的理由。","Text-based design sources are available on GitLab; model files are listed under archive availability. The CAD preview images are available below.":"文字格式的設計來源可於 GitLab 取得；模型檔案列於封存資料可用性說明。CAD 預覽圖片如下。","Initial DRC report · PDF":"初版 DRC 報告 · PDF","Initial ERC report · PDF":"初版 ERC 報告 · PDF",". The measured mixing matrix and correction analysis are available with the calibration records.":"。實測混合矩陣與修正分析可於校正紀錄中取得。","The earlier reporter investigation motivated a GCaMP6f–Orco fusion to bring the calcium reporter closer to the channel; Engineering preserves the observations and redesign rationale.":"早期報導蛋白研究促使我們採用 GCaMP6f–Orco 融合蛋白，使鈣離子報導蛋白更靠近通道；工程頁保留相關觀察與重新設計的理由。","Record formats documented.":"已記錄資料格式。","The blank CSV and JSON Schema specify sample identity, units, controls, source hashes and signal-quality fields.":"空白 CSV 與 JSON Schema 定義樣本身分、單位、對照、來源雜湊值及訊號品質欄位。","AeroSense defines a shared data interface across the three layers. The lists below define the record format.":"AeroSense 為三個層級定義共用資料介面。下列清單說明紀錄格式。","Download the blank CSV, schema and instructions":"下載空白 CSV、結構定義與說明","A documented fly-inspired decoder architecture, evaluated with external sensor benchmarks and simpler comparison models.":"具文件記錄的仿果蠅解碼器架構，以外部感測器基準資料及較簡單的比較模型評估。","Architecture and external-data benchmarks.":"架構與外部資料基準測試。","Find model tables, methods and source code":"查閱模型表格、方法與原始碼","The schematic PDF is available from the link above.":"電路原理圖 PDF 可由上方連結取得。","Includes measured channel mixing and cross-talk correction records.":"包含實測通道混合與串擾修正紀錄。","Fluorescein measurements, calibration coefficients and reproducible cross-talk analysis.":"螢光素量測、校正係數及可重現的串擾分析。","Measurement conditions and fitted ranges accompany the results.":"結果附有量測條件與擬合範圍。","Blank formats with units, QC and provenance fields.":"包含單位、品管及來源欄位的空白格式。","Decoder architecture, assumptions and external-sensor benchmark results.":"解碼器架構、假設及外部感測器基準測試結果。","Discussion identifies the scope of the available implementation and reproducibility record.":"討論段落界定現有實作與可重現性紀錄的範圍。","Scope and evidence for reuse":"重用範圍與證據","The resources preserve the connection between design, measurements and interpretation.":"這些資源保留設計、量測與解釋之間的連結。","Acquired odor-assay time courses and diagnostic analysis":"已擷取的氣味試驗時間序列與診斷分析","The following scope accompanies reuse of the cellular, reader and model evidence.":"重用細胞、讀取器與模型證據時，應一併考量下列適用範圍。","Biological interpretation":"生物學解釋","The cassette map specifies OR–IRES–mCherry as the expression marker and GCaMP6f–Orco as the calcium reporter. The earlier IRES-driven calcium-reporter observations belong to the redesign record. Microscopy and the two single-well kinetic assays support exploratory characterization; they do not establish stable cell lines or receptor-specific activation. The ionomycin × VUAA1 diagnostic matrix remains a planned control framework.":"表現盒圖譜將 OR–IRES–mCherry 定義為表現標記，將 GCaMP6f–Orco 定義為鈣離子報導模組。早期 IRES 驅動鈣離子報導蛋白的觀察屬於重新設計紀錄。顯微影像與兩項單孔動態試驗支持探索性特性分析，但不能確立穩定細胞株或受體專一性活化。ionomycin × VUAA1 診斷矩陣仍是規劃中的對照架構。","Reader validation scope":"讀取器驗證範圍","Fluorescein measurements establish reader behavior under the documented standard-solution conditions. Calibration and cross-talk correction retain their fitted ranges and matrix assumptions. Living-cell integration is exploratory; these records do not establish receptor-specific odor detection or field performance.":"螢光素量測確立讀取器在所記錄標準溶液條件下的行為。校正與串擾修正須保留其擬合範圍及矩陣假設。活細胞整合仍屬探索階段；這些紀錄不能確立受體專一性氣味偵測或現場效能。","Measurement record scope":"量測紀錄範圍","The measurement CSV and schema are blank record formats. They are not a matched raw/processed example of a reader run, and an SNR field does not itself provide a measured detection limit.":"量測 CSV 與結構定義是空白紀錄格式，不是一組讀取器測試的原始／處理後配對範例；具備 SNR 欄位本身也不代表已有實測偵測極限。","Decoder reproducibility":"解碼器可重現性","The four-feature NumPy MLP and the PN–KC–MBON decoder are separate implementations. The decoder benchmarks use external metal-oxide sensors; the matching training engine, fitted preprocessing, fold tables and seeds are not all released. These results therefore do not demonstrate classification of AeroSense cell responses.":"四特徵 NumPy MLP 與 PN–KC–MBON 解碼器是不同的實作。解碼器基準測試使用外部金屬氧化物感測器；對應的訓練引擎、已擬合前處理、各折表格與隨機種子尚未全部公開。因此，這些結果並未證明能分類 AeroSense 細胞反應。","Feedback records":"回饋紀錄","AeroSense provides reusable biological designs, weak-signal measurement methods and structured odor-decoding resources. Teams can adopt one layer and trace its inputs, analysis and evidence independently.":"AeroSense 提供可重用的生物設計、微弱訊號量測方法與結構化氣味解碼資源。其他團隊可採用其中一個層級，並獨立追溯其輸入、分析與證據。","Research archive:":"研究封存資料：",". Public release pending.":"。公開發布尚待完成。","Parts documentation — GitLab":"生物元件文件 — GitLab","Protocols and reusable record formats":"實驗流程與可重用紀錄格式",". The general protocol identifies executed and proposed procedures. The separately acquired":"。一般實驗流程區分已執行與擬議程序。另行取得的","Test 1 executed methods · PDF":"Test 1 實際執行方法 · PDF","documents the executed VUAA1/VOC pilot; the broader 384-well specification is retained as a proposed assay.":"記錄已執行的 VUAA1／VOC 先導試驗；較廣泛的 384 孔試驗規格則保留為擬議試驗。","Experimental data and reproducible analysis":"實驗資料與可重現分析","Microscopy and both odor assays: data and analysis":"顯微影像及兩項氣味試驗：資料與分析","Fluorescent standards, calibration and channel-mixing records":"螢光標準品、校正與通道混合紀錄","Model tables, methods and source code":"模型表格、方法與原始碼","Archive availability:":"封存資料可用性：","Research archive availability":"研究封存資料可用性","Test 1: original plate-reader exports and complete kinetic-analysis outputs.":"Test 1：原始微孔盤讀取器匯出檔與完整動態分析輸出。","The control-comparison package contains aggregate inputs, executable analysis, source hashes and output tables. The protocol record distinguishes executed procedures from assay specifications.":"對照比較套件包含彙整輸入、可執行分析、來源雜湊值及輸出表格。實驗流程紀錄區分已執行程序與試驗規格。","Contribution resource status":"貢獻資源狀態","Scientific review":"科學審查","Generated artwork explains concepts. Experimental claims are based on the underlying measurements. The":"生成插畫用來說明概念；實驗主張依據底層量測。","retains raw files, analysis choices and exclusions for review. Team members checked the analyses against their source data; the relevant Discussion sections describe the scope of interpretation.":"保留原始檔案、分析選擇與排除項目，供讀者審查。團隊成員已將分析與來源資料核對；相關討論段落說明解釋範圍。","Image credits distinguish team photographs, microscopy and editorial illustrations. Figure captions identify measurements, simulations and illustrative calculations, and trace reused plots to the same underlying dataset. Conceptual fruit-fly and reader drawings explain the design.":"圖片出處區分團隊照片、顯微影像與編輯插畫。圖說標明量測、模擬及示意計算，並將重用圖表追溯至同一底層資料集。概念性果蠅與讀取器圖畫用於說明設計。","The team wiki is licensed under CC BY 4.0, as recorded in the official repository’s LICENSE file. Source code, hardware files and third-party materials retain the license notices supplied with each resource. Please retain those notices and the required attribution when reusing a file.":"團隊 Wiki 採 CC BY 4.0 授權，記載於官方儲存庫的 LICENSE 檔案。原始碼、硬體檔案與第三方素材保留各資源隨附的授權聲明。重用檔案時，請保留這些聲明與必要的姓名標示。","is the license for the team wiki. Resource-specific notices identify the terms for separately distributed materials.":"是團隊 Wiki 的授權。個別資源聲明說明另行散布素材的條款。","Fungal deterioration causes substantial crop losses, highlighting the need for accessible tools for early, on-site detection. Our project, AeroSense, is a modular biohybrid olfactory platform designed for agricultural screening, with banana production as its intended first application. The platform brings together a cell-based sensing array expressing Drosophila odorant receptors and their coreceptor ORCO in HEK293 cells, GCaMP6f fluorescence reporting, a compact four-channel optical reader, and a fly-inspired neural network for odor-pattern decoding. We documented reporter expression and conducted exploratory measurements of fluorescence kinetics. We also built and tested the optical reader using fluorescent standards, with transport and optical modeling informing its design. In parallel, computational studies evaluated odor-pattern decoding on external sensor datasets. Discussions with agricultural researchers and potential users shaped the proposed screening workflow and a shared-access deployment strategy. Together with reusable analysis code, hardware documentation, and educational resources, this work lays the groundwork for an accessible screening tool to guide follow-up inspection and confirmatory testing.":"真菌造成的劣化導致大量作物損失，凸顯容易取得、可在現場早期偵測的工具之需求。我們的 AeroSense 專案是一套為農業篩檢設計的模組化生物混合嗅覺平台，預計以香蕉生產作為首個應用。平台結合在 HEK293 細胞中表現果蠅嗅覺受體及其共受體 ORCO 的細胞感測陣列、GCaMP6f 螢光報導、精巧的四通道光學讀取器，以及用於氣味模式解碼的仿果蠅神經網路。我們記錄報導蛋白表現，並進行探索性的螢光動態量測；也製作讀取器並以螢光標準品測試，運輸與光學模型則為設計提供依據。同時，計算研究以外部感測器資料集評估氣味模式解碼。與農業研究者及潛在使用者的討論，促成擬議的篩檢流程與共享使用部署策略。結合可重用的分析程式、硬體文件及教育資源，這項工作為容易取得的篩檢工具奠定基礎，以引導後續檢查與確認性檢驗。","chain. Our initial application is":"流程。我們最初的應用是","Dashed boxes mark approximate TH and GH146 imaging context on the circuit schematic; left and right describe the viewing side. Projection neurons (PNs) carry antennal-lobe output toward the mushroom-body calyx and lateral horn. Kenyon cells relay through the mushroom body to output neurons; the dashed path shows a separate dopamine input. This unfolded teaching schematic describes circuit roles.":"虛線框標示電路示意圖中 TH 與 GH146 影像的大致位置；左右代表觀察側。投射神經元（PN）將觸角葉輸出傳至蕈狀體萼部與側角。Kenyon 細胞經蕈狀體傳遞至輸出神經元；虛線路徑表示獨立的多巴胺輸入。此展開式教學示意圖說明各電路角色。","Full-resolution WebP":"完整解析度 WebP","Neuroanatomy rendering source — GitLab":"神經解剖渲染來源 — GitLab","Atlas sources and selected cells":"圖譜來源與所選細胞","The anatomy uses published MaleCNS v1.0 neuron centerlines and neuropil surfaces: four projection neurons, two PPL1 dopaminergic neurons, three MBONs and 15 right-side KCg-m examples. Cell identities and selection criteria are preserved in the":"解剖模型使用已發表的 MaleCNS v1.0 神經元中心線與神經纖維網表面：四個投射神經元、兩個 PPL1 多巴胺神經元、三個 MBON 與 15 個右側 KCg-m 範例。細胞身分與篩選標準保留於","dataset provenance":"資料集來源紀錄",". These reference cells provide anatomical context; the team's driver-labeled recordings are presented in Results.":"。這些參考細胞提供解剖背景；團隊以驅動系統標記的影像紀錄呈現在結果頁。","Watch on iGEM Video Universe ↗":"於 iGEM Video Universe 觀看 ↗","Published mammalian OR/Orco sensing establishes the biological starting point for AeroSense.":"已發表的哺乳類細胞 OR／Orco 感測研究，奠定 AeroSense 的生物學起點。","Our contribution is the integration and evaluation of receptor modules, weak-fluorescence hardware and structured decoding within a traceable measurement workflow.":"我們的貢獻在於可追溯量測流程中，整合並評估受體模組、微弱螢光硬體與結構化解碼。","We narrowed the initial application to":"我們將最初應用範圍縮小至","Repeat Test 1 with matched vehicles, documented doses and gain, and replicate wells from independent cultures. Test reporter responsiveness, Orco dependence and OR-dependent VOC responses separately.":"以匹配的溶劑對照、完整記錄的劑量與增益，以及來自獨立培養的重複孔，重做 Test 1。分別測試報導蛋白反應能力、Orco 依賴性與 OR 依賴的 VOC 反應。","The pages below develop the biological design, measurement system and validation evidence behind this architecture.":"下列頁面進一步說明此架構背後的生物設計、量測系統與驗證證據。","Two-module plasmid architecture on pcDNA3.1(+)":"pcDNA3.1(+) 上的雙模組質體架構","Module 1 is bicistronic: CMV enhancer/promoter, Kozak, OR, STOP, EMCV IRES, mCherry, STOP, BGH poly(A). Module 2 is a single ORF: CMV enhancer/promoter, Kozak, RSET leader, GCaMP6f, GGGGS three linker, DmOrco, STOP, BGH poly(A). Feature identity is given by text labels, not colour alone. Lengths are not drawn to scale.":"模組 1 為雙順反子：CMV 增強子／啟動子、Kozak、OR、STOP、EMCV IRES、mCherry、STOP、BGH poly(A)。模組 2 為單一開放閱讀框：CMV 增強子／啟動子、Kozak、RSET 前導序列、GCaMP6f、三段 GGGGS 連接序列、DmOrco、STOP、BGH poly(A)。特徵身分以文字標籤呈現，不僅依賴顏色。長度未依比例繪製。","Select a feature in":"選取特徵於","to view its notes.":"以檢視其註解。","Accessible cassette list matching":"對應圖示的無障礙表現盒清單","The acquired odor tests are reported on Results.":"已取得的氣味測試列於結果頁。","Orco inverted topology with N-terminal GCaMP6f in the cytoplasm":"Orco 的反向拓樸：N 端 GCaMP6f 位於細胞質","Membrane cross-section. Extracellular space at the top, cytoplasm at the bottom. Orco spans the bilayer with the C-terminus outside and the N-terminus inside. GCaMP6f is fused to the intracellular N-terminus. Calcium ions pass through an open pore from the extracellular side into the cytoplasm. Schematic only; not a cryo-EM reconstruction.":"細胞膜剖面：上方為細胞外，下方為細胞質。Orco 跨越雙層膜，C 端朝外、N 端朝內。GCaMP6f 融合於細胞內側的 N 端。鈣離子經開啟的孔道由細胞外進入細胞質。此圖僅為示意，並非冷凍電顯重建。","cytosolic Ca":"細胞質 Ca","influx through the pore":"經孔道流入","Matched expression, localization and agonist-response controls.":"匹配的表現、定位與致效劑反應對照。","mCherry provides an IRES-dependent expression marker translated from the same Module 1 transcript as the tuning receptor.":"mCherry 是 IRES 依賴的表現標記，與調諧受體由相同的模組 1 轉錄本轉譯。","The verification framework distinguishes sequence review, synthesis, Sanger reads and living-cell function, with a separate evidence status for each.":"驗證架構區分序列審查、合成、Sanger 讀序與活細胞功能，並為各項標示獨立證據狀態。","The sequence-check record is distinct from raw Sanger chromatograms, localization measurements and replicated VOC-response data. The available evidence does not include those validation layers. Schematics explain the architecture and are not sequence or structural measurements.":"序列檢查紀錄不同於原始 Sanger 色譜、定位量測及重複 VOC 反應資料。現有證據不包含這些驗證層級。示意圖說明架構，不是序列或結構量測。","accompany the interactive diagrams.":"隨互動圖示提供。","indexes components and Registry records;":"索引各元件與 Registry 紀錄；","documents methods;":"記錄實驗方法；","records design iterations. Biological images and analysis files are indexed in":"記錄設計迭代。生物影像與分析檔案索引位於","Our survey showed that the gaps are not missing facts but untested trust: many people were unsure whether heat or a sniff test can tell them food is safe. Being told \"a sniff test is not a safety test\" twice does not change that trust. Learners need to experience why smell can mislead.":"調查顯示，問題不只是知識不足，而是未經檢驗的信任：許多人不確定加熱或聞氣味能否判斷食品安全。重複告訴他們「聞氣味不是安全檢驗」並不會改變這種信任。學習者需要親自體驗氣味為何會誤導。","Smell works by pattern, not by a single signal. An odor activates several receptors at once, similar odors produce similar patterns, and mixtures overlap. This is why a nose, human or electronic, can be fooled, and it is also the principle AeroSense is built on. Odor Pixel Suite lets learners make the decisions themselves: recognize a pattern, follow a scent, separate a mixture, and see when they get it wrong. The games turn the reason behind our survey findings and the logic of our sensor into something learners can play.":"嗅覺依靠模式，而非單一訊號。一種氣味會同時活化多個受體；相似氣味產生相似模式，混合物則彼此重疊。這說明人鼻與電子鼻為何都可能被誤導，也正是 AeroSense 的設計原理。Odor Pixel Suite 讓學習者自行決策：辨識模式、追蹤氣味、分解混合物，並觀察何時判斷錯誤。遊戲將調查結果背後的原因與感測器邏輯轉化為可遊玩的體驗。","Odor Pixel Suite is three short browser games. Each has three levels (Junior, Standard, Challenge), a Practice mode, a Daily Challenge mode and a Science page that explains the biology behind it.":"Odor Pixel Suite 包含三款短篇瀏覽器遊戲。每款都有初階、標準、挑戰三種難度，練習模式、每日挑戰模式，以及說明背後生物學的科學頁面。","(Scentbound Maze)":"（氣味迷宮）","We built the suite through a five-stage design journey. At each stage we collected evidence and changed the games in response.":"我們透過五階段設計歷程建立遊戲套件，每階段都蒐集證據並據此修改。","We started from three perspectives on scent: its encoding features, its identity and identification, and its composition ratio. We sketched one game for each: pattern recognition, a scent-guided labyrinth and a fingerprint mixer.":"我們從氣味的編碼特徵、身分與辨識，以及組成比例三個角度出發，分別構思模式辨識、氣味導引迷宮與指紋混合器。","Our teammates played the first versions. One could not pass even the easiest level. Another said the instructions gave no idea where to start. A third said the games matched our design intent, but that our target audience might need to be redefined. We learned that what felt easy to the designers was not easy for anyone else.":"隊員試玩第一版時，有人連最簡單的關卡都過不了，有人說看完說明仍不知道如何開始，也有人認為遊戲符合設計意圖，但可能需要重新界定目標族群。我們學到，設計者覺得簡單，不代表其他人也如此。","We tested the prototypes with 32 people. In Pattern Recognition, players said there were too many patterns to remember. In the Mixer, players reported that they never succeeded and found it too complex. In the Labyrinth, players said the controls were not smooth and did not understand what the E and Q keys did.":"我們邀請 32 人測試原型。模式辨識的玩家覺得要記住的圖案太多；混合器玩家反映從未成功、過於複雜；迷宮玩家則認為操作不順，也不清楚 E 與 Q 鍵的功能。","At the Shan-chi Elementary School science camp, we projected the game for the whole class. The pupils found it too difficult at first, so we adjusted the difficulty and created three levels, letting each group find a suitable option. One pupil wrote on a worksheet: \"Today I played the memory game. It was really hard! I thought it was really fun!”":"在山崎國小科學營中，我們將遊戲投影給全班。學生一開始覺得太難，因此我們調整難度並設立三個等級，讓各組找到適合的選項。一位學生在學習單寫道：「今天我玩了記憶遊戲，真的很難！但我覺得很好玩！」","The released version answers what we heard. Junior levels use smaller patterns and let players review before the quiz. The Junior Mixer starts with two scent cards and a simple mix. Challenge levels use closer lookalikes and hidden patterns for players who want more. For educators, workshops can switch on paired pre/post questions with anonymous data export, while everyday visitors are never quizzed. Progress is stored only in the player's own browser.":"發布版本回應了這些意見：初階使用較小的圖案，作答前可再複習；初階混合器從兩張氣味卡與簡單混合開始；挑戰等級則提供更相似、隱藏的模式。教育者可啟用配對前後測並匯出匿名資料，一般訪客不必作答。進度只儲存在玩家自己的瀏覽器中。","The games taught us three things.":"遊戲教會我們三件事。","First, difficulty is a design decision, not a detail. Teammates, members of the public and primary-school pupils all hit the same wall at the start. Three levels now let each learner begin where they can succeed, and the same structure lets a teacher use one game from primary school to university.":"第一，難度是設計決策，不是小細節。隊員、一般民眾與國小學生起初都遇到同樣的障礙。三種難度讓學習者從能成功的起點開始，也讓教師能將同一款遊戲用於國小到大學。","Second, fun is not the same as learning. At the camp, many worksheets mentioned only that the game was fun. This is why each game now links to a Science page and why educators can add paired pre/post questions. These let us measure learning, not just enjoyment, in future workshops.":"第二，好玩不等於學會。營隊中許多學習單只提到遊戲很好玩，因此每款遊戲現在都連結科學頁面，教育者也能加入配對前後測，讓未來工作坊評估學習，而不只是樂趣。","Third, players' struggles confirmed our own design. When players could not remember enough patterns, or could not separate overlapping fingerprints by eye, they experienced the exact problem AeroSense is built to solve. Humans are poor at decoding overlapping receptor patterns, which is why our sensor relies on computational decoding rather than on a person reading the signal.":"第三，玩家的困難印證了我們的設計出發點。當玩家記不住足夠的模式，或無法用肉眼分離重疊指紋時，他們正體驗 AeroSense 想解決的問題。人類不擅長解碼重疊的受體模式，因此我們的感測器仰賴計算解碼，而非由人直接判讀訊號。","Post 1, Parts Design: \"We put a fruit fly's nose inside a human cell.\" Explains how a fruit fly odor receptor and a calcium-sensitive glow protein, placed in human cells, turn a smell into light: an odor molecule binds the receptor, calcium flows in, and the cell lights up. The response becomes a measurable change in fluorescence.":"貼文 1，生物元件設計：「我們把果蠅的鼻子放進人類細胞。」說明果蠅氣味受體與鈣敏感螢光蛋白如何在人類細胞中把氣味變成光：氣味分子結合受體，鈣離子流入，細胞發光，反應因而轉為可量測的螢光變化。","Post 2, Model: \"The cell lit up. Now what?\" How a circuit modeled on the fruit fly brain turns the glow into a decision.":"貼文 2，模型：「細胞亮了，然後呢？」介紹仿果蠅腦電路如何將螢光轉為決策。","Flagging a batch of bananas or mangoes before disease symptoms are visible points to SDG 2, Zero Hunger. The goal of low-power, on-device odor interpretation points to SDG 9, Industry, Innovation and Infrastructure. A reusable, non-destructive sensing cartridge points to SDG 12, Responsible Consumption and Production. And the interviews with an e-nose company's chief scientist, several biotech companies, and an analytical-instrumentation professor point to SDG 17, Partnerships for the Goals.":"在病徵可見之前標記一批香蕉或芒果，呼應 SDG 2 消除飢餓；低功耗、裝置端氣味判讀目標呼應 SDG 9 產業、創新與基礎建設；可重用、非破壞式感測匣呼應 SDG 12 責任消費與生產；與電子鼻公司首席科學家、多家生技公司及分析儀器教授的訪談，則呼應 SDG 17 夥伴關係。","Series 3: Blog Articles.":"系列 3：部落格文章。","We publish long-form articles on":"我們在以下平台發布長篇文章：",", a popular-science blog on computational neuroscience run by Prof.":"，這是由國立清華大學","'s lab at National Tsing Hua University. Since 2017, the blog has published hundreds of articles in Traditional Chinese for general readers, giving our writing a home and an audience beyond our iGEM season.":"教授實驗室經營的計算神經科學科普部落格。自 2017 年起已發布數百篇面向一般讀者的繁體中文文章，讓我們的寫作在 iGEM 賽季之外仍有刊載空間與讀者。","Each article takes one recent study on fruit fly olfaction and explains it for non-specialists: the question it asks, how the experiment works, what it found, and what it still cannot tell us. A deep-tech tour then connects the finding to AeroSense, explaining which part of the fly's smell system inspired our design and where biology and engineering differ.":"每篇文章選取近期果蠅嗅覺研究，向非專業讀者解釋研究問題、實驗方式、發現及仍無法回答的事，再透過深入技術導覽連結 AeroSense，說明果蠅嗅覺系統哪一部分啟發設計，以及生物與工程的差異。","We treat social media as a reach channel, not a measurement tool. Over the posting period, our feed posts reached more than 1,700 accounts, our stories more than 1,400, and our reels more than 500, with an average of about 50 likes per post. We gained more than 100 new followers, and more than 50 people answered the Sustainability Pop Quiz stories, getting about 75% correct on average. Our best-performing post was Post 1, “We put a fruit fly's nose inside a human cell.” Most of our audience was aged 20 to 30.":"我們把社群媒體視為接觸受眾的管道，而非量測工具。發文期間，一般貼文觸及超過 1,700 個帳號、限時動態超過 1,400 個、短影音超過 500 個，每篇平均約 50 個讚。新增追蹤者超過 100 人，超過 50 人回答永續快問快答限時動態，平均答對約 75%。表現最佳的是貼文 1：「我們把果蠅的鼻子放進人類細胞。」受眾多數為 20 至 30 歲。","These numbers show interest, not learning. Saves, poll responses and comment questions do not establish understanding; the games and Learning Lab provide opportunities to assess it more directly. In comparable in-person outreach, including street booths and pub-quiz events, we observed that this content often attracted people already interested in science.":"這些數字反映興趣，而非學習。收藏、投票回答與留言問題不能確立理解程度；遊戲與 Learning Lab 提供更直接的評估機會。在街頭攤位、酒吧問答等類似實體推廣中，我們觀察到這些內容經常吸引原本就對科學感興趣的人。","Explore the student gallery ↗":"探索學生作品藝廊 ↗","3. AeroSense Learning Lab — the Online Curriculum":"3. AeroSense Learning Lab — 線上課程","Open an individual module":"開啟個別模組","More than 500 people have gone through the Learning Lab. Because Module 2 reuses the survey's statements word for word, we can compare learners' answers with our public survey baseline. Learning Lab learners answered correctly 97% of the time on visible mold (survey: 78%), 92% on heating (survey: 64%) and 85% on appearance and smell (survey: 58%). The largest gaps were on the two misconceptions the public held most often.":"超過 500 人使用過 Learning Lab。模組 2 逐字重用調查中的陳述，因此能將學習者回答與公眾調查基準比較。Learning Lab 學習者在可見黴菌題的答對率為 97%（調查為 78%）、加熱題為 92%（64%）、外觀與氣味題為 85%（58%）。差距最大的正是公眾最常持有的兩項迷思。","Correct-answer rates for three common misconceptions. Dark bars show the public survey baseline; light bars show Learning Lab learners answering the same statements in Module 2 (n = 521). These are different groups, not a pre/post test of the same learners. Learners chose to take the course and answered immediately after the module; the comparison describes short-term understanding and does not isolate a course effect.":"三項常見迷思的答對率。深色長條為公眾調查基準，淺色長條為 Learning Lab 學習者在模組 2 回答相同陳述的結果（n = 521）。兩者是不同族群，並非同一批學習者的前後測。學習者自行選擇修課並於模組結束後立即作答；比較描述短期理解，無法單獨確立課程效果。","Learners told us two things, and we changed the platform in response. First, the interface was unclear and the opening had too much text, so we cut the text and separated sections with color blocks. Second, the opening was too difficult. To make the platform accessible to more people, we lowered the difficulty of the opening and closing sections and added hands-on tasks, so that learners understand by doing.":"學習者提出兩項意見，我們據此修改平台。首先，介面不清楚、開頭文字太多，因此精簡文字並用色塊分隔段落；其次，開頭太難，因此降低開頭與結尾的難度，加入動手任務，讓更多人透過實作理解。","The Learning Lab is not only a self-learning tool but also designed to be used by educators. Printable discussion prompts help turn individual reading into class discussion. We have already used it this way. In our Olfactory Neuroscience Workshop with Prof. Chung-Chuan Lo, we ran one module live alongside a lecture for university students. After our science camp, the Shan-chi Elementary School principal asked to keep using our approach, so we included Learning Lab instructions in the Teacher Toolkit.":"Learning Lab 也為教育者設計。可列印的討論提示能將個人閱讀轉為課堂討論，我們已實際使用：在與羅中泉教授合作的嗅覺神經科學工作坊中，搭配大學生講座現場進行一個模組。科學營後，山崎國小校長希望持續使用我們的教法，因此教師工具包也納入 Learning Lab 操作說明。","We see the Learning Lab as a companion to biology, food-safety and neuroscience courses. Students can use Module 2 to check their own beliefs before and after a class, and Modules 3 and 4 to read up on how a living-cell sensor and pattern-based decoding work. Because each module is self-contained, future iGEM teams can add a module about their own project and extend the course for students and educators beyond Taiwan. The Learning Lab is freely available to iGEM teams, educators and anyone who wants to teach how biology can sense the world.":"我們將 Learning Lab 視為生物、食品安全與神經科學課程的補充。學生可用模組 2 在課前課後檢查自己的觀念，並透過模組 3、4 理解活細胞感測器與模式解碼。每個模組皆可獨立使用，未來 iGEM 團隊能加入自身專案模組，將課程擴展給臺灣以外的學生與教育者。Learning Lab 免費提供給 iGEM 團隊、教育者，以及所有想教導生物如何感知世界的人。","2. Mini Jamboree (with International iGEM Community)":"2. Mini Jamboree（與國際 iGEM 社群）","4. Teacher Toolkit & Education Guide (Open Resources)":"4. 教師工具包與教育指南（開放資源）","Teacher Toolkit.":"教師工具包。","When we met the principal of the elementary school where we ran our science camp, he told us he liked the way we teach and asked for a way to keep using it, since we cannot visit every year. We packaged the camp into a teacher toolkit: the lesson slides, the Odor Pixel Suite game, and instructions for using the Learning Lab, so that a teacher can run the same session without us. The school welcomed the approach, and the toolkit is free for any teacher to download.":"科學營學校的校長表示喜歡我們的教法，希望在我們無法每年前往時仍可持續使用。因此我們將營隊內容整理成教師工具包，包含教學投影片、Odor Pixel Suite 遊戲與 Learning Lab 操作說明，讓教師不需我們在場也能開課。學校歡迎這項做法，工具包供所有教師免費下載。","Education Guide.":"教育指南。","The Education Guide is written for other teams, as a PDF on our Contribution page. It sets out the steps we followed: find out what your audience believes, choose one claim, match the format to the audience, measure the same way each time, and hand the work on, so that a team that has never met us can plan its own education work.":"教育指南是寫給其他團隊的 PDF，位於貢獻頁。指南說明我們的步驟：了解受眾相信什麼、選擇一項主張、讓形式符合受眾、每次採用一致的量測方式，以及交接成果，讓從未見過我們的團隊也能規劃自己的教育工作。","Find the Education Guide on Contribution":"於貢獻頁查閱教育指南","We asked participants of the elementary school science camp, the olfactory neuroscience workshop and other activities to draw \"the electronic nose and the fruit fly as you imagine them,\" and we treat their drawings as a creative output of our education work. What a learner draws shows what they took away in their own terms, which a quiz cannot show. The drawings are displayed on our Art Gallery below.":"我們邀請國小科學營、嗅覺神經科學工作坊及其他活動參與者畫出「你想像中的電子鼻與果蠅」，並將畫作視為教育工作的創意成果。畫作呈現學習者以自己的方式理解到什麼，這是測驗無法呈現的。作品展示於下方藝廊。","We began by assuming that the problem was a lack of knowledge about mold. Our survey tested that assumption and revealed a narrower need. Most respondents knew mold was dangerous, but many still trusted heat, appearance or smell to judge whether food was safe. Every activity on this page carries that one testable claim from first contact, through structured learning, to outside feedback and handover. Learning Lab learners answered the three misconception statements correctly far more often than the survey baseline did, with the largest gap, 28 percentage points, on heating. The comparison is between different groups, not a paired pre/post assessment.":"起初我們假設問題是缺乏黴菌知識；調查檢驗了這個假設，發現更聚焦的需求。多數受訪者知道黴菌危險，卻仍相信加熱、外觀或氣味能判斷食品安全。本頁每項活動都從初次接觸、結構化學習，到外部回饋與交接，持續追蹤同一項可檢驗主張。Learning Lab 學習者在三項迷思陳述的答對率均高於調查基準，最大差距是加熱題的 28 個百分點。這是不同族群的比較，不是配對前後測。","In the fly brain, learning does not stop at the output. Dopaminergic neurons feed the outcome back into the mushroom body and change how the fly responds the next time. Our education worked the same way, and our audiences changed our project as much as we taught them:":"果蠅腦的學習不止於輸出。多巴胺神經元將結果回饋至蕈狀體，改變下次反應。我們的教育也如此；受眾改變專案的程度，不亞於我們教導他們：","At SynBioBeta, questions about regulating a living-cell medical device moved our first application from medical diagnostics to agricultural and food-safety screening.":"在 SynBioBeta，關於活細胞醫療器材法規的提問，促使我們將首個應用由醫療診斷轉向農業與食品安全篩檢。","Survey respondents ranked avoiding false negatives and clear next steps among their top needs. This reinforced our choice to screen and triage rather than certify, with no \"SAFE\" output.":"調查受訪者將避免偽陰性與明確後續步驟列為首要需求，強化了我們採篩檢與分流、而非認證的選擇，也不提供「安全」輸出。","Students at China Medical University asked how the model turns readings into a decision, which changed how we taught the model at our next workshop.":"中國醫藥大學學生詢問模型如何把讀值轉為決策，改變了我們在下一場工作坊講解模型的方式。","Learners, playtesters and pupils found our tools too text-heavy or too hard, so we simplified the Learning Lab and gave every game three levels.":"學習者、試玩者與學生覺得工具文字太多或太難，因此我們簡化 Learning Lab，並讓每款遊戲都有三種難度。","A principal asked to repeat the lesson without us, so we built the Teacher Toolkit.":"校長希望在我們不在場時重複課程，因此我們製作教師工具包。","Across all of these signals, our audiences mostly asked what a result means and what to do next. That is the question AeroSense is built to answer, and the one our education will keep asking.":"這些回饋中，受眾最常問的是結果代表什麼，以及接下來該怎麼做。這正是 AeroSense 想回答、教育工作也將持續追問的問題。","Correct-answer rates: public survey 78%, 64%, 58%; Learning Lab learners 97%, 92%, 85% for visible mold, heating, and appearance and smell.":"可見黴菌、加熱、外觀與氣味三題答對率：公眾調查為 78%、64%、58%；Learning Lab 學習者為 97%、92%、85%。","The online Mini Jamboree project exchange.":"線上 Mini Jamboree 專案交流。","Engineering changed the mammalian expression backbone, reporter architecture, fluorescence reader and decoder evaluation. Sequence review led to pcDNA3.1(+); a weak IRES reporter prompted a GCaMP6f–Orco fusion. Circuit review removed a redundant processor and improved weak-signal protection, while optical and gas models guided the enclosure. Decoder comparisons improved PN encoding and located the learned readout bottleneck. Six receptor-design iterations tested prediction, mutation ranking and molecular access in a separate mosquito reference complex.":"工程工作改變了哺乳類表現骨架、報導架構、螢光讀取器與解碼器評估。序列審查導向 pcDNA3.1(+)；微弱的 IRES 報導訊號促成 GCaMP6f–Orco 融合設計。電路審查移除多餘處理器並改善弱訊號保護，光學與氣體模型則引導外殼設計。解碼器比較改善 PN 編碼並定位學習型讀出瓶頸。六次受體設計迭代在獨立的蚊子參考複合體中，測試預測、突變排序與分子可接觸性。","Engineering approach":"工程方法","Quantile coding improved input resolution; layerwise probes identified the readout loss; a receptor-data comparison set the next measurement target.":"分位數編碼改善輸入解析度；逐層探測定位讀出損失；受體資料比較設定下一個量測目標。","REVIEW-SUPPORTED":"審查支持","DATA":"資料","PROTOTYPE":"原型","before G418 selection. The analysis on":"於 G418 篩選之前。分析見",". The dated documentation review is recorded in Notebook.":"。註明日期的文件審查記錄於實驗紀錄頁。","A lower-gain retest redirects the board diagnosis":"較低增益重測改變電路板診斷方向","Earlier integration package.":"早期整合套件。",". Cycles 1–3 cover electronics; Cycles 4–5 cover computational design and documentation. Cycle 6 records the subsequent board tests and gain diagnosis.":"。循環 1–3 涵蓋電子設計；循環 4–5 涵蓋計算設計與文件；循環 6 記錄後續電路板測試與增益診斷。","V1 included a schematic, PCB layout, BOM, footprints, 3D models and DRC/ERC reports. The board was not fabricated.":"V1 包含電路原理圖、PCB 佈局、BOM、封裝、3D 模型與 DRC／ERC 報告。該板未製作。","The V1 archive recorded":"V1 封存紀錄載明","The correspondence made the power requirements concrete: USB-C charging and power-path management, a single cell, a 5 V boost rail and an ESP32 programming interface. A follow-up review moved the ON/OFF function into the boost enable logic.":"往來紀錄具體界定電源需求：USB-C 充電與電源路徑管理、單顆電池、5 V 升壓電源及 ESP32 燒錄介面。後續審查將開關功能移至升壓啟用邏輯。","The reviewed power design moved the user switch from the 5 V output path to the TPS61023 enable logic. Battery undervoltage control and the switch jointly drive EN; this redraw isolates that design change.":"審查後的電源設計將使用者開關從 5 V 輸出路徑移至 TPS61023 啟用邏輯。電池低電壓控制與開關共同驅動 EN；重繪圖聚焦此設計變更。","CONCEPT":"概念","— no physical measurements in this integration archive.":"— 此整合封存資料未包含實體量測。","The historical workbook recorded a development-device budget of USD 2,511.36 (NTD 79,873.79), including PCB design/setup and a custom-filter allowance. This archive preserves the procurement assumptions used during integration.":"歷史工作簿記錄開發裝置預算為 USD 2,511.36（NTD 79,873.79），包含 PCB 設計／開辦費與客製濾光片預留款。封存資料保留整合時採用的採購假設。","conversion snapshot records the historical quotation basis and is retained with that budget. The source quotation was NTD 131,250 for two boards. Shipping, extra taxes, unlisted labor, reprints, cell-culture consumables and replacement of existing facilities remain excluded. Priced PCB materials (USD 61.44) are not added again to the PCBA quote; one PCB material-price row remains unresolved.":"換算快照記錄歷史報價依據，與預算一併保留。來源報價為兩片電路板 NTD 131,250。不含運費、額外稅款、未列人工、重印、細胞培養耗材及既有設施更換。已估價 PCB 材料（USD 61.44）未重複加至 PCBA 報價；仍有一列 PCB 材料價格未解決。","Before the current enclosure, the archive retained a larger integrated body, a removable service tray and a hinged lid. Reviewing the actual meshes makes the mechanical iteration visible without treating the historical dimensions as the current specification.":"目前外殼之前，封存資料保留較大型整合機身、可拆維修托盤與鉸鏈上蓋。檢視實際網格能呈現機構迭代，不會將歷史尺寸當作目前規格。","Historical STL geometry: body, service tray, hinged lid and one of four wells. Each part is independently framed; dimensions are bounding extents in the CAD workflow’s millimetre convention. These views do not reconstruct assembly alignment.":"歷史 STL 幾何：機身、維修托盤、鉸鏈上蓋與四個樣本井之一。各零件獨立取景；尺寸為 CAD 工作流程採毫米慣例的外接範圍。這些視圖未重建組裝對位。","The optional two-piece cap exposes the internal geometry for cleaning and curing. It replaces the one-piece cap with an upper and lower print; the source specifies longer thumbscrews and an additional silicone ring.":"可選雙件式蓋子可露出內部幾何，方便清潔與固化。它以上、下兩件列印零件取代單件式蓋子；來源規定使用更長的手轉螺絲及額外矽膠環。","Investigating a fixed amplifier output":"調查固定的放大器輸出","Lower-gain retest reported; input-node fault unresolved":"已回報較低增益重測；輸入節點故障未解決","iST subsequently reported replacing the TIA feedback resistance from 100 MΩ to 10 kΩ without eliminating output saturation. They then observed that the inverting input was shorted to ground and were still investigating the cause.":"iST 後續回報將 TIA 回授電阻從 100 MΩ 改為 10 kΩ，仍未消除輸出飽和。隨後發現反相輸入對地短路，當時仍在調查原因。","The partner’s follow-up reports persistent saturation after changing feedback resistance from 100 MΩ to 10 kΩ, followed by an observed short from the TIA inverting input to ground. The record ends with the cause still under investigation.":"合作夥伴回報將回授電阻由 100 MΩ 改為 10 kΩ 後仍飽和，接著觀察到 TIA 反相輸入對地短路。紀錄結束時原因仍待調查。","The follow-up changed the next step from gain selection to locating the reported input-to-ground short. After resolving that connection, the same dark, covered-detector and illuminated-detector checks should be repeated.":"後續回報讓下一步從選擇增益改為定位輸入對地短路。修復該連接後，應重做相同的暗處、遮蔽偵測器及照明偵測器檢查。","The supplied record does not document a completed repair or a successful post-repair optical test.":"現有紀錄未證實已完成修復，亦未記錄成功的修復後光學測試。","Current state: computational comparisons identify the readout and data-collection priorities.":"目前狀態：計算比較指出讀出與資料蒐集的優先事項。","Put PN resolution where the data are":"將 PN 解析度配置在資料密集處","Can the network learn gas identity without losing it during encoding?":"網路能否學會氣體身分，並在編碼時保留這些資訊？","Computational comparison":"計算比較","We hypothesized that fixed sparse expansion followed by a learned readout could classify gas-response patterns, but first needed to check whether the PN representation retained the input information.":"我們假設固定稀疏展開加上學習型讀出可分類氣體反應模式，但首先需要確認 PN 表徵是否保留輸入資訊。","We standardized the 128 UCI-270 features, fitted PCA on training data and converted each component to a PN-bin code. We compared equal-width and training-quantile bin edges.":"我們將 UCI-270 的 128 個特徵標準化，在訓練資料上擬合 PCA，並將各成分轉為 PN 分箱編碼，比較等寬與訓練分位數分箱邊界。","On the second principal component, three of twenty equal-width bins contained 90% of the training measurements and eight bins were empty. A linear SVM on the PN code scored macro-F1 0.77 with twenty equal-width bins, 0.93 with sixty-five equal-width bins and 0.98 with twenty quantile bins. This PN-code comparison uses five-fold cross-validation over 13,910 measurements; it is separate from the SNN learning-curve split.":"第二主成分的二十個等寬箱中，三個箱包含 90% 訓練量測，八個箱則為空。PN 編碼上的線性 SVM，在二十個等寬箱時 macro-F1 為 0.77、六十五個等寬箱為 0.93、二十個分位數箱為 0.98。此比較針對 13,910 筆量測進行五折交叉驗證，與 SNN 學習曲線的資料切分不同。","Uniform coverage of a wide numerical range wastes PN resolution on sparse tails. The encoding should follow sample density.":"以均勻間隔涵蓋寬廣數值範圍，會將 PN 解析度浪費在資料稀疏的尾端。編碼應配合樣本密度。","Improve":"改進","We adopted quantile bins and exposed connection probability, APL inhibition, threshold adaptation, learning rate, weight cap and MBON inhibition as configurable settings. The reported SNN run peaks at 0.83, falls to 0.53 at cycle 400 and ends at 0.79; tuning did not remove training instability. See":"我們採用分位數分箱，並將連接機率、APL 抑制、閾值調適、學習率、權重上限與 MBON 抑制設為可調參數。報告的 SNN 執行最高達 0.83，第 400 循環降至 0.53，最後為 0.79；調參並未消除訓練不穩定。請參閱","the full learning curve":"完整學習曲線","Equal-width and quantile PN encoding on UCI-270. The two projections show 11,128 training measurements; the readout bars use all 13,910 measurements in five-fold cross-validation. Bars are means and lines are the source-reported fold spread. These are linear PN-code readouts, not SNN scores.":"UCI-270 的等寬與分位數 PN 編碼。兩張投影圖呈現 11,128 筆訓練量測；讀出長條則以全部 13,910 筆量測進行五折交叉驗證。長條為平均值，線段為來源回報的各折分散程度。這是 PN 編碼的線性讀出，不是 SNN 分數。","Locate the loss before redesigning the network":"重新設計網路前先定位損失","After parameter tuning, which representation limits the final decision?":"調參後，哪一層表徵限制了最終決策？","We compared access to class information at every stage instead of diagnosing the model from its final score alone.":"我們比較各階段可取得的類別資訊，而非僅從最終分數診斷模型。","For the 800-cycle UCI run, we reconstructed standardized features, PCA values and PN/KC/MBON spike counts for the recorded test presentations. Each representation received a linear-SVM probe. Repeated presentations of one measurement stayed in the same cross-validation fold.":"對 800 循環 UCI 執行，我們依記錄的測試呈現重建標準化特徵、PCA 值及 PN／KC／MBON 脈衝計數。每種表徵皆以線性 SVM 探測。同一量測的重複呈現保留在相同交叉驗證折中。","The shared five-fold comparison contains 1,799 presentations from 1,322 measurements. Macro-F1 progresses from 0.97 (features) to 0.96 (PCA), 0.92 (PN), 0.89 (KC) and 0.79 (MBON). The network’s most-active-MBON answer also scores 0.79.":"共同的五折比較包含 1,322 筆量測的 1,799 次呈現。macro-F1 由特徵的 0.97，依序變為 PCA 0.96、PN 0.92、KC 0.89、MBON 0.79。網路以最活躍 MBON 作答的分數也是 0.79。","The largest adjacent loss is at the KC→MBON readout. The KC representation supports a stronger linear classifier than the trained network uses.":"相鄰層最大的損失發生在 KC→MBON 讀出。KC 表徵可支持比已訓練網路更強的線性分類器。","We made layerwise probes part of the comparison protocol and identified the learned readout as the next redesign target. A future readout change should be evaluated on fixed folds and independent runs; this cycle does not claim that such a redesign has already succeeded.":"我們將逐層探測納入比較流程，並以學習型讀出作為下個重新設計目標。未來應以固定折數與獨立執行評估讀出變更；本循環不宣稱這項重新設計已成功。","UCI layerwise comparison, also shown in Model":"UCI 逐層比較，亦見模型頁",". Five measurement-grouped folds cover 1,799 presentations from 1,322 measurements after 800 training cycles. Bars are means; lines show source-reported fold spread.":"。800 個訓練循環後，五個依量測分組的折涵蓋 1,322 筆量測的 1,799 次呈現。長條為平均值，線段為來源回報的各折分散程度。","Match coding resolution to receptor-data scale":"使編碼解析度符合受體資料規模","Can the pipeline classify chemical families from the receptors used by AeroSense?":"流程能否以 AeroSense 使用的受體分類化學家族？","We moved from repeated metal-oxide gas measurements to published DoOR responses for the ten fly receptors in our cell-line panel. This changes the prediction task to chemical-family classification of distinct odorants.":"我們從重複金屬氧化物氣體量測，轉向已發表 DoOR 中、對應細胞株面板十種果蠅受體的反應。預測任務因而改為不同氣味分子的化學家族分類。","We retained 91 odorants measured on at least eight receptors, imputed missing values within training folds, and compared the SNN with logistic-regression readouts on the same five stratified odorant folds.":"保留至少有八種受體量測的 91 種氣味分子，在訓練折內補值，並於相同五個分層氣味分子折上，比較 SNN 與邏輯斯迴歸讀出。","With twenty equal-width bins, the SNN scores 0.46 and a linear PN-code readout 0.52, compared with 0.69 from raw receptor values. Sixteen bins on the second component contain at most two odorants, while one contains 40. Five quantile bins increase the linear PN-code score to 0.66; the associated SNN configuration reaches 0.52.":"二十個等寬箱下，SNN 得分 0.46、線性 PN 編碼讀出為 0.52，原始受體數值則為 0.69。第二成分的十六個箱各最多只有兩種氣味分子，一個箱卻有 40 種。五個分位數箱使線性 PN 編碼分數提升至 0.66，對應 SNN 設定達到 0.52。","Fine bins fragment the small dataset. The SNN comparison also changes PN→KC probability from 0.05 to 0.2 and training duration from 200 to 100 cycles, so it does not isolate binning as the sole cause of improvement. The separate Test1 cell comparison does not yet establish agreement with DoOR.":"過細分箱將小型資料集切得過度零碎。SNN 比較也將 PN→KC 機率由 0.05 改為 0.2、訓練由 200 改為 100 循環，因此不能將改善單獨歸因於分箱。獨立的 Test1 細胞比較尚未確立與 DoOR 一致。","We adopted the coarser quantile configuration as the candidate and set a wet-lab target of three to five independent wells per odorant–receptor condition. Replicated cell acquisition and a prespecified transfer test remain future work; DoOR consensus values are not substituted for cell measurements.":"我們採用較粗的分位數設定作為候選，並設定每個氣味分子–受體條件需三至五個獨立孔的濕實驗目標。重複細胞擷取與預先指定的轉移測試仍待完成；DoOR 共識值不能替代細胞量測。","DoOR encoding comparison for 91 odorants. Projections show chemical families; bars compare the PN-code logistic regression and SNN on five folds. The SNN configurations differ in binning, connection probability and training cycles. Fold spread is retained as supplied.":"91 種氣味分子的 DoOR 編碼比較。投影圖呈現化學家族；長條比較五折 PN 編碼邏輯斯迴歸與 SNN。SNN 設定在分箱、連接機率及訓練循環數上有所不同，保留來源提供的各折分散程度。","We changed the PN code to follow training-data density, added measurement-grouped layerwise probes, and adapted the code to a small receptor dataset. The new evidence supports a specific next step—readout comparison and replicated biological input—not a completed cell-based odor classifier.":"我們讓 PN 編碼配合訓練資料密度，加入依量測分組的逐層探測，並調整編碼以符合小型受體資料集。新證據支持明確的下一步：比較讀出與取得重複生物輸入；尚不是完成的細胞氣味分類器。","Methods, uncertainty and source availability":"方法、不確定性與來源可用性","Earlier preprocessing and precision-audit cycles":"早期前處理與精度稽核循環","This earlier record is retained for its data-cleaning, seed and clock-audit evidence. Its scores and fixed-seed candidates do not describe the newer UCI/DoOR configurations above.":"保留這份早期紀錄，是為了保存資料清理、種子與時鐘稽核證據。其分數與固定種子候選並不代表上方新版 UCI／DoOR 設定。","Financial planning preview — PDF":"財務規劃預覽 — PDF","The correspondence records design requests and partner observations, not a measured improvement in noise, standby current or repaired-board performance. The historical split-cap option also lacks seal and biocompatibility validation. The unresolved short cannot be assigned a confirmed root cause from the supplied update.":"往來紀錄記載設計需求與夥伴觀察，而非雜訊、待機電流或修復後電路板效能的實測改善。歷史雙件式蓋子也缺乏密封與生物相容性驗證。無法依現有更新為未解決短路指定已確認的根本原因。","Human Practices decisions and interviews":"人文實踐決策與訪談","Technical engineering evidence":"技術工程證據","The public guide brings together the reviewed power change, historical CAD geometry and unresolved TIA diagnostic. Original correspondence remains private; the technical summary omits contact and invoice details.":"公開指南整合審查後的電源變更、歷史 CAD 幾何與未解決的 TIA 診斷。原始往來紀錄保持私人；技術摘要省略聯絡與發票細節。","Illustrated engineering evidence guide · PDF":"圖解工程證據指南 · PDF","The financial planning preview is linked above; the editable workbook is retained in the research archive.":"上方連結提供財務規劃預覽；可編輯工作簿保留於研究封存資料。","Initial KiCad schematic (PDF)":"初版 KiCad 原理圖（PDF）","Current schematic (PDF)":"目前原理圖（PDF）","Materials and equipment cost reference · PDF":"材料與設備成本參考 · PDF","Developer Manual R6 (PDF)":"開發者手冊 R6（PDF）","Anonymized assembly feedback (PDF)":"匿名化組裝回饋（PDF）","Initial output switch and revised AND-gate enable control for TPS61023":"初版輸出開關與修訂後 TPS61023 AND 閘啟用控制","Exact historical STL views of the body, service tray, hinged lid and sample well":"機身、維修托盤、鉸鏈上蓋與樣本井的實際歷史 STL 視圖","Exact original one-piece cap and alternative lower and upper STL pieces":"原始單件式蓋子與替代上下兩件 STL 的實際視圖","Reported gain reduction, observed input-to-ground short, and unresolved diagnostic status":"回報的增益降低、觀察到的輸入對地短路，以及未解決診斷狀態","Equal-width and quantile PN encoding on UCI-270":"UCI-270 的等寬與分位數 PN 編碼","The same UCI layerwise comparison shown in Model Figure 7: five folds grouped by measurement over 1,799 presentations of 1,322 measurements, after 800 training cycles":"與模型圖 7 相同的 UCI 逐層比較：800 個訓練循環後，將 1,322 筆量測的 1,799 次呈現依量測分為五折","DoOR encoding comparison for 91 odorants":"91 種氣味分子的 DoOR 編碼比較","golden strategy diagram":"黃金圈策略圖","market strategy diagram":"市場策略圖","Total addressable market Global scope":"總潛在市場：全球範圍","Serviceable available market Application + geography":"可服務市場：應用與地理區域","Serviceable obtainable market Reachable beachhead":"可取得市場：可觸及的灘頭市場","thinking strategy diagram":"設計思考策略圖","01 Empathize":"01 同理","02 Define":"02 定義","03 Ideate":"03 發想","04 Prototype":"04 原型","05 Test":"05 測試","06 Iterate":"06 迭代","bmc strategy diagram":"商業模式圖","Key partners 01":"關鍵夥伴 01","Key activities 02":"關鍵活動 02","Key resources 03":"關鍵資源 03","Value propositions 04":"價值主張 04","Customer relationships 05":"顧客關係 05","Channels 07":"通路 07","Customer segments 06":"顧客區隔 06","Cost structure 08":"成本結構 08","Revenue streams 09":"收入來源 09","barriers strategy diagram":"進出障礙策略圖","Low entry Low exit Explore this scenario":"低進入、低退出障礙：探索此情境","Low entry High exit Explore this scenario":"低進入、高退出障礙：探索此情境","High entry Low exit Explore this scenario":"高進入、低退出障礙：探索此情境","High entry High exit Explore this scenario":"高進入、高退出障礙：探索此情境","SWOT: internal and external, positive and negative factors":"SWOT：內外部、正負向因素","Influence and interest stakeholder map":"影響力與關注度利害關係人圖","value strategy diagram":"價值策略圖","Products &amp; services":"產品與服務","PEST: four perspectives on the operating environment":"PEST：營運環境的四個面向","Political":"政治","This page presents three laboratory workflows: fly-brain imaging, bacterial cloning and plasmid preparation, and HEK293 expression and odor-response testing. Each track documents its preparation, acquisition and protocol steps.":"本頁呈現三種實驗流程：果蠅腦影像、細菌克隆與質體製備，以及 HEK293 表現與氣味反應測試。各主題記錄準備、擷取及實驗步驟。","The reference study used FuGene HD in HEK293 stable lines":"參考研究在 HEK293 穩定細胞株中使用 FuGene HD",". AeroSense retains its own delivery specification and sample record.":"。AeroSense 保留自己的遞送規格與樣本紀錄。","Fixed-cell endpoint images and Test 1 fluorescence time courses are archived in":"固定細胞終點影像與 Test 1 螢光時間序列封存於","The supplied HEK293 images were acquired approximately 44–48 h after transfection and before G418 selection. Cells were fixed with 2% paraformaldehyde, without permeabilization, then stained with DAPI. Blue images show DAPI; matching field numbers identify the same field across channels. Exposure was held constant within each channel across groups, and blank calibration was performed. Fixation duration, numerical exposure settings and the complete acquisition log were not supplied.":"所提供 HEK293 影像於轉染後約 44–48 小時、G418 篩選前取得。細胞以 2% 多聚甲醛固定，未通透化，再以 DAPI 染色。藍色影像為 DAPI；相同視野編號表示不同通道的同一視野。各組同一通道曝光保持一致，並執行空白校正。未提供固定時間、數值曝光設定與完整擷取紀錄。","The acquired record comprises endpoint microscopy and Test 1 kinetics. Reporter-specific controls are described in the":"已取得紀錄包括終點顯微影像與 Test 1 動態資料。報導蛋白專屬對照說明於","Odor-test acquisition and analysis":"氣味測試擷取與分析",", 5 mM HEPES-Na and 20 mM glucose, at pH 7.3 and 340 mOsm. The team reports initially aqueous VOC preparations subsequently diluted into this buffer. Final VOC concentrations are unknown. VUAA1 uses DMSO (Protech, inventory supplier); the exact Test 1 bottle and lot, final DMSO fraction and an equivalent DMSO-only vehicle condition are not documented. The source report lists nominal final VUAA1 at 50 µM, without an independently verified preparation record.":"、5 mM HEPES-Na 與 20 mM 葡萄糖，pH 7.3、340 mOsm。團隊回報 VOC 起初以水配製，再稀釋至此緩衝液；最終 VOC 濃度未知。VUAA1 使用 DMSO（庫存供應商 Protech）；Test 1 實際試劑瓶與批號、最終 DMSO 比例及等量純 DMSO 溶劑對照未記錄。來源報告名目最終 VUAA1 為 50 µM，但無獨立核實的配製紀錄。","Numeric gains, final VOC concentrations, exact addition delays and a matched DMSO-only condition are unavailable. The source records partial detachment without quantifying it. Test 1 contains one well per condition × stimulus and no independent culture repeats;":"未提供數值增益、最終 VOC 濃度、確切加液延遲或匹配的純 DMSO 對照。來源記錄部分細胞脫落，但未量化。Test 1 每個條件 × 刺激僅一孔，無獨立培養重複；","Read the Test 1 result →":"閱讀 Test 1 結果 →","Test 2: two-acquisition odor panel":"Test 2：兩次擷取的氣味面板","Test 2 contains 72 wells and 1,440 readings. Rows A, D, E, F, G and H contain VUAA1, isopentyl acetate, 2-heptanone, valeric acid, pentyl acetate and DMSO control, respectively. VUAA1 was diluted 1:100; the odor solutions were diluted 1:1,000, with 0.1% DMSO reported. Stock concentrations were not supplied.":"Test 2 包含 72 孔、1,440 筆讀值。A、D、E、F、G、H 列分別為 VUAA1、乙酸異戊酯、2-庚酮、戊酸、乙酸戊酯及 DMSO 對照。VUAA1 稀釋 1:100；氣味溶液稀釋 1:1,000，回報 DMSO 為 0.1%。未提供原液濃度。","Positions 1–12 are Or7a + ORCO, Or19a + ORCO, Or42a + ORCO, Or98a + ORCO, Or22a + ORCO, Or67a + ORCO, Or67b + ORCO, Or59b + ORCO, Or85b + ORCO, Or35a + ORCO, ORCO only and blank. F0 contains five reads over 0–48 s; post-addition contains fifteen reads over 0–168 s, both at 12 s intervals. Each acquisition starts its own clock.":"位置 1–12 分別為 Or7a + ORCO、Or19a + ORCO、Or42a + ORCO、Or98a + ORCO、Or22a + ORCO、Or67a + ORCO、Or67b + ORCO、Or59b + ORCO、Or85b + ORCO、Or35a + ORCO、僅 ORCO 與空白。F0 在 0–48 秒取得五筆讀值；加液後在 0–168 秒取得十五筆，皆每 12 秒一次。兩次擷取各自從零計時。","Results defines the endpoint correction and VUAA1-reference normalization.":"結果頁定義終點修正與 VUAA1 參考正規化。","post-addition fluorescence dynamic reanalysis":"加液後螢光動態重新分析","The supplied post-addition fluorescence workbook retains 1,080 readings: six conditions × twelve channels × fifteen readings, at 12 s intervals from 0 to 168 s. For each well, E is the mean at 0, 12 and 24 s and L is the mean at 144, 156 and 168 s. D = L/E − 1; the vehicle-referenced contrast is C = D":"所提供加液後螢光工作簿保留 1,080 筆讀值：六種條件 × 十二通道 × 十五次讀取，從 0 至 168 秒每 12 秒一次。每孔 E 為 0、12、24 秒平均，L 為 144、156、168 秒平均。D = L/E − 1；溶劑參考對比為 C = D","for the same channel. We report 100C in percentage points. F0 does not enter this calculation; VUAA1 remains a reference record and is not a denominator or exclusion criterion.":"，以同一通道比較。我們以百分點報告 100C。F0 不參與此計算；VUAA1 保留為參考紀錄，不作分母或排除標準。","The delivered channel order is Or7a, Or19a, Or42a, Or98a, Or22a, Or67a, Or67b, Or59b, Or85b, Or35a, ORCO only and blank. Analysis follows the workbook’s channel labels and source-cell provenance. DMSO fraction and addition volume were matched as confirmed by the experimenter. Pearson and Spearman correlations are calculated separately for each odorant across the ten tuning ORs, using DoOR consensus minus each receptor’s spontaneous firing rate. The missing Or42a–valeric acid reference is omitted from that correlation only. Controls are retained separately, and all signed contrasts are preserved.":"交付通道順序為 Or7a、Or19a、Or42a、Or98a、Or22a、Or67a、Or67b、Or59b、Or85b、Or35a、僅 ORCO 與空白。分析遵循工作簿通道標籤與來源儲存格紀錄。實驗者確認 DMSO 比例與加液體積已匹配。對每種氣味分子，分別以十種調諧 OR 計算 Pearson 與 Spearman 相關，參考值為 DoOR 共識減去各受體自發放電率。缺少的 Or42a–戊酸參考值只從該項相關計算排除。對照獨立保留，所有帶正負號的對比均保留。","Reproduction and validation code":"重現與驗證程式","The Test 1 pilot at approximately 72 h post-transfection was also measured without G418. Neither Test 1 nor the 44–48 h microscopy batch supplies a post-selection outcome.":"轉染後約 72 小時的 Test 1 先導測試同樣未使用 G418。Test 1 與 44–48 小時顯微影像批次皆未提供篩選後結果。","The G418 sulfate stock is recorded at 50 mg/mL. The schedule below is the documented literature-informed reference protocol. The acquired 44–48 h microscopy and approximately 72 h Test 1 records both precede G418 selection.":"G418 sulfate 原液記錄為 50 mg/mL。下列時程為依文獻建立並記錄的參考流程。44–48 小時顯微影像及約 72 小時 Test 1 紀錄皆在 G418 篩選前取得。","The team confirmed completion of the post-G418 odor test. Its measurements are not archived. Test 1 is a separate pre-selection pilot.":"團隊確認已完成 G418 後氣味測試，但量測尚未封存。Test 1 是另一項篩選前先導試驗。","The 384-well design below is a literature-based reference method, separate from both Test 1 and the recorded post-selection activity.":"下列 384 孔設計為文獻參考方法，與 Test 1 及已記錄的篩選後活動均不同。","For the acquired 96-well Test 1 pilot, see":"已取得的 96 孔 Test 1 先導資料，請見","These equations describe the cited relative-response method. The acquired Test 1 data use the":"這些方程式描述引用的相對反應方法。實際 Test 1 資料使用","Test 1 analysis":"Test 1 分析","Living-cell integration":"活細胞整合","AeroSense combines four replaceable 100 µL wells, frequency-tagged blue LEDs, a filtered photodiode, ESP32 acquisition and a local phone interface. An eight-part enclosure fixes the optical geometry and separates sample gas from electronics cooling. Optical and airflow simulations guided filter selection and the inlet shelf; assembly feedback informed the manual. Fluorescein measurements resolve four frequency channels, quantify cross-well responses and test calibration under isolated and simultaneous loading.":"AeroSense 結合四個可替換的 100 µL 樣本井、頻率標記藍光 LED、具濾光片的光電二極體、ESP32 擷取與本機手機介面。八件式外殼固定光學幾何，將樣本氣體與電子散熱分開。光學與氣流模擬引導濾光片及入口平台設計，組裝回饋則用於修訂手冊。螢光素量測分離四個頻率通道、量化跨井反應，並在單井與同時載入條件下測試校正。","The intended well contributes 88.6–90.9% of each modeled readout. The same matrix is used in Model and in verification":"目標樣本井占各模擬讀出的 88.6–90.9%。模型頁與驗證使用相同矩陣",", which compares the displayed response distributions with measured single-well controls. These percentages describe response distribution, not a fraction of all emitted fluorescence.":"，將顯示的反應分布與實測單井對照比較。這些百分比描述反應分布，並非所有放出螢光中的占比。","GCaMP6f curves are digitized from the calcium-bound traces in Dana et al., Supplementary":"GCaMP6f 曲線取自 Dana 等人補充資料中鈣結合狀態曲線的數位化結果","; excitation is shown over 406–510 nm and emission over 500–646 nm, ending at the digitized limits.":"；激發呈現 406–510 nm，放光呈現 500–646 nm，終點為數位化資料的範圍界限。","Dimensioned engineering drawings":"標註尺寸的工程圖","A01 — Assembly and shared datums.":"A01 — 組裝與共用基準。","Open full-size lossless WebP":"開啟完整尺寸無損 WebP","Lower case / base — B01–B03":"下殼／底座 — B01–B03","B01 — Lower case: shell and service apertures.":"B01 — 下殼：殼體與維修開孔。","B02 — Lower case: floor, fan and mounting pattern.":"B02 — 下殼：底板、風扇及安裝孔位。","B03 — Lower case: fasteners and locating tongue.":"B03 — 下殼：緊固件與定位凸舌。","Upper case / black hood — H01–H03":"上殼／黑色遮光罩 — H01–H03","H01 — Upper case: shell, bridges and hose slots.":"H01 — 上殼：殼體、橋接結構與軟管槽。","H02 — Upper case: well carrier and guide details.":"H02 — 上殼：樣本井座與導引細節。","H03 — Upper case: optical seat and joint section.":"H03 — 上殼：光學座與接合剖面。","Gas lid — L01–L03":"氣室蓋 — L01–L03","L01 — Gas lid: cover and reinforcement.":"L01 — 氣室蓋：蓋板與補強。","L02 — Gas lid: chamber, spigots and deflector.":"L02 — 氣室蓋：腔室、接管與導流板。","L03 — Gas lid: locating lip and screw clearances.":"L03 — 氣室蓋：定位唇與螺絲間隙。","Four mirrored sample wells — W01":"四個鏡像樣本井 — W01","W01 — Four mirrored sample wells.":"W01 — 四個鏡像樣本井。","Gas compression plate — P01":"氣室壓板 — P01","P01 — Removable gas compression plate.":"P01 — 可拆氣室壓板。","Reference-pattern analysis":"參考模式分析","The reader interface sends saved acquisition and calibration records to a local Python backend. For reference analysis, D1–D4 hold Or22a, Or35a, Or85b and Or98a, respectively; the backend reconstructs their ΔF/F₀ curves, averages all four over the same selected response window and returns separate ranked matches against laboratory and DoOR references. The bars show 100 × max(0, Pearson r), a pattern-similarity score rather than an odor probability or validated identification.":"讀取器介面將已儲存的擷取與校正紀錄傳送至本機 Python 後端。參考分析中，D1–D4 分別放置 Or22a、Or35a、Or85b 與 Or98a；後端重建 ΔF/F₀ 曲線，在相同選定反應視窗內分別取四通道平均，並回傳對實驗室與 DoOR 參考的獨立匹配排名。長條為 100 × max(0, Pearson r)，表示模式相似度，而非氣味機率或經驗證的身分辨識。","PCB currency conversion: USD 1 = NTD 32.615, the midpoint of Bank of Taiwan’s USD spot buying and selling rates in the recorded conversion snapshot. Converted amounts are rounded to the nearest dollar.":"PCB 匯率換算：USD 1 = NTD 32.615，為紀錄快照中臺灣銀行美元即期買入與賣出匯率的中點。換算金額四捨五入至整數元。","Verification follows the measured signal from frequency separation through cross-talk comparison, multi-well additivity and concentration checks. Raw records, calibration calculations and residuals link each result to its acquisition conditions.":"驗證沿實測訊號依序檢查頻率分離、串擾比較、多井加成與濃度。原始紀錄、校正計算及殘差將每項結果連結至擷取條件。","The overall Pearson correlation is r = 0.810 across all 16 corresponding matrix entries; the 12 off-diagonal cross-talk entries give r = 0.257.":"全部 16 個對應矩陣元素的整體 Pearson 相關為 r = 0.810；12 個非對角串擾元素為 r = 0.257。","All four measured responses fall below the sum of the isolated-well predictions; D3 reaches only 48.3%. This comparison tests the additivity required to use isolated-well responses for simultaneous loading.":"四個實測反應皆低於單井預測加總，D3 僅達 48.3%。此比較檢驗以單井反應預測同時載入所需的加成性。","The checks compare calibrated estimates with prepared concentrations across loading patterns. Deviations remain at low concentrations and in unequal-well loadings.":"檢查比較不同載入模式下的校正估計與配製濃度。低濃度及各井不等量載入仍有偏差。","We followed four cell-containing wells before and after adding VUAA1 (1:100 dilution).":"我們追蹤四個含細胞樣本井在加入 VUAA1（1:100 稀釋）前後的變化。","D1 contained Or35a + ORCO, D2 Or85b + ORCO, D3 Or98a + ORCO, and D4 ORCO only.":"D1 為 Or35a + ORCO，D2 為 Or85b + ORCO，D3 為 Or98a + ORCO，D4 僅含 ORCO。","Each ten-point trace is normalized to its first reading on the nominal 0–1 min schedule. Late-window contrast is the VUAA1 minus cells-plus-medium change in the last-three-point mean ratio, expressed in percentage points.":"各十點曲線在名目 0–1 分鐘時程上，以自身第一筆讀值正規化。晚期視窗對比為 VUAA1 與細胞加培養液兩組最後三點平均比值變化之差，以百分點表示。","What changes during the readout?":"讀取期間有什麼變化？","D2 and D3 increase relative to their first post-addition readings, D4 rises modestly after a brief dip, and D1 decreases; the cells-plus-medium series change only slightly. D3’s large ratio depends on its low first post-addition reference.":"D2、D3 相對於加液後第一筆讀值上升，D4 短暫下降後略升，D1 則下降；細胞加培養液序列只略有變動。D3 的大比值取決於偏低的加液後第一筆參考。","The final absolute signals remain 7.5%, 6.1%, 5.6% and 2.7% below the initial three-reading means for D1–D4, respectively.":"D1–D4 最終絕對訊號仍分別比初始三次讀值平均低 7.5%、6.1%、5.6% 與 2.7%。","Comparison with wet-lab kinetics":"與濕實驗動態比較","We compared the VUAA1 trajectories with the corresponding Test 2 wells, using each acquisition’s first reading as its own reference. D2 shows the clearest shared rise, while D1 changes in the opposite direction.":"我們將 VUAA1 軌跡與對應 Test 2 孔比較，各次擷取均以自己的第一筆讀值作參考。D2 呈現最清楚的共同上升，D1 則方向相反。","Ten hardware points (0–54 s) and six Test 2 points (0–60 s) are shown as F/Fstart on nominal sampling times. Pearson r and Spearman ρ use only the five native points at 0, 12, 24, 36 and 48 s.":"十個硬體點（0–54 秒）與六個 Test 2 點（0–60 秒）依名目採樣時間呈現 F/Fstart。Pearson r 與 Spearman ρ 僅使用 0、12、24、36、48 秒的五個原生點。","For D1–D4, the matched Pearson correlations are −0.859, +0.972, +0.961 and +0.948; Spearman correlations are −0.80, +0.90, +0.90 and +0.90. The corresponding first-difference correlations are −0.529, +0.650, +0.761 and −0.125. D2 and D3 share positive level and step-to-step trends with their matched wet-lab traces; D1 trends in the opposite direction, while D4 shares less step-to-step variation than its level correlation suggests.":"D1–D4 的匹配 Pearson 相關為 −0.859、+0.972、+0.961、+0.948；Spearman 為 −0.80、+0.90、+0.90、+0.90。一階差分相關為 −0.529、+0.650、+0.761、−0.125。D2、D3 與匹配濕實驗曲線在訊號水準及逐步變化上皆呈正向趨勢；D1 方向相反，D4 的逐步共同變化則弱於水準相關所暗示的程度。","All 16 hardware–wet-lab pairings at 0, 12, 24, 36 and 48 s are shown. Left: Pearson r; right: Spearman ρ of the same five signal levels, each divided by its own first reading. Outlines mark intended construct matches; strong off-diagonal correlations show that similar trends are not pairing-specific. The five serial observations are not biological replicates.":"圖中呈現 0、12、24、36、48 秒全部 16 組硬體–濕實驗配對。左為 Pearson r，右為相同五個訊號水準的 Spearman ρ；各曲線除以自身首筆讀值。外框標示預期構築匹配；強烈的非對角相關顯示相似趨勢並非配對專屬。五個連續觀測並非生物重複。","The assembled reader combines replaceable cell wells, a shared gas chamber and frequency-tagged optical readout in a serviceable enclosure. Fixed optical registration supports repeated calibration, while separate cooling and sample-gas paths avoid using fan operation to set sample delivery. The tested acquisition workflow and revised assembly manual provide a practical starting point for replication.":"組裝完成的讀取器在可維修外殼中結合可替換細胞井、共用氣室與頻率標記光學讀出。固定光學定位支援重複校正；獨立散熱及樣本氣路避免用風扇運作設定樣本輸送。已測試的擷取流程與修訂組裝手冊提供重現的實用起點。","The reader separates four modulation channels, but its isolated-well calibration does not directly transfer to simultaneous loading: uniform 10 µM responses are only 48.3–69.4% of the predicted sum. Likewise, strong same-well responses drive much of the simulation–measurement correlation (r = 0.810); the 12 off-diagonal entries give r = 0.257. The floor-layer simulation and liquid-volume standard have different source conditions, and the measured signal includes electronics. Arbitrary-mixture recovery therefore needs matched single-source and mixed-source controls across concentrations.":"讀取器可分離四個調變通道，但單井校正無法直接轉移至同時載入：均勻 10 µM 反應僅為預測加總的 48.3–69.4%。同樣地，強烈同井反應主導模擬與量測相關（r = 0.810）；12 個非對角元素僅為 r = 0.257。底層模擬與液體體積標準的來源條件不同，實測訊號也包含電子系統。因此任意混合物還原需要不同濃度下匹配的單一來源與混合來源對照。","Viable cells were recovered from printed wells, but the lower viability in the bottom fraction cannot be assigned to resin, culture conditions or recovery without matched controls. Resin choice and post-processing can affect compatibility":"列印井中可回收活細胞，但若無匹配對照，底部分率較低的存活率不能歸因於樹脂、培養條件或回收程序。樹脂選擇與後處理會影響相容性",". Machined PMMA and poly-D-lysine are candidates supported by separate HEK293 studies":"。加工 PMMA 與 poly-D-lysine 是其他 HEK293 研究支持的候選","; comparison with standard culture plastic should measure viability, retained cells, optical background and reporter response under matched conditions.":"；應在匹配條件下與標準培養塑膠比較存活率、細胞留存、光學背景及報導反應。","Airflow calculations describe gas delivery beside fixed liquid surfaces, not cell forces or uniform cellular exposure. Nominal CAD dimensions still require fit and alignment checks. An independent timed assembly and operation trial should test the revised manual, recording assistance and errors.":"氣流計算描述固定液面旁的氣體輸送，不是細胞受力或均勻細胞曝露。名目 CAD 尺寸仍需裝配與對準檢查。應以獨立計時組裝及操作測試驗證新版手冊，記錄所需協助與錯誤。","The single cell run does not separate receptor responses from liquid addition or optical mixing; the fluorescein calibration was not applied to it.":"單次細胞測試無法將受體反應與加液或光學混合分開，也未套用螢光素校正。","Cross-platform similarity is not specific to matched constructs: D2 gives r = 0.9719 with Or85b and 0.9671 with Or98a, and D3 exceeds its strongest off-diagonal match by only 0.0055. D2 and D3 remain positive after omitting the first point (r = 0.970 and 0.904). Control subtraction preserves some shared trends, but preceding hardware-medium readings and separate wet-lab DMSO wells are different references. Serial time points do not establish synchronized kinetics, biological replication or receptor-specific activation.":"跨平台相似性並非匹配構築專屬：D2 與 Or85b 的 r = 0.9719，與 Or98a 為 0.9671；D3 僅比最強非對角匹配高 0.0055。省略首點後，D2、D3 仍為正相關（r = 0.970、0.904）。對照相減保留部分共同趨勢，但先前硬體培養液讀值與獨立濕實驗 DMSO 孔是不同參考。連續時間點不能確立同步動態、生物重複或受體專一性活化。","AeroSense integrates removable wells, filtered optical collection, shared-photodiode electronics and a local phone interface. Fluorescein measurements demonstrate four-frequency separation and quantify source mixing. The measured I/Q matrix, concentration checks and cell-containing-well traces provide a reproducible basis for selecting the next calibration and biological-control experiments.":"AeroSense 整合可拆樣本井、濾光收集、共用光電二極體電子系統與本機手機介面。螢光素量測顯示四頻分離並量化來源混合。實測 I/Q 矩陣、濃度檢查及含細胞井曲線，為選擇下一步校正與生物對照實驗提供可重現依據。","The fluorescein measurement archive and current analysis are downloadable below. The official repository provides code, documents and the linked numerical tables; the separate archive note records the publication status of the complete research package.":"下方可下載螢光素量測封存資料與目前分析。官方儲存庫提供程式、文件與連結數值表格；獨立封存說明記錄完整研究包的發布狀態。","All fluorescein raw data · 58 JSON reports + 58 ADC CSVs — archive availability":"全部螢光素原始資料 · 58 份 JSON 報告 + 58 份 ADC CSV — 封存可用性","Cross-talk calibration analysis source — GitLab":"串擾校正分析來源 — GitLab","Fluorescein calibration analysis source — GitLab":"螢光素校正分析來源 — GitLab","Per-channel calibration analysis source — GitLab":"逐通道校正分析來源 — GitLab","Session comparison analysis source — GitLab":"測試批次比較分析來源 — GitLab","Archived ADC and software diagnostics — archive availability":"已封存 ADC 與軟體診斷 — 封存可用性","The archived raw-data ZIP preserves all 58 acquisitions from the initial study, expanded study and additional 2.5 µM loading, including records excluded from the primary fit. Each original file is checked against its SHA-256 manifest. These files are also preserved in the complete research archive prepared locally for Zenodo; that full archive has no verified public deposit.":"原始資料 ZIP 保留初期研究、擴充研究及額外 2.5 µM 載入的全部 58 次擷取，包括主要擬合排除的紀錄。各原始檔均依 SHA-256 清單核對。這些檔案也保留於本機為 Zenodo 準備的完整研究封存包；該完整包尚無經核實的公開存放紀錄。","Hardware and wet-lab curve comparison":"硬體與濕實驗曲線比較","Source observations · CSV":"來源觀測 · CSV","Comparison time points · CSV":"比較時間點 · CSV","Matched pairs and all sensitivities · CSV":"匹配配對與全部敏感度分析 · CSV","All 4 × 4 pairings · CSV":"全部 4 × 4 配對 · CSV","Matched and off-diagonal comparisons · CSV":"匹配與非對角比較 · CSV","Descriptive linear trends · CSV":"描述性線性趨勢 · CSV","Definitions, timing and provenance · JSON":"定義、時序與來源 · JSON","Reproducible analysis and verification source · GitLab":"可重現分析與驗證來源 · GitLab","Full component audit · PDF":"完整元件稽核 · PDF","Stack section · WebP":"堆疊剖面 · WebP","Printed-part geometry · WebP":"列印零件幾何 · WebP","Exploded assembly · WebP":"組裝爆炸圖 · WebP","Original build photographs · 10 WebP files":"原始製作照片 · 10 份 WebP","STL file — archive availability":"STL 檔案 — 封存可用性","Four-receptor reference patterns · JSON":"四受體參考模式 · JSON","Local backend setup and reference analysis · GitLab":"本機後端設定與參考分析 · GitLab","Airflow methods and complete results —":"氣流方法與完整結果 —","Airflow simulation source — GitLab":"氣流模擬來源 — GitLab","Airflow mesh comparison · CSV":"氣流網格比較 · CSV","Airflow selection record · JSON":"氣流選擇紀錄 · JSON","Blank feedback form — PDF reader":"空白回饋表 — PDF 閱讀器","Manuals, source code and data —":"手冊、原始碼與資料 —","Hardware analysis and device source — GitLab":"硬體分析與裝置來源 — GitLab","Manuals and assembly feedback":"手冊與組裝回饋","User manual:":"使用者手冊：","Developer manual:":"開發者手冊：","Anonymized feedback form — PDF reader":"匿名化回饋表 — PDF 閱讀器","Calibration data and reproducible analyses":"校正資料與可重現分析","Instrument calibration source — GitLab":"儀器校正來源 — GitLab","Cross-platform timing sensitivity":"跨平台時序敏感度","Pearson r is shown for four matched pairs. Native-point and control-adjusted comparisons use five native nominal points; first-point omission uses four points, and the original-device-clock comparison interpolates hardware to six wet-lab times from 0 to 60 s.":"呈現四組匹配的 Pearson r。原生點與對照調整比較使用五個名目原生點；省略首點使用四點；原裝置時鐘比較則將硬體插值至 0–60 秒間六個濕實驗時間點。","Channel and construct":"通道與構築","Native nominal points":"名目原生點","First point omitted":"省略首點","Original device clock":"原裝置時鐘","Control-adjusted":"對照調整","fits each readout separately without explicitly inverting a cross-well matrix. Its descriptive R² of 0.886 describes the per-channel calibration display. The matrix-derived concentration estimates are reported separately below.":"分別擬合各讀出，未明確反轉跨井矩陣。其描述性 R² = 0.886 描述逐通道校正顯示；矩陣導出的濃度估計另列於下方。","Supplementary figure 1.":"補充圖 1。","Interference-transfer check. A: the measured single-well matrix, using the same signed row normalization as":"干擾轉移檢查。A：實測單井矩陣，採與以下相同的帶正負號列正規化",". B: direct matrix estimates for uniform standards, retaining negative estimates. At actual 10 µM the estimates are 9.09, 8.72, −2.37 and 10.51 µM. This layout mismatch is why the matrix-before-curve route is evaluated but not adopted for arbitrary unknown mixtures.":"。B：均勻標準的直接矩陣估計，保留負值。實際 10 µM 時，估計為 9.09、8.72、−2.37、10.51 µM。此配置不匹配，是評估矩陣先於曲線的方法、卻未將其用於任意未知混合物的原因。","Supplementary figure 2.":"補充圖 2。","These diagnostic estimates explicitly apply the measured I/Q mixing matrix. They are 10 µM-reference-equivalent values, not the per-channel curve estimates in":"這些診斷估計明確套用實測 I/Q 混合矩陣，數值等效於 10 µM 參考，而非以下逐通道曲線估計",". The full signed results are retained here.":"。此處保留完整帶正負號結果。","Supplementary figure 3.":"補充圖 3。","Supplementary figure 4.":"補充圖 4。","The CAD includes an antenna aperture with about 0.66 mm nominal insertion clearance against the supplied drawing.":"CAD 包含天線開孔，相對所提供圖面約有 0.66 mm 名目插入間隙。","Assembly and shared datums: dimensioned black-line CAD projections and feature coordinate schedule, sheet A01.":"組裝與共用基準：標註尺寸的黑線 CAD 投影與特徵座標表，圖紙 A01。","Lower case: shell and service apertures: dimensioned black-line CAD projections and feature coordinate schedule, sheet B01.":"下殼：殼體與維修開孔；標註尺寸的黑線 CAD 投影與特徵座標表，圖紙 B01。","Lower case: floor, fan and mounting pattern: dimensioned black-line CAD projections and feature coordinate schedule, sheet B02.":"下殼：底板、風扇與安裝孔位；標註尺寸的黑線 CAD 投影與特徵座標表，圖紙 B02。","Lower case: fasteners and locating tongue: dimensioned black-line CAD projections and feature coordinate schedule, sheet B03.":"下殼：緊固件與定位凸舌；標註尺寸的黑線 CAD 投影與特徵座標表，圖紙 B03。","Upper case: shell, bridges and hose slots: dimensioned black-line CAD projections and feature coordinate schedule, sheet H01.":"上殼：殼體、橋接結構與軟管槽；標註尺寸的黑線 CAD 投影與特徵座標表，圖紙 H01。","Upper case: well carrier and guide details: dimensioned black-line CAD projections and feature coordinate schedule, sheet H02.":"上殼：樣本井座與導引細節；標註尺寸的黑線 CAD 投影與特徵座標表，圖紙 H02。","Upper case: optical seat and joint section: dimensioned black-line CAD projections and feature coordinate schedule, sheet H03.":"上殼：光學座與接合剖面；標註尺寸的黑線 CAD 投影與特徵座標表，圖紙 H03。","Gas lid: cover and reinforcement: dimensioned black-line CAD projections and feature coordinate schedule, sheet L01.":"氣室蓋：蓋板與補強；標註尺寸的黑線 CAD 投影與特徵座標表，圖紙 L01。","Gas lid: chamber, spigots and deflector: dimensioned black-line CAD projections and feature coordinate schedule, sheet L02.":"氣室蓋：腔室、接管與導流板；標註尺寸的黑線 CAD 投影與特徵座標表，圖紙 L02。","Gas lid: locating lip and screw clearances: dimensioned black-line CAD projections and feature coordinate schedule, sheet L03.":"氣室蓋：定位唇與螺絲間隙；標註尺寸的黑線 CAD 投影與特徵座標表，圖紙 L03。","Four mirrored sample wells: dimensioned black-line CAD projections and feature coordinate schedule, sheet W01.":"四個鏡像樣本井：標註尺寸的黑線 CAD 投影與特徵座標表，圖紙 W01。","Removable gas compression plate: dimensioned black-line CAD projections and feature coordinate schedule, sheet P01.":"可拆氣室壓板：標註尺寸的黑線 CAD 投影與特徵座標表，圖紙 P01。","AeroSense user manual PDF":"AeroSense 使用者手冊 PDF","AeroSense developer manual PDF":"AeroSense 開發者手冊 PDF","Four hardware channel time courses. Cells-plus-medium and VUAA1 series each start at one, using their own first amplitude as the denominator. Each panel annotates the difference between the two late-window changes in percentage points.":"四個硬體通道的時間序列。細胞加培養液與 VUAA1 序列各以自身首筆振幅為分母，皆從 1 開始。各面板標註兩組晚期視窗變化之差，單位為百分點。","Four matched hardware and wet-lab VUAA1 time courses, each normalized to its own first reading, with five-point Pearson and Spearman correlations.":"四組匹配的硬體與濕實驗 VUAA1 時間序列，各以自身首筆讀值正規化，並呈現五點 Pearson 與 Spearman 相關。","Four-by-four Pearson and Spearman maps compare the same five signal-level observations, with intended construct matches outlined.":"4 × 4 Pearson 與 Spearman 圖比較相同五次訊號水準觀測，外框標示預期構築匹配。","Open original-resolution photograph (SVG containing the original JPEG): Team members at an NTHU Garage event.":"開啟原始解析度照片（含原始 JPEG 的 SVG）：團隊成員參加清華創業車庫活動。","Open full-size image: Online Mini Jamboree project exchange.":"開啟完整尺寸圖片：線上 Mini Jamboree 專案交流。","Online Mini Jamboree project exchange.":"線上 Mini Jamboree 專案交流。","Reporter expression and two exploratory fluorescence-kinetics tests document the cell-based sensing array.":"報導蛋白表現與兩項探索性螢光動態測試，記錄以細胞為基礎的感測陣列。","Optical and gas-transport models guided a four-channel reader, tested with fluorescent standards and documented for rebuilding.":"光學與氣體運輸模型引導四通道讀取器設計；以螢光標準品測試，並提供重建文件。","Open the reader":"開啟讀取器","AeroSense normal animation":"AeroSense 一般動畫","AeroSense sensor animation":"AeroSense 感測器動畫","An invisible input becomes a readable pattern":"不可見的輸入轉為可讀模式","A conceptual learning diagram: odor molecules encounter different receptors, producing a pattern of responses that can be read as a signal. Shapes and bars are illustrative, not molecular structures or experimental measurements.":"概念學習圖：氣味分子接觸不同受體，產生可讀為訊號的反應模式。形狀與長條為示意，並非分子結構或實驗量測。","Methods and data analysis":"方法與資料分析","Microscopy":"顯微影像","Odor assays":"氣味試驗","Hardware analysis":"硬體分析","Model evaluation":"模型評估","Supplementary methods":"補充方法","Define how each dataset becomes a measurement":"定義各資料集如何轉為量測","AeroSense combines microscopy, fluorescence time series, a four-channel reader and computational predictions. We define each dataset’s observation unit, reference and transformation, separating reporter-positive fractions, corrected responses and prediction scores. Source records, exclusions and sensitivity analyses make these comparisons traceable.":"AeroSense 結合顯微影像、螢光時間序列、四通道讀取器與計算預測。我們定義各資料集的觀測單位、參考與轉換，區分報導陽性比例、校正反應與預測分數。來源紀錄、排除項目及敏感度分析使比較可追溯。","GCaMP fluorescence reflects calcium and reporter abundance. Our analysis therefore distinguishes image-based expression screening, stimulus-associated kinetics, instrument calibration and model evaluation. Each uses an explicit denominator and comparison. Acquisition and biological procedures are documented in Experiments.":"GCaMP 螢光同時反映鈣離子與報導蛋白含量，因此分析區分影像表現篩查、刺激相關動態、儀器校正與模型評估，各自採明確分母及比較。擷取與生物實驗程序記錄於實驗頁。","GCaMP reference [1]":"GCaMP 參考文獻 [1]","Microscopy reporting reference [2]":"顯微影像報告參考文獻 [2]","Original acquisitions remain unchanged. Derived tables identify the condition, channel or receptor, source file, time or field, exclusions and technical repeat structure.":"原始擷取保持不變。衍生表格標明條件、通道或受體、來源檔、時間或視野、排除項目與技術重複結構。","Microscopy: reporter-associated objects":"顯微影像：報導訊號相關物件","The screen contains 25 matched fields, 12 conditions and 2,624 eligible DAPI-connected objects from 8-bit channel exports. A 3 × 3 median filter and BLUE threshold >128 digital numbers (DN) define 8-connected components, without watershed. Every component ≥200 pixels receives an inclusion or exclusion record. Blank and receptor conditions use identical rules.":"篩查包含 8 位元通道匯出影像中的 25 個匹配視野、12 種條件及 2,624 個合格 DAPI 連通物件。以 3 × 3 中位數濾波及 BLUE >128 數位值（DN）界定八連通元件，未使用分水嶺。每個 ≥200 像素元件均有納入或排除紀錄，空白與受體條件使用相同規則。","Step":"步驟","Retained analysis rule":"保留的分析規則","Object eligibility":"物件資格","Area 200–2,200 pixels; bounding-box aspect ratio ≤2.5; fill fraction ≥0.4; at least 49 pixels from the image border; no overlap with the masked annotation neighborhood.":"面積 200–2,200 像素；外接框長寬比 ≤2.5；填充比例 ≥0.4；距影像邊界至少 49 像素；不與遮罩註記鄰域重疊。","Reporter region":"報導訊號區域","DAPI object plus up to 12 pixels assigned to the nearest BLUE component. Local background uses a 24–48-pixel ring, excludes BLUE foreground and requires at least 100 pixels.":"DAPI 物件加上最多 12 像素、分配至最近 BLUE 元件的區域。局部背景採 24–48 像素環帶，排除 BLUE 前景且至少含 100 像素。","Object score":"物件分數","90th percentile of reporter-region intensity minus the median local background. Strictly greater than the channel threshold defines positivity.":"報導區域強度第 90 百分位數減去局部背景中位數。嚴格高於通道閾值才定義為陽性。","Reported fraction":"報告比例","Sum of positive objects divided by sum of eligible objects, with field-level counts retained. RED and GREEN are scored separately.":"陽性物件總數除以合格物件總數，保留各視野計數。RED 與 GREEN 分開計分。","Thresholds and statistical checks":"閾值與統計檢查","The threshold is the largest 99th percentile among three blank-field score distributions: RED 16.60 DN and GREEN 11.95 DN. The 95th- and 99.5th-percentile rules provide sensitivity checks. Leave-one-blank-field-out analysis trains on two fields and tests the third; the all-blank fitted result is separate. ORCO-only, which lacks mCherry, supplies an additional RED-negative comparison.":"閾值取三個空白視野分數分布中最大的第 99 百分位數：RED 16.60 DN、GREEN 11.95 DN。第 95 與 99.5 百分位規則用於敏感度檢查。留一空白視野分析以兩個視野訓練、第三個測試；使用全部空白擬合的結果另列。缺少 mCherry 的僅 ORCO 條件另提供 RED 陰性比較。","One-sided Fisher exact tests compare positive/negative object counts in 11 nonblank conditions with blank. Holm correction is applied separately to the 11 RED and 11 GREEN tests. We report fraction differences in percentage points and nominal 95% Wilson intervals.":"以單尾 Fisher 精確檢定比較 11 個非空白條件與空白的陽性／陰性物件計數。11 個 RED 與 11 個 GREEN 檢定分別進行 Holm 校正。報告比例差（百分點）與名目 95% Wilson 區間。","Area fraction and object fraction":"面積比例與物件比例","Pixel-area and selected-object fractions retain separate denominators. Eligible objects cover 9.5–22.8% of segmented DAPI foreground in receptor conditions. QC records exclusions, background-pixel counts, clipping, source labels and threshold sensitivity. Display contrast adjustments do not enter measurement tables.":"像素面積與篩選物件比例使用不同分母。在受體條件中，合格物件涵蓋分割 DAPI 前景的 9.5–22.8%。品管記錄排除項目、背景像素數、截幅、來源標籤及閾值敏感度。顯示用對比調整不納入量測表格。","Odor assays: baseline and reference corrections":"氣味試驗：基線與參考修正","Test 1: peak response relative to its preceding baseline":"Test 1：相對前置基線的峰值反應","Test 1 records four stages per condition: five baseline readings, 15 buffer readings, five new baseline readings and 15 test readings. P3(x) is the largest mean of three consecutive readings. Each excursion uses its preceding baseline.":"Test 1 每個條件記錄四階段：五筆基線、十五筆緩衝液、五筆新基線及十五筆測試讀值。P3(x) 為三個連續讀值平均的最大值，各變動使用其前置基線。","R = 100 × [P3(test) / mean(F0b) − 1] − 100 × [P3(buffer) / mean(F0a) − 1] (percentage points)":"R = 100 × [P3(test) / mean(F0b) − 1] − 100 × [P3(buffer) / mean(F0a) − 1]（百分點）","Separate buffer-reference and untransfected-control contrasts remain in the tables. Source-reported gain incompatibility in rows B and C excludes 24 cross-stage metrics; their raw traces remain. The other 72 metrics are conditional on available metadata because numerical gain was not exported. Test 1 has no matched DMSO control.":"表格保留獨立的緩衝液參考及未轉染對照對比。來源回報 B、C 列增益不相容，因此排除 24 個跨階段指標，但保留原始曲線。其餘 72 個指標因未匯出數值增益，解讀仍受現有中繼資料限制。Test 1 沒有匹配 DMSO 對照。","Test 2: post-addition change minus pre-addition change":"Test 2：加液後變化減去加液前變化","Test 2 has five pre-addition readings over 48 s and 15 post-addition readings over 168 s, at 12 s intervals. Each stage is normalized to its own first reading before subtraction. The primary endpoint uses both complete stages; an equal-window first-48-s comparison tests sensitivity to duration.":"Test 2 每 12 秒讀取一次，加液前 48 秒內五筆、加液後 168 秒內十五筆。各階段先除以自身首筆讀值，再相減。主要終點使用兩個完整階段；前 48 秒等視窗比較用來檢驗時長敏感度。","(percentage points)":"（百分點）","The 72 wells cover 12 constructs or controls × six stimuli, with one well per condition. The mean post-addition / mean pre-addition ratio remains an alternative audit quantity. Peak-based R and endpoint S are reported separately.":"72 孔涵蓋 12 種構築或對照 × 六種刺激，每條件一孔。加液後平均／加液前平均比值保留為替代稽核量。峰值 R 與終點 S 分別報告。","Construct-matched VUAA1 reference":"構築匹配的 VUAA1 參考","Test 2 uses same-construct DMSO and VUAA1 wells as references. The ratio covers ten tuning-receptor + ORCO constructs and ORCO-only, excluding the blank control. VUAA1 provides an Orco agonist reference.":"Test 2 以相同構築的 DMSO 與 VUAA1 孔作參考。比值涵蓋十種調諧受體 + ORCO 構築及僅 ORCO，排除空白對照。VUAA1 提供 Orco 致效劑參考。","N = (Sodor − SDMSO) / (SVUAA1 − SDMSO) (dimensionless)":"N = (Sodor − SDMSO) / (SVUAA1 − SDMSO)（無因次）","DMSO and VUAA1 anchor 0 and 1 without imposing bounds. Negative values and values above 1 are retained.":"DMSO 與 VUAA1 將 0 與 1 設為參考點，但不限制數值範圍。負值與大於 1 的數值均保留。","Odor-response figures and data":"氣味反應圖與資料","VUAA1 reference [3]":"VUAA1 參考文獻 [3]","Light-sheet recordings: ROI fluorescence over time":"光片紀錄：ROI 螢光時間變化","Each ROI uses acquisition timestamps and ΔF/F0 = 100 × (F/F0 − 1). Full-recording F0 is that ROI’s mean over 8 ≤ t < 16 s; local comparisons use 10 to 2 s before odor onset. All 696 frames per retained curve remain. TH-GFP uses supplied ImageJ bleaching-corrected intensities; GH146-GCaMP6f uses measured means without added bleaching correction or smoothing.":"各 ROI 使用擷取時間戳與 ΔF/F0 = 100 × (F/F0 − 1)。完整紀錄的 F0 為該 ROI 在 8 ≤ t < 16 秒的平均；局部比較採氣味開始前 10 至 2 秒。各保留曲線皆含全部 696 幀。TH-GFP 使用所提供經 ImageJ 漂白校正的強度；GH146-GCaMP6f 使用實測平均，未另加漂白校正或平滑。","The GH146 recordings share a fly and field; TH uses a different field and reporter. ROI and whole-image traces remain separate.":"GH146 紀錄來自同一果蠅與視野；TH 使用不同視野及報導蛋白。ROI 與全影像曲線分開保留。","Hardware: demodulation, calibration and cell trajectories":"硬體：解調、校正與細胞軌跡","Complex signals and isolated-source mixing":"複數訊號與獨立來源混合","One photodiode records four LED-frequency channels as z = 1000(I + iQ) mV. Subtract the contemporaneous illuminated-water mean in complex space. The own-well 10 µM control supplies unit phase p, giving the signed projection Re[(z − zblank) × conjugate(p)].":"一個光電二極體記錄四個 LED 頻率通道，z = 1000(I + iQ) mV。在複數空間減去同時期照明純水平均。自身樣本井 10 µM 對照提供單位相位 p，得到帶正負號的投影 Re[(z − zblank) × conjugate(p)]。","Each isolated-source response divided by 10 µM forms a column of M. Stacking four I and four Q components gives an 8 × 4 matrix. Ridge inversion uses ĉ = (MᵀM + λσmax²I)⁻¹Mᵀy, with λ = 0.0001 selected from 15 single-source/blank technical leave-one-acquisition-out folds. Mixed-loading truth does not tune λ; negative estimates remain.":"各獨立來源反應除以 10 µM，形成 M 的一欄。堆疊四個 I 與四個 Q 元件得到 8 × 4 矩陣。嶺反演為 ĉ = (MᵀM + λσmax²I)⁻¹Mᵀy，其中 λ = 0.0001，由 15 個單一來源／空白、留一擷取技術驗證折選定。混合載入真值不參與 λ 調整，負估計值保留。","Uniform-loading fluorescein calibration":"均勻載入螢光素校正","Set A uses linear y = a + bc/10 with standards 0, 0.1, 1 and 10 µM; entire 0.1 and 1 µM levels are withheld in turn. Its phase reference is the highest remaining training standard. The expanded 0–20 µM dataset, Set B, uses:":"Set A 採線性 y = a + bc/10，標準為 0、0.1、1、10 µM；輪流保留整個 0.1 與 1 µM 層級作驗證。相位參考為剩餘訓練標準中的最高濃度。擴充至 0–20 µM 的 Set B 使用：","All Set B channels use this exponential family with separate coefficients and equal-weight loading means. Entire 1, 5 and 10 µM levels, including technical reads, are withheld in turn; 0 and 20 µM remain anchors. Reportable estimates require a unique inverse within 0–20 µM. Family selection compares holdout RMSE and monotonicity. Both 2.5 µM loadings remain in QC sensitivities, outside the primary fit. Extra residual corrections, tested with nested concentration holdouts, were not adopted.":"Set B 各通道使用相同指數函數族，但係數獨立、載入平均等權。輪流保留整個 1、5、10 µM 層級（含技術讀值）；0、20 µM 維持錨點。可報告估計須在 0–20 µM 內有唯一反函數解。函數族選擇比較保留驗證 RMSE 與單調性。兩種 2.5 µM 載入均保留於品管敏感度分析、排除在主要擬合外。以巢狀濃度保留驗證測試的額外殘差修正未採用。","Living cells: normalize each acquisition to its own start":"活細胞：各次擷取依自身起點正規化","Cell trajectories use raw amplitude A = 1000√(I² + Q²) mV. Blank and post-VUAA1 sequences are each divided by their first amplitude. The late-window contrast is 100 × [mean(final three normalized post-VUAA1 readings) − mean(final three normalized blank readings)], in percentage points. Absolute pre/post triplicates are reported separately.":"細胞軌跡使用原始振幅 A = 1000√(I² + Q²) mV。空白與 VUAA1 後序列各除以自身首筆振幅。晚期對比為 100 × [平均（正規化 VUAA1 後最後三筆）− 平均（正規化空白最後三筆）]，單位百分點。加液前後的絕對三次讀值另列。","Cross-platform analysis pairs five nominal times, 0, 12, 24, 36 and 48 s: hardware readings 1/3/5/7/9 and corresponding wet-lab readings, without interpolation. Pearson/Spearman levels, first differences and detrended curves are compared across all 4 × 4 pairings, including ORCO-only. A control-adjusted sensitivity subtracts medium from VUAA1 own-start ratios in hardware, and DMSO from VUAA1 own-start ratios in wet lab, without further F0 or N(t) correction. First-point-omission, ten-point interpolated and original-clock sensitivities are retained.":"跨平台分析配對 0、12、24、36、48 秒五個名目時間：硬體第 1／3／5／7／9 筆與對應濕實驗讀值，無插值。全部 4 × 4 配對（含僅 ORCO）比較 Pearson／Spearman 水準、一階差分與去趨勢曲線。對照調整敏感度在硬體以 VUAA1 自身起點比值減培養液，在濕實驗以 VUAA1 比值減 DMSO，不再加 F0 或 N(t) 修正。另保留省略首點、十點插值與原時鐘敏感度分析。","Model evaluation: match the split to the claim":"模型評估：讓資料切分符合主張","Dataset or model":"資料集或模型","Analysis and evaluation unit":"分析與評估單位","Reported quantities":"報告量","UCI-270 spiking decoder":"UCI-270 脈衝解碼器","Gas-stratified 80/20 measurement split; scaling and PCA fitted on training data. Layer probes use five-fold cross-validation grouped by measurement: 1,799 presentations of 1,322 measurements.":"依氣體分層的 80/20 量測切分；縮放與 PCA 僅以訓練資料擬合。逐層探測使用依量測分組的五折交叉驗證：1,322 筆量測的 1,799 次呈現。","Macro-F1; learning-curve checkpoints and layer probes retain their own sample counts. Repeated presentations are not independent measurements.":"Macro-F1；學習曲線檢查點與逐層探測保留各自樣本數。重複呈現不是獨立量測。","DoOR chemical-family decoder":"DoOR 化學家族解碼器","91 odorants across ten receptors; five-fold evaluation, with imputation and preprocessing fitted on training folds. Each sample is an odorant, not a cell replicate.":"十種受體、91 種氣味分子；五折評估，補值與前處理在訓練折內擬合。每個樣本是一種氣味分子，不是細胞重複。","Macro-F1 across five chemical families; encodings and linear readouts are compared on matched folds.":"五種化學家族的 macro-F1；編碼與線性讀出於匹配折上比較。","KT decoder benchmark (supplementary)":"KT 解碼器基準測試（補充）","Gas-stratified random folds and whole-day holdouts answer different questions. Imputation, scaling, PCA and binning are fitted on training partitions. Repeated simulation presentations are not new exposures.":"依氣體分層的隨機折與整日保留驗證回答不同問題。補值、縮放、PCA 與分箱只在訓練分區擬合。重複模擬呈現不是新的曝露。","Accuracy is the fraction correct; macro-F1 is the unweighted mean of class F1. Layer probes and parameter checks retain their own split and test counts.":"準確率為答對比例；macro-F1 是各類 F1 的不加權平均。逐層探測與參數檢查保留各自切分與測試數。","UCI sensor drift":"UCI 感測器漂移","Within-batch, first-batch-to-later-batch and previous-batch-to-next-batch tests remain separate. Concentration-range overlap is evaluated alongside the full later batch.":"批次內、第一批到後續批，以及前一批到下一批測試分開保留。除了完整後續批次，也評估濃度範圍重疊區。","Classification accuracy by time batch and eligible concentration range; not pooled with KT macro-F1.":"依時間批次及合格濃度範圍報告分類準確率，不與 KT macro-F1 合併。","Receptor-response prediction":"受體反應預測","2,640 published receptor–odorant pairs. Pair, odorant, chemical-group, receptor and receptor-group holdouts are kept distinct. Feature additions use matched eligible pairs, fixed folds and training-fold preprocessing.":"2,640 組已發表受體–氣味分子配對。配對、氣味分子、化學群組、受體及受體群組保留驗證各自獨立。新增特徵使用匹配合格配對、固定折與訓練折前處理。","Out-of-fold R² and paired changes in R²; group-bootstrap intervals conditional on fixed predictions. R² is not percentage accuracy.":"折外 R² 與配對 R² 變化；以固定預測為條件的群組 bootstrap 區間。R² 不是百分比準確率。","Docking and molecular dynamics":"分子對接與動力學","Mutant and wild-type docking use a common search box. Structural comparisons align the specified protein atoms. Trajectory windows and unsteered controls are retained separately.":"突變型與野生型對接使用共用搜尋框。結構比較對齊指定蛋白原子。軌跡視窗與無導引對照分開保留。","Docking-score differences, RMSD, distances and geometric contact fractions; correlated frames do not become independent replicates or binding free energies.":"對接分數差、RMSD、距離與幾何接觸比例；相關影格不能當成獨立重複或結合自由能。","Optics and transport":"光學與運輸","Finite-detector Monte Carlo outputs retain seed-wise results; both matrix axes are registered to D1–D4 before comparison. Airflow and membrane sweeps retain their geometry, material and boundary assumptions.":"有限偵測器蒙地卡羅輸出保留各種子結果；比較前將矩陣兩軸對應 D1–D4。氣流與膜參數掃描保留其幾何、材料及邊界假設。","Collected power, spatial CV and row-normalized matrix shares; transport timing, mixing and deformation predictions are model outputs.":"收集功率、空間 CV 與列正規化矩陣占比；運輸時序、混合與變形預測皆為模型輸出。","Simulated and measured matrices are separately row-normalized: Pij = 100 × Mij / ΣjMij, retaining signed entries. Pearson correlation compares all 16 entries and, separately, off-diagonal entries to expose the dominant diagonal’s contribution.":"模擬與實測矩陣分別依列正規化：Pij = 100 × Mij / ΣjMij，保留帶正負號元素。Pearson 相關分別比較全部 16 個元素與非對角元素，以揭示主對角線的貢獻。","Model results, datasets and parameter definitions":"模型結果、資料集與參數定義","Sensor-drift dataset [4]":"感測器漂移資料集 [4]","Trajectory uncertainty [5]":"軌跡不確定性 [5]","Microscopy fractions describe selected objects sharing fields and cultures. Fisher tests and Wilson intervals omit clustering, segmentation and threshold uncertainty; blank holdouts measure within-batch behavior. GFP and GCaMP traces are different biological readouts. Neither brightness nor the separate-well VUAA1 ratio measures transfection efficiency or isolates coexpression. Or7a’s denominator is only 2.19 percentage points, amplifying small changes. Odor wells lack biological replication; Test 2 also compares unequal 48 s and 168 s windows. Corrected changes alone do not establish receptor-specific activation.":"顯微影像比例描述共享視野與培養的篩選物件。Fisher 檢定與 Wilson 區間未涵蓋群聚、分割及閾值不確定性；空白保留驗證衡量批次內行為。GFP 與 GCaMP 曲線是不同生物讀出。亮度及獨立孔 VUAA1 比值均無法量測轉染效率或單獨辨識共表現。Or7a 分母僅 2.19 百分點，會放大小變化。氣味孔缺乏生物重複；Test 2 也比較不等長的 48、168 秒視窗。修正變化本身不能確立受體專一性活化。","Calibration-family selection reuses the evaluation folds and remains exploratory, not prospective validation. The isolated-source matrix does not establish arbitrary-mixture recovery, and dye calibration does not transfer directly to cells. Own-start normalization conceals absolute post-addition drops; dilution, optics and cell state remain unresolved explanations.":"校正函數族選擇重用評估折，仍屬探索而非前瞻驗證。獨立來源矩陣不能確立任意混合物還原，染料校正也不能直接轉移至細胞。依自身起點正規化會隱藏加液後絕對下降；稀釋、光學及細胞狀態仍是未釐清解釋。","Time-point correlations are descriptive: autocorrelation, common trends and interpolation can produce apparent agreement. No p-values or biological-replicate counts are inferred, and the nominal hardware schedule is not a verified synchronized clock. Row-normalized optical matrices compare dependent patterns, not absolute power and voltage. Model splits define generalization; simulation variation omits material and force-field uncertainty. The PN–KC–MBON training engine and complete fitted preprocessing records remain reproducibility gaps.":"時間點相關屬描述性：自相關、共同趨勢與插值可能造成表面一致。不推論 p 值或生物重複數；名目硬體時程也非核實的同步時鐘。列正規化光學矩陣比較相依模式，而非絕對功率與電壓。模型切分界定泛化；模擬變異未涵蓋材料與力場不確定性。PN–KC–MBON 訓練引擎與完整已擬合前處理紀錄仍是可重現性缺口。","Explicit denominators, controls and evaluation splits make each result interpretable. Preserving raw scales, exclusions and sensitivity analyses supports reuse of the measurements and identifies where further validation is needed.":"明確分母、對照與評估切分使各項結果可解釋。保留原始尺度、排除項目與敏感度分析，有助量測重用並指出仍需驗證之處。","Complete odor curves with a fixed reference denominator":"固定參考分母的完整氣味曲線","For stimulus s and construct c, subtract the measured 48 s pre-addition endpoint change from every post-addition point, then subtract DMSO at the same local acquisition time. Divide by the fixed VUAA1-minus-DMSO endpoint difference at 168 s. The final point equals Results":"對刺激 s 與構築 c，先將實測 48 秒加液前終點變化從每個加液後點扣除，再扣除相同局部擷取時間的 DMSO。除以固定的 168 秒 VUAA1 減 DMSO 終點差。最後一點等於結果頁的","; VUAA1 equals 1 at that endpoint by definition. The pre-addition change is a constant correction, not an extrapolated trace; initial offsets remain. Test 1 retains its four raw stages.":"；依定義 VUAA1 在該終點等於 1。加液前變化為常數修正，不是外推曲線；初始偏移保留。Test 1 保留四個原始階段。","Nominal object-count uncertainty":"名目物件計數不確定性","Fisher tests use [[positive, eligible − positive], [blank-positive, blank-eligible − blank-positive]] with the greater alternative. Holm adjustment orders p-values, multiplies by the remaining test count, applies the cumulative maximum and caps at 1. Wilson intervals use z = 1.96 and the eligible object count.":"Fisher 檢定使用 [[陽性, 合格 − 陽性], [空白陽性, 空白合格 − 空白陽性]]，採 greater 單尾假設。Holm 校正先排序 p 值，乘以剩餘檢定數，取累積最大值並以 1 為上限。Wilson 區間使用 z = 1.96 與合格物件數。","Fisher exact test implementation [6]":"Fisher 精確檢定實作 [6]","Analysis definitions; scroll horizontally to inspect all columns.":"分析定義；可水平捲動檢視所有欄位。","Datasets":"資料集","PCA and PN coding":"PCA 與 PN 編碼","Network and learning":"網路與學習","UCI results":"UCI 結果","DoOR results":"DoOR 結果","Test 1 comparison":"Test 1 比較","Dynamic-response comparison":"動態反應比較","Parameters":"參數","Earlier decoder record":"早期解碼器紀錄","Physical model overview":"物理模型總覽","Transport and measurement assumptions":"運輸與量測假設",". The original power-matrix condition number is approximately 1.86.":"。原始功率矩陣條件數約為 1.86。","Original simulation · 20 s":"原始模擬 · 20 秒","D3 illumination uses 600,000 excitation packets; collection uses 224 source positions with 65,536 packets each and 0.5 × 0.4 mm pixels. The D3 floor irradiance has spatial CV 46.2%. Collection-map standard errors and Wilson 95% bounds are saved in the source but are not plotted as error bars; median relative collection-map SE is 17.3%. These are Monte Carlo sampling uncertainties, not biological replicates or measured uniformity. Fixed well registration and spatially distributed standards remain necessary. Method precedent: separate illumination and collection maps in Burton et al.":"D3 照明使用 600,000 個激發封包；收集使用 224 個來源位置、各 65,536 封包與 0.5 × 0.4 mm 像素。D3 底面輻照度空間 CV 為 46.2%。收集圖標準誤與 Wilson 95% 界限保留於來源，但未繪製誤差棒；收集圖相對標準誤中位數為 17.3%。這些是蒙地卡羅抽樣不確定性，不是生物重複或實測均勻度。仍需固定樣本井定位及空間分布標準。方法先例：Burton 等人分開建立照明與收集圖。",". Positive irradiance and collection efficiency are shown in red; white denotes zero.":"。正輻照度與收集效率以紅色表示，白色為零。","The comparison tests no filter, one or two LEE101 layers, and a constructed 500 nm OD4 longpass scenario. The model integrates wavelength-dependent source power, filter transmission and detector responsivity to predict photodiode current in nA under the stated optical assumptions.":"比較包含無濾光片、一或兩層 LEE101，以及建構的 500 nm OD4 長通濾光情境。模型整合隨波長變化的來源功率、濾光片穿透率及偵測器響應度，在所述光學假設下預測光電二極體電流（nA）。","Gas-surface arrival and transport to bottom-attached cells are separate processes. The shelf redirects flow without being fastest in every comparison. The selected 3 mL/min condition provides margin against the 60 s criterion; grid sensitivity weakens the near-threshold 2.5 mL/min result. The membrane sweep supports a no-film baseline until delivery and recovery at the cell plane are measured.":"氣體到達液面與傳輸至底部貼附細胞是不同過程。平台重新引導氣流，但不是每項比較都最快。選定的 3 mL/min 對 60 秒準則保有餘裕；網格敏感度削弱接近門檻的 2.5 mL/min 結果。膜參數掃描支持先採無膜基準，直到細胞平面的輸送與回復經量測。","Optical mixing requires a measured channel matrix, while LED-synchronous leakage requires an illuminated blank. Predicted currents and Monte Carlo SE depend on the assumed source, material, detector and filter properties; they do not include measured electronics or cellular variation. The constructed OD4 scenario also uses a different mounting geometry from the selected film.":"光學混合需要實測通道矩陣，LED 同步漏光則需要照明空白。預測電流與蒙地卡羅標準誤依賴來源、材料、偵測器及濾光片假設，不包含實測電子或細胞變異。建構的 OD4 情境也採與所選薄膜不同的安裝幾何。","Strong same-well entries drive much of the simulated–measured matrix association: the 12 cross-well entries alone give Pearson r = 0.257. Different source distributions and electronic effects prevent treating this as quantitative leakage agreement. Blank and dye calibration, single-source-well tests, detector headroom and noise, and assembled-path flow and concentration measurements are the next checks.":"強烈同井元素主導模擬與實測矩陣關聯；只比較十二個跨井元素，Pearson r = 0.257。不同來源分布及電子效應，使其不能視為定量漏光一致。接下來需檢查空白與染料校正、單一來源井、偵測器餘裕與雜訊，以及組裝氣路的流量與濃度。","From sensor patterns to receptor patterns":"從感測器模式到受體模式","A fly-inspired spiking network reaches its highest observed UCI macro-F1 of 0.83 and ends at 0.79 in one training run. Layerwise probes locate the largest loss at the KC→MBON readout. On 91 DoOR odorants, a coarser quantile encoding with denser wiring raises SNN macro-F1 from 0.46 to 0.52. The analyses guide a readout redesign and define the measurements needed before transfer to the cell platform.":"仿果蠅脈衝網路在單次訓練中，UCI macro-F1 最高觀測為 0.83、最後為 0.79。逐層探測定位最大損失於 KC→MBON 讀出。對 91 種 DoOR 氣味分子，較粗分位數編碼與較密連接使 SNN macro-F1 由 0.46 升至 0.52。分析引導讀出重設，並界定轉移至細胞平台前所需量測。","A pattern across receptors can distinguish odors even when no receptor is uniquely selective. The fly mushroom body suggests a compact computational strategy: expand an input into many sparsely active Kenyon cells (KCs), then learn the connections to mushroom-body output neurons (MBONs). Random projection-neuron (PN) convergence and APL-mediated inhibition motivate this design.":"即使沒有單一受體具有獨特選擇性，跨受體模式仍能區分氣味。果蠅蕈狀體提供精巧計算策略：將輸入展開至大量稀疏活化的 Kenyon 細胞（KC），再學習與蕈狀體輸出神經元（MBON）的連接。投射神經元（PN）隨機匯聚與 APL 介導抑制啟發此設計。","We implement this motif in Brian2 and ask two questions: can the network classify response patterns, and where does useful class information disappear? UCI-270 tests gas identity from metal-oxide sensor measurements; DoOR tests chemical-family prediction from published fly-receptor responses. Wet-lab measurements are examined separately from these benchmark inputs.":"我們在 Brian2 實作此架構並詢問：網路能否分類反應模式？有用類別資訊在哪裡消失？UCI-270 以金屬氧化物感測器量測測試氣體身分；DoOR 以已發表果蠅受體反應測試化學家族預測。濕實驗量測與這些基準輸入分開檢視。","[Model record]":"[模型紀錄]","Network schematic from the model record. The reported experiments use PN, KC, APL, MBON, MBON inhibition and the training-only forced answer. The drawn ALLN and reward-prediction-error/DAN elements are not used in these experiments; the diagram is broader than the tested circuit.":"模型紀錄中的網路示意圖。報告實驗使用 PN、KC、APL、MBON、MBON 抑制及僅訓練時的強制答案。圖中的 ALLN 與獎勵預測誤差／DAN 元件未用於這些實驗；示意圖範圍大於實測電路。","Two input domains share the PN–KC–MBON pipeline: UCI-270 provides 128 sensor features per measurement, while DoOR provides ten receptor values per odorant. The dashed cell-line input is a proposed transfer route, not an experimentally trained cell-based classifier.":"兩種輸入領域共用 PN–KC–MBON 流程：UCI-270 每筆量測提供 128 個感測器特徵，DoOR 每種氣味分子提供十個受體值。虛線細胞株輸入為擬議轉移途徑，並非已經實驗訓練的細胞分類器。","Two datasets, two prediction tasks":"兩個資料集、兩項預測任務","The two benchmark datasets and the distinct questions they answer.":"兩個基準資料集及其回答的不同問題。","Property":"屬性","DoOR subset":"DoOR 子集","16 metal-oxide sensors; eight features per sensor":"16 個金屬氧化物感測器；每個八項特徵","Samples":"樣本","13,910 measurements across ten batches and 36 months":"跨十批次、36 個月的 13,910 筆量測","91 odorants measured on at least eight of the ten receptors":"至少有十種受體中八種量測的 91 種氣味分子","Labels":"標籤","Ethanol, ethylene, ammonia, acetaldehyde, acetone and toluene":"乙醇、乙烯、氨、乙醛、丙酮與甲苯","Acids (15), alcohols (20), aromatics (15), esters (25), terpenes (16)":"酸類（15）、醇類（20）、芳香族（15）、酯類（25）、萜類（16）","Resistance change, normalized change and six exponential-moving-average features per sensor":"各感測器的電阻變化、正規化變化與六項指數移動平均特徵","Unitless consensus receptor responses, 0–1; 13.4% missing cells":"無單位共識受體反應，0–1；13.4% 資料格缺值","Prediction question":"預測問題","Recognize a gas from repeated sensor measurements":"從重複感測器量測辨識氣體","Recognize a chemical family for a held-out odorant":"辨識保留驗證氣味分子的化學家族","UCI-270 is the public Gas Sensor Array Drift at Different Concentrations dataset. DoOR combines published receptor recordings into a consensus matrix; the selected ten receptors correspond to the wet-lab panel. Missing DoOR values are filled with training-split medians.":"UCI-270 是公開的不同濃度氣體感測器陣列漂移資料集。DoOR 將已發表受體紀錄整合為共識矩陣；所選十種受體對應濕實驗面板。DoOR 缺值以訓練切分中位數填補。","DoOR consensus responses for 91 odorants and ten receptors. Darker blue denotes stronger response; grey cells are missing published measurements. Acids and terpenes are weak across this panel, while alcohols, esters and aromatics recruit different overlapping receptors.":"91 種氣味分子與十種受體的 DoOR 共識反應。深藍表示較強反應，灰色為缺少已發表量測。此面板對酸與萜類反應偏弱；醇、酯與芳香族則募集不同但重疊的受體。","Standardization, PCA and population coding":"標準化、PCA 與群體編碼","For UCI, the 128 features are standardized and projected onto 20 principal components using training data only. Three components retain 75% of the reported variance and twenty retain 98%. For DoOR, ten standardized receptor values are reduced to six components, retaining 86%. PCA captures variance, which need not coincide with class separation.":"UCI 的 128 特徵僅依訓練資料標準化並投影至 20 個主成分。三個成分保留報告變異的 75%，二十個保留 98%。DoOR 的十個標準化受體值降至六成分，保留 86%。PCA 捕捉變異，不一定對應類別分離。","UCI-270 projected onto the first three principal components after standardization. Each panel highlights one gas; approximately 5% of extreme display positions are omitted for visibility. The display omission is not described as a training-data exclusion. The final panel shows explained variance.":"UCI-270 標準化後投影至前三主成分。每個面板凸顯一種氣體；為清楚顯示而省略約 5% 極端顯示位置，但未將這些省略描述為訓練資料排除。最後面板呈現解釋變異。","DoOR odorants projected onto the first three principal components. Each panel highlights a chemical family. Acids and terpenes overlap in a weak-response region, while alcohols and esters are dispersed. The six retained components explain 86% of the reported variance.":"DoOR 氣味分子投影至前三主成分。各面板凸顯一個化學家族。酸與萜類在弱反應區重疊，醇與酯則分散。保留的六成分解釋報告變異的 86%。","Each PCA axis selects one PN bin. UCI uses 20 training-data quantile bins per axis: 20 components × 20 bins produce 400 PNs, with 20 active per exposure. Values outside the training range enter the outermost bin. Quantile bins allocate resolution where samples are dense; they replace equal-width bins that leave much of the code unused. DoOR compares 20 equal-width bins per component (120 PNs) with five quantile bins (30 PNs). Bin boundaries are fitted to training data.":"各 PCA 軸選取一個 PN 箱。UCI 每軸使用 20 個訓練資料分位數箱：20 成分 × 20 箱形成 400 PN，每次曝露活化 20 個。超出訓練範圍的值進入最外箱。分位數箱將解析度配置於樣本密集處，取代大量編碼閒置的等寬箱。DoOR 比較每成分二十等寬箱（120 PN）與五分位數箱（30 PN）。分箱邊界依訓練資料擬合。","Network dynamics and learning":"網路動態與學習","The UCI network contains 400 PNs, 2,000 KCs, one APL neuron and six MBONs. Fixed random PN→KC connections have probability 0.0125, or about five inputs per KC, normalized to 800 nS total input. KCs excite APL, which inhibits KCs. Every KC projects to all MBONs; MBONs mutually inhibit one another. This is a biological abstraction, not a reconstruction of every fly connection.":"UCI 網路包含 400 PN、2,000 KC、一個 APL 與六個 MBON。固定隨機 PN→KC 連接機率為 0.0125，約每 KC 五個輸入，總輸入正規化至 800 nS。KC 激發 APL，APL 抑制 KC。每個 KC 投射至全部 MBON；MBON 彼此抑制。此為生物抽象模型，不是所有果蠅連接的重建。","[Expansion]":"[展開]","[Connectivity]":"[連接]","Conductance-based leaky integrate-and-fire neurons are integrated with forward Euler at 0.1 ms. A spike resets the membrane potential. Synaptic conductances decay exponentially and increase by the connection weight on each presynaptic spike:":"電導型漏電積分發放神經元以 0.1 ms 前向 Euler 積分。脈衝後膜電位重設；突觸電導指數衰減，每次突觸前脈衝依連接權重增加：","KC thresholds rise with recent activity and recover during silence. The spike trace x increases by 0.1 per spike and decays over 10 ms:":"KC 閾值隨近期活動上升，靜默時恢復。脈衝軌跡 x 每次脈衝增加 0.1，並以 10 ms 時常衰減：","Only KC→MBON synapses learn. The model uses a pair-based potentiating rule: either spike order strengthens a synapse when KC and MBON spikes are close in time, with 5 ms traces. Each weight remains within 0–10 nS; each KC’s outgoing weights are normalized to a 10 nS total after every training exposure. A correct-class teacher drives its MBON during training. Testing switches off the teacher and freezes learning; the MBON with the most spikes supplies the answer. This potentiating rule is a modeling choice.":"只有 KC→MBON 突觸學習。模型採配對增強規則：KC 與 MBON 脈衝時間接近時，不論先後都增強突觸，軌跡時常為 5 ms。權重限制在 0–10 nS；每次訓練曝露後，各 KC 輸出總權重正規化為 10 nS。訓練時正確類別教師驅動相應 MBON；測試時關閉教師、凍結學習，以最多脈衝的 MBON 作答。此增強規則是模型選擇。","[Plasticity]":"[可塑性]","The complete settings and the DoOR differences are in":"完整設定與 DoOR 差異見","Supplementary parameters":"補充參數","Evaluation units and splits. Repeated network presentations do not increase the number of independent measurements.":"評估單位與切分。重複網路呈現不增加獨立量測數。","Training and held-out unit":"訓練與保留驗證單位","Reported evaluation":"報告評估","UCI SNN learning curve":"UCI SNN 學習曲線","Gas-stratified random 80%/20% measurement split; up to 800 cycles, six sampled exposures per cycle":"依氣體分層隨機切分 80%／20% 量測；最多 800 循環，每循環抽取六次曝露","1,800 test presentations (300 per gas), checked after every 100 cycles; one training run":"1,800 次測試呈現（每氣體 300 次），每 100 循環檢查一次；單次訓練","UCI representation probes":"UCI 表徵探測","Linear SVM at each layer; repeated presentations of the same measurement stay together":"各層採線性 SVM；同一量測的重複呈現保持同組","The same five measurement-grouped folds over 1,799 recorded presentations of 1,322 measurements after 800 cycles":"800 循環後，對 1,322 筆量測的 1,799 次紀錄呈現，採相同五個依量測分組折","DoOR comparison":"DoOR 比較","The same stratified five odorant folds for the SNN and logistic-regression readouts":"SNN 與邏輯斯迴歸讀出使用相同五個分層氣味分子折","Each odorant belongs to one held-out fold; about 18 odorants per fold":"每種氣味分子歸屬一個保留折；每折約 18 種","An exposure lasts 30 ms, followed by a 3 ms gap. Macro-F1 averages class-specific F1 scores, so each class contributes equally. The learning curve and representation probes answer different questions: probe classifiers are fitted within the recorded held-out representations. Their grouped folds prevent repeated copies of one measurement from crossing the probe training/test boundary.":"曝露 30 ms，隨後間隔 3 ms。Macro-F1 平均各類 F1，使每類等量貢獻。學習曲線與表徵探測回答不同問題：探測分類器在記錄的保留表徵內擬合，分組折避免同一量測的重複副本跨越探測訓練／測試界線。","UCI: training stability and the readout bottleneck":"UCI：訓練穩定性與讀出瓶頸","The single UCI run reaches macro-F1 0.80 after 100 cycles and a highest displayed value of 0.83 at 300 cycles. Performance then falls to 0.53 at 400 cycles and returns to 0.79 at 800. More training is therefore not monotonically better; 0.83 is the observed checkpoint maximum, not an independently replicated estimate.":"單次 UCI 執行在 100 循環達 macro-F1 0.80，300 循環最高顯示 0.83，400 循環降至 0.53，800 循環回到 0.79。因此更多訓練並非單調改善；0.83 為觀測檢查點最大值，不是獨立重複估計。","UCI-270 macro-F1 on 1,800 test presentations at 100-cycle checkpoints in one run. The dashed 0.89 line is the linear SVM readout of KC spikes from the 800-cycle representation analysis; it is not a separately measured KC baseline at every checkpoint.":"單次執行中，每 100 循環於 1,800 次測試呈現評估 UCI-270 macro-F1。0.89 虛線為 800 循環表徵分析中 KC 脈衝的線性 SVM 讀出，不是每個檢查點各自量測的 KC 基準。","The measurement-grouped probes score 0.97 on the standardized features, 0.96 after PCA, 0.92 on PN spike counts and 0.89 on KC spike counts. Both the MBON probe and the network’s most-active-MBON decision score 0.79. The largest adjacent drop in this analysis is KC→MBON (0.10), motivating a readout-focused redesign.":"依量測分組的探測，在標準化特徵為 0.97、PCA 後 0.96、PN 脈衝計數 0.92、KC 脈衝計數 0.89。MBON 探測與網路最活躍 MBON 決策均為 0.79。最大相鄰下降發生於 KC→MBON（0.10），支持聚焦讀出重新設計。","UCI layerwise readout after 800 training cycles. Five folds are grouped by measurement over 1,799 presentations from 1,322 measurements. Bars show mean macro-F1 and lines show source-reported fold spread. Blue denotes the network’s most-active-MBON answer.":"800 訓練循環後的 UCI 逐層讀出。將 1,322 筆量測的 1,799 次呈現依量測分為五折。長條為平均 macro-F1，線段為來源回報的折間分散。藍色表示網路最活躍 MBON 作答。","DoOR: coarse coding for a small receptor dataset":"DoOR：小型受體資料集的粗編碼","For the 91 DoOR odorants, logistic regression scores 0.69 on the ten receptor values and 0.71 on six PCA components. Twenty equal-width PN bins reduce the linear-readout score to 0.52; five quantile bins retain 0.66. The SNN scores 0.46 and 0.52 respectively, compared with 0.09 for always choosing the largest family.":"91 種 DoOR 氣味分子的邏輯斯迴歸，在十個受體值為 0.69、六個 PCA 成分為 0.71。二十等寬 PN 箱使線性讀出降至 0.52；五分位數箱保留 0.66。SNN 分別為 0.46、0.52，相較始終選最大家族的 0.09。","DoOR chemical-family macro-F1 on the same five odorant folds. Blue bars compare SNN configurations; dark grey bars show logistic-regression readouts. Binning, PN→KC connectivity and training duration vary together. Bars are means and lines show source-reported fold spread.":"相同五個氣味分子折的 DoOR 化學家族 macro-F1。藍色比較 SNN 設定，深灰為邏輯斯迴歸讀出。分箱、PN→KC 連接與訓練時長同時改變。長條為平均值，線段為來源回報的折間分散。","The coarser configuration uses five quantile bins and PN→KC probability 0.2 for 100 cycles; the equal-width configuration uses twenty bins and probability 0.05 for 200 cycles. Both provide about six PN inputs per KC. With roughly 73 training odorants per fold, coarse bins reduce fragmentation of this small dataset. A remaining gap between PN-code and SNN readouts identifies room for readout improvement.":"較粗設定採五分位數箱、PN→KC 機率 0.2、100 循環；等寬設定採二十箱、機率 0.05、200 循環。兩者各 KC 約有六個 PN 輸入。每折約 73 個訓練氣味分子，粗箱可減少小資料集碎裂。PN 編碼與 SNN 讀出仍有差距，顯示讀出改善空間。","First comparison with wet-lab measurements":"首次與濕實驗量測比較","The model record compares DoOR with the first four-acquisition wet-lab assay,":"模型紀錄將 DoOR 與首次四階段擷取濕實驗試驗比較：",". Its four retained odorants are 3-octanol, benzaldehyde, 2-heptanone and valeric acid. Each receptor–odorant condition has one well. This comparison is separate from Test 2’s within-stage drift subtraction and VUAA1-reference ratios in":"。保留四種氣味分子：3-辛醇、苯甲醛、2-庚酮與戊酸。每種受體–氣味條件一孔。此比較與 Test 2 的階段內漂移相減及 VUAA1 參考比值不同，後者見","Test 1 responses and DoOR reference patterns. Each point is one receptor; measured ΔF is the Test 1 peak-based corrected response fraction. The grey ±0.043 area is a source-reported reference band. Pearson r and p annotations are retained from the supplied analysis.":"Test 1 反應與 DoOR 參考模式。每點為一受體；實測 ΔF 是 Test 1 基於峰值的校正反應分率。灰色 ±0.043 區域為來源回報參考帶。Pearson r 與 p 註記依所提供分析保留。","The source reports correlations from −0.63 to +0.17 across the four odorants, and pooled r = −0.18, p = 0.28 over 39 receptor–odorant pairs.":"來源回報四種氣味分子的相關介於 −0.63 至 +0.17，39 組受體–氣味配對合併 r = −0.18、p = 0.28。","post-addition fluorescence dynamics alongside the decoding reference":"加液後螢光動態與解碼參考並列比較","The subsequent post-addition fluorescence reanalysis compares four odorants with DoOR consensus minus receptor-specific spontaneous firing rate. Across tuning receptors, Pearson r / Spearman ρ are +0.317 / +0.406 for 2-heptanone, +0.325 / +0.442 for isopentyl acetate, +0.211 / +0.283 for valeric acid, and −0.002 / +0.006 for pentyl acetate. The comparison includes ten receptors per odorant, except the missing Or42a–valeric acid reference (n = 9).":"後續加液後螢光重分析，將四種氣味分子與 DoOR 共識減去受體自發放電率比較。跨調諧受體 Pearson r／Spearman ρ：2-庚酮 +0.317／+0.406、乙酸異戊酯 +0.325／+0.442、戊酸 +0.211／+0.283、乙酸戊酯 −0.002／+0.006。每種氣味納入十受體，唯 Or42a–戊酸參考缺失（n = 9）。","Results presents the two comparison figures":"結果頁呈現兩張比較圖","These profiles connect the wet-lab observations to the database used for decoding: three odorants share part of its receptor ordering, with a near-zero relationship for pentyl acetate. Reusing the existing reference-pattern backend’s Pearson calculation reproduced all four coefficients.":"這些輪廓將濕實驗觀測連結至解碼資料庫：三種氣味分子部分共享其受體排序，乙酸戊酯則接近零相關。重用現有參考模式後端的 Pearson 計算，重現全部四個係數。","The results support a focused computational conclusion: the UCI representation retains class information through KC activity, while the learned readout loses more. On DoOR, coarse encoding helps a small odorant dataset, but bin count, wiring probability and training duration change together. Controlled ablations are needed to isolate their contributions. The biology motivates the architecture; benchmark scores alone do not show that each circuit motif causes an improvement.":"結果支持聚焦的計算結論：UCI 表徵至 KC 活動仍保留類別資訊，學習型讀出損失較多。DoOR 粗編碼有助小型資料集，但箱數、連接機率與訓練時長同時改變，需控制消融以分離貢獻。生物學啟發架構；基準分數本身不能證明每種電路機制都造成改善。","The UCI split is random rather than day- or batch-held-out. Reusing its held-out set for checkpoints and parameter comparisons makes the best checkpoint exploratory. The DoOR folds are small, and their spread is not independent training-seed replication. For":"UCI 為隨機切分，非保留日期或批次。重用保留集比較檢查點與參數，使最佳檢查點仍屬探索。DoOR 折很小，折間分散不是獨立訓練種子重複。對於",", the source reports 1,799 rather than the planned 1,800 presentations; it does not document the omitted presentation. Neither benchmark measures food-safety classification or a trained fluorescence-to-odor system.":"，來源回報 1,799 次而非規劃的 1,800 次呈現，未記錄省略哪次。兩個基準皆未量測食品安全分類或已訓練的螢光轉氣味系統。","The Test 1–DoOR comparison has one well per receptor–odorant condition and does not establish transfer to the cell platform. We propose three to five independent wells per condition, with controls and a prespecified analysis, for the next experiment. Its ±0.043 reference band has no supplied calculation or replicate sampling definition, so it is not a biological uncertainty interval. The source reports 39 pooled pairs but does not supply the complete paired vector or explain the missing fortieth pair; the correlation statistics are retained as reported. This comparison does not use Test 2’s S or VUAA1-normalized N. Likewise, fold-spread lines in the UCI and DoOR plots have no specified SD/SE or confidence-interval definition.":"Test 1–DoOR 每受體–氣味條件只有一孔，不能確立轉移至細胞平台。下一步建議每條件三至五獨立孔、配備對照及預先指定分析。±0.043 參考帶缺少計算或重複抽樣定義，不能當作生物不確定區間。來源回報合併 39 配對，但未提供完整配對向量或說明缺少的第四十組；相關統計按原報告保留。此比較未使用 Test 2 的 S 或 VUAA1 正規化 N。UCI 與 DoOR 圖的折間分散線亦未指定 SD／SE 或信賴區間定義。","The source describes an integer implementation, but this update supplies figures and methods rather than matching executable training code, fitted preprocessing, fold assignments, seeds or integer/float agreement tests. We therefore make no new device-speed, energy or integer-accuracy claim. The reader’s current":"來源描述整數實作，但此次更新提供圖與方法，未提供匹配的可執行訓練程式、已擬合前處理、折分配、種子或整數／浮點一致性測試。因此不新增裝置速度、能耗或整數準確率主張。讀取器目前的","reference-pattern backend":"參考模式後端","is distinct from a deployed PN–KC–MBON classifier. Earlier KT/UCI analyses, including their clock-error finding, remain in":"不同於已部署的 PN–KC–MBON 分類器。早期 KT／UCI 分析及其時鐘錯誤發現保留於","the historical supplement":"歷史補充資料","The post-addition fluorescence comparison reuses Test 2 recordings under a separately defined, vehicle-referenced metric and the experimenter-confirmed channel map; it is not another independent experiment. Weak across-receptor correlations are evidence of partial profile correspondence, not decoder accuracy. The computational cross-check runs the existing Pearson function only. A PN–KC–MBON inference run would require a fitted input transformation and compatible trained checkpoint, which are not supplied with these fluorescence data.":"加液後螢光比較重用 Test 2 紀錄，採另行定義的溶劑參考指標及實驗者確認通道圖，並非另一獨立實驗。微弱跨受體相關代表部分輪廓對應，而非解碼器準確率。計算交叉檢查僅執行現有 Pearson 函式。PN–KC–MBON 推論需要已擬合輸入轉換與相容訓練檢查點，這些未隨螢光資料提供。","The next computational priority is the KC→MBON readout, evaluated with fixed comparison folds and independent training runs. For receptor data, input resolution must match the number of available odorants.":"下一個計算優先目標為 KC→MBON 讀出，以固定比較折與獨立訓練執行評估。受體資料的輸入解析度須符合可用氣味分子數。","The post-addition fluorescence profiles provide a measured starting point for comparing the cell platform with the DoOR reference. Their odorant-dependent agreement motivates a future paired evaluation with fixed preprocessing and independently replicated cell measurements.":"加液後螢光輪廓提供將細胞平台與 DoOR 參考比較的實測起點。其依氣味分子而異的一致程度，支持未來以固定前處理及獨立重複細胞量測進行配對評估。",". Archive availability:":"。封存可用性：","the docking / OBP evidence record (PDF)":"分子對接／OBP 證據紀錄（PDF）","Watch optical slow motion — Video Universe":"觀看光學慢動作 — Video Universe","Watch filter signal comparison — Video Universe":"觀看濾光片訊號比較 — Video Universe","Watch surface arrival — Video Universe":"觀看液面到達 — Video Universe","Watch airflow comparison — Video Universe":"觀看氣流比較 — Video Universe","airflow/results/surface_arrival.csv — archive availability":"airflow/results/surface_arrival.csv — 封存可用性","The editable":"可編輯的","model manuscript":"模型文稿","preserves the current UCI/DoOR figures and settings; the":"保留目前 UCI／DoOR 圖表與設定；","engineering manuscript":"工程文稿","records the three redesign cycles. UCI-270 and DoOR are public source datasets. The older manuscript and four-feature NumPy MLP linked below document separate historical work.":"記錄三個重新設計循環。UCI-270 與 DoOR 是公開來源資料集。下方連結的舊文稿與四特徵 NumPy MLP 記錄其他歷史工作。","Archived model manuscript — GitLab":"封存模型文稿 — GitLab","Receptor analysis and figure source — GitLab":"受體分析與圖表來源 — GitLab","molecular-features/benchmark-data.zip — archive availability":"molecular-features/benchmark-data.zip — 封存可用性","functional-seven-measurements.csv — archive availability":"functional-seven-measurements.csv — 封存可用性","Current UCI and DoOR model parameters":"目前 UCI 與 DoOR 模型參數","These are the settings reported for the UCI analysis in the model source. They are simulation specifications, not values fitted to the AeroSense reader. Integer clipping described in the source is an implementation specification; device validation is not supplied.":"下列設定由模型來源的 UCI 分析回報，是模擬規格，不是對 AeroSense 讀取器擬合的數值。來源描述的整數截幅屬實作規格，未提供裝置驗證。","Network size reconstructed only from explicitly stated population counts.":"網路規模僅依明確記載的神經元數重建。","Population":"神經元群","UCI setting":"UCI 設定","400 (20 PCA components × 20 quantile bins)":"400（20 PCA 成分 × 20 分位數箱）","MBON / teacher":"MBON／教師","Neuron settings from the model record; units and bounds are preserved.":"模型紀錄中的神經元設定，保留單位與界限。","Symbol":"符號","Meaning":"意義","Range / limits":"範圍／限制","Membrane capacitance":"膜電容","Leak conductance":"漏電電導","Membrane time constant C / g_L = 10 ms":"膜時間常數 C / g_L = 10 ms","Resting potential":"靜止電位","Membrane potential":"膜電位","Starts at −70 mV":"起始 −70 mV","Physically bounded by E_GABA and E_AMPA (−80 to 0 mV); the integer engine clips V to this range":"受 E_GABA 與 E_AMPA 限制（−80 至 0 mV）；整數引擎將 V 截幅至此範圍","Firing threshold":"發放閾值","Fixed for PN, APL, MBON and teacher; adaptive for KCs (below)":"PN、APL、MBON 與教師固定；KC 可調適（如下）","Potential after a spike":"脈衝後電位","Refractory period 1 ms":"不反應期 1 ms","Excitatory reversal potential and decay":"興奮性反轉電位與衰減","Inhibitory reversal potential and decay":"抑制性反轉電位與衰減","Spike trace used by plasticity":"可塑性使用的脈衝軌跡","+0.1 per spike, decays with τ_x = 10 ms":"每次脈衝 +0.1，以 τ_x = 10 ms 衰減","Dimensionless, x ≥ 0":"無因次，x ≥ 0","KC intrinsic-plasticity settings.":"KC 內在可塑性設定。","Initial KC threshold":"KC 初始閾值","Threshold limits":"閾值界限","V_th always stays within [−60, 0] mV":"V_th 始終維持於 [−60, 0] mV","IP learning rate (threshold rise)":"IP 學習率（閾值上升）","0.005 ms⁻¹ × IP factor 3 ( ip = 3)":"0.005 ms⁻¹ × IP 係數 3（ip = 3）","Recovery rate (threshold fall)":"恢復率（閾值下降）","Acts only while the KC is silent (x < 10⁻⁶)":"只在 KC 靜默（x < 10⁻⁶）時作用","Connection weights and learning settings.":"連接權重與學習設定。","Weight per synapse":"每突觸權重","Limits / learning":"限制／學習","Random, then scaled so that each KC’s inputs sum to 800 nS (about 5 inputs of ~160 nS; p_pn_kc = 0.0125)":"隨機後縮放，使各 KC 輸入總和為 800 nS（約五個各 ~160 nS 的輸入；p_pn_kc = 0.0125）","Fixed":"固定","30 nS (all KCs)":"30 nS（全部 KC）","60 nS (all KCs; w_apl_kc )":"60 nS（全部 KC；w_apl_kc）","Each KC’s 6 outputs sum to 10 nS ( w_kc_mbon )":"各 KC 六個輸出總和為 10 nS（w_kc_mbon）","Each synapse within [0, 10] nS; STDP adds up to 0.0125 nS per KC–MBON spike pair ( learning_rate ; τ_pre = τ_post = 5 ms); outputs re-normalized after every training exposure":"各突觸介於 [0, 10] nS；每組 KC–MBON 脈衝對，STDP 最多增加 0.0125 nS（learning_rate；τ_pre = τ_post = 5 ms）；每次訓練曝露後輸出重新正規化","Teacher → MBON":"教師 → MBON","1,500 nS (one-to-one)":"1,500 nS（一對一）","Training only":"僅訓練","MBON → teacher":"MBON → 教師","200 nS (one-to-one)":"200 nS（一對一）","Silences the teacher once its MBON fires":"MBON 一旦發放，即抑制其教師","2,000 nS between different MBONs ( lateral )":"不同 MBON 間 2,000 nS（lateral）","Input and presentation schedule.":"輸入與呈現時程。","Item":"項目","2.05 nA injected into the 20 active PNs for 30 ms":"對 20 個活躍 PN 注入 2.05 nA，持續 30 ms","Teacher input":"教師輸入","10 nA into the teacher neuron of the correct gas, starting 1 ms after odor onset (training only)":"氣味開始後 1 ms，對正確氣體的教師神經元注入 10 nA（僅訓練）","Exposure timing":"曝露時序","30 ms exposure followed by a 3 ms gap":"曝露 30 ms，隨後間隔 3 ms","Up to 800 cycles; each cycle presents every gas once (6 exposures); tested after every 100 cycles":"最多 800 循環；每循環各氣體呈現一次（六次曝露）；每 100 循環測試","300 exposures per gas (1,800), with all learning frozen":"每氣體 300 次曝露（共 1,800），全部學習凍結","DoOR changes: 1,000 KCs; six PCA components; APL→KC 30 nS; intrinsic-plasticity factor 2; learning step 0.025 nS; five MBONs and teachers; 50 test presentations per class. Twenty equal-width bins use PN→KC probability 0.05 and 200 training cycles. Five quantile bins use probability 0.2 and 100 cycles.":"DoOR 變更：1,000 KC、六 PCA 成分、APL→KC 30 nS、內在可塑性係數 2、學習步長 0.025 nS、五 MBON 與教師、每類 50 次測試呈現。二十等寬箱採 PN→KC 機率 0.05、200 訓練循環；五分位數箱採機率 0.2、100 循環。","Biological pathway schematic":"生物路徑示意圖","Figure S21.":"圖 S21。","Original conceptual pathway illustration produced with OpenAI image generation and reviewed by the team; it is not an anatomical reconstruction. Sensory neurons project to the antennal lobe; PNs reach the mushroom body and lateral horn. The modeled route follows PNs to KCs and MBONs; the lateral horn is not modeled.":"以 OpenAI 圖像生成製作並由團隊審查的原創概念路徑圖，並非解剖重建。感覺神經元投射至觸角葉，PN 到達蕈狀體與側角。模型路徑沿 PN 至 KC、MBON，未建模側角。","AI assistance and team review":"AI 協助與團隊審查","Earlier KT/UCI decoder analysis and figures S1–S17":"早期 KT／UCI 解碼器分析及圖 S1–S17","This retained analysis uses earlier datasets, settings and splits. Its KT five-gas scores, drift studies and precision audit are historical evidence, not results of the UCI/DoOR comparison above. Original figure destinations remain available.":"保留分析使用早期資料集、設定與切分。KT 五氣體分數、漂移研究與精度稽核屬歷史證據，不是上方 UCI／DoOR 比較結果。原圖位置仍可取得。","The contribution of expansion depends on input statistics, connectivity and sparseness.":"展開的貢獻取決於輸入統計、連接與稀疏程度。","Bars are five-fold means; lines show source-reported fold spread, without a specified SD/SE definition. SNN loses about 0.14 macro-F1; the SVM comparisons lose about 0.09 and 0.12. This is not a chronological SNN drift evaluation.":"長條為五折平均，線段為來源回報的折間分散，未指定 SD／SE 定義。SNN 約損失 0.14 macro-F1；SVM 比較約損失 0.09、0.12。這不是按時間先後評估 SNN 漂移。","Figure S15.":"圖 S15。","Figure S16.":"圖 S16。","Figure S17.":"圖 S17。","Earlier KT/UCI methods, figures S18–S20 and reproducibility record":"早期 KT／UCI 方法、圖 S18–S20 與可重現性紀錄","The settings below belong to the earlier record. They do not replace the current 400-PN/2,000-KC UCI configuration or the DoOR settings above.":"下列設定屬早期紀錄，不取代目前 UCI 的 400-PN／2,000-KC 設定或上方 DoOR 設定。","Figure S18.":"圖 S18。","Figure S19.":"圖 S19。","Figure S20.":"圖 S20。","calcium responses digitized from Bohbot et al. (2011),":"鈣反應由 Bohbot 等人（2011）的圖中數位化取得，","; these are literature measurements, not our wet-lab results. The horizontal axis reverses the Vina":"；這是文獻量測，不是我們的濕實驗結果。橫軸反轉 Vina","Network schematic from the model record":"模型紀錄中的網路示意圖","Two input domains share the PN–KC–MBON pipeline: UCI-270 provides 128 sensor features per measurement, while DoOR provides ten receptor values per odorant":"兩種輸入共用 PN–KC–MBON 流程：UCI-270 每量測提供 128 感測器特徵，DoOR 每氣味分子提供十個受體值","DoOR consensus responses for 91 odorants and ten receptors":"91 種氣味分子與十種受體的 DoOR 共識反應","UCI-270 projected onto the first three principal components after standardization":"UCI-270 標準化後投影至前三主成分","DoOR odorants projected onto the first three principal components":"DoOR 氣味分子投影至前三主成分","UCI-270 macro-F1 on 1,800 test presentations at 100-cycle checkpoints in one run":"單次執行每 100 循環檢查點，於 1,800 次測試呈現評估 UCI-270 macro-F1","Class information accessible to a linear SVM at successive representations, after 800 UCI training cycles":"800 UCI 訓練循環後，線性 SVM 在連續各層表徵可取得的類別資訊","DoOR chemical-family macro-F1 on the same five odorant folds":"相同五個氣味分子折上的 DoOR 化學家族 macro-F1","Test 1 responses and DoOR reference patterns":"Test 1 反應與 DoOR 參考模式","Watch the trypsin–benzamidine recording on iGEM Video Universe":"於 iGEM Video Universe 觀看胰蛋白酶–苯甲脒紀錄","Table 1. Monte Carlo sampling budgets for the optical sweep, floor irradiance, detector collection map and additional filter study. Variation among seeds estimates numerical sampling uncertainty; it does not calibrate the physical instrument.":"表 1。光學掃描、底面輻照度、偵測器收集圖及額外濾光片研究的蒙地卡羅抽樣配置。種子間變異估計數值抽樣不確定性，不代表實體儀器校正。","Table 33. Nominal first-gas-layer arrival times: Q = 3 mL/min, D = 10 mm²/s, 100 µL per well, 0.4 mm grid and 0.25 s time step. Symmetric pairs follow the nominal geometry.":"表 33。名目第一氣體層到達時間：Q = 3 mL/min、D = 10 mm²/s、每井 100 µL、0.4 mm 網格與 0.25 秒步長。對稱配對依名目幾何而定。","Table 3. Operating-band comparison at the 3 mL/min candidate. These values sample 0.6–1.4 mm above the liquid; current first-layer results and checks are reported separately above.":"表 3。3 mL/min 候選操作範圍比較。數值採液面上 0.6–1.4 mm 區域；目前第一層結果與檢查另列於上方。","Table 5. Numerical optical, demodulation and transport predictions are paired with the physical measurements needed for validation. The table contains proposed validation pairs, not fitted experimental results.":"表 5。數值光學、解調與運輸預測，配對驗證所需的實體量測。表內為擬議驗證配對，不是擬合實驗結果。","Original conceptual pathway illustration produced with OpenAI image generation and reviewed by the team; it is not an anatomical reconstruction":"以 OpenAI 圖像生成製作並經團隊審查的原創概念路徑圖，並非解剖重建","Table 7. Gas concentration ranges represented in the five-class KT metal-oxide sensor dataset. These dataset ranges are not the concentrations used in AeroSense cell assays.":"表 7。五類 KT 金屬氧化物感測器資料集的氣體濃度範圍，並非 AeroSense 細胞試驗使用的濃度。","Table 8. Membrane, synaptic and threshold-adaptation parameters used in the simulated neurons. Values are settings from the team Model record; no fit to AeroSense measurements or row-specific literature derivation is archived.":"表 8。模擬神經元的膜、突觸與閾值調適參數。數值來自團隊模型紀錄設定；未封存對 AeroSense 量測的擬合或逐列文獻推導。","Table 9. Connection probabilities, conductances and learning rules in the simulated PN–KC–APL–MBON network. Fixed connections are distinguished from the plastic readout and training-only teacher input; these values are simulation settings.":"表 9。模擬 PN–KC–APL–MBON 網路的連接機率、電導與學習規則。固定連接與可塑讀出、僅訓練教師輸入分開標示；皆為模擬設定。","Table 10. Input currents, exposure timing and sampled presentation counts for KT decoder training and testing. Learning is frozen during testing; sampled presentations are simulation trials, not additional independent sensor measurements.":"表 10。KT 解碼器訓練測試的輸入電流、曝露時序與抽樣呈現數。測試時凍結學習；抽樣呈現屬模擬試次，不是額外獨立感測器量測。","Table 14. Assumptions required to transfer the metal-oxide proxy studies to AeroSense biology. Each row identifies the corresponding delivery, fluorescence, receptor, drift or calibration quantity that still requires measurement.":"表 14。將金屬氧化物替代研究轉移至 AeroSense 生物系統所需假設。每列指出仍需量測的輸送、螢光、受體、漂移或校正量。","Table 15. Available decoder documentation and the artifacts still required for an independent rerun. Reported equations and metrics do not replace executable code, resolved presets, fold assignments or prediction records.":"表 15。現有解碼器文件與獨立重跑仍需的檔案。方程式與指標不能取代可執行程式、明確設定、折分配或預測紀錄。","Table 17. Five prepared holdout definitions and the generalization question each asks. A defined split is not evidence that every model was evaluated on that split.":"表 17。五種已準備的保留驗證定義及各自泛化問題。定義切分不代表每個模型皆已在該切分評估。","Table 18. Matched feature ablation using the same response pairs, fixed folds and histogram-gradient-boosting settings. R² is reported for unseen chemical clusters and unseen receptors; the small full-model gain over ligand-plus-sequence features does not establish an additional structural-feature benefit.":"表 18。相同反應配對、固定折與直方圖梯度提升設定下的匹配特徵消融。分別報告未見化學群與未見受體 R²；完整模型相對配體加序列特徵的小增益，不能確立額外結構特徵效益。","Table 19. Historical model-development scores under different holdouts and representative model versions. R² and Spearman rank correlation are separate metrics; these rows must not be combined into the performance of one model.":"表 19。不同保留驗證與代表模型版本的歷史開發分數。R² 與 Spearman 排名相關為不同指標，不應將各列合併為單一模型效能。","Table 20. Eligible odorants, receptor–odorant pairs and chemical groups for each molecular-feature experiment. Each cohort receives its own retrained baseline, so scores from different rows are not directly interchangeable.":"表 20。各分子特徵實驗的合格氣味分子、受體–氣味配對與化學群。各群組各自重訓基準，因此不同列分數不能直接互換。","Table 21. Matched R² results for measured infrared features, descriptor removals and random-feature controls on 82 odorants. Chemical and receptor columns denote separate holdouts; the comparison tests predictive value, not a biological vibration mechanism.":"表 21。82 種氣味分子的實測紅外線特徵、描述子移除與隨機特徵對照之匹配 R²。化學與受體欄代表不同保留驗證；比較檢驗預測價值，不是生物振動機制。","Table 22. R² comparison on 85 odorants for full 800-dimensional EVA or computed-IR features, 16-component training-fold PCA and random-feature controls. Point changes do not establish a stable improvement across models and holdouts.":"表 22。85 種氣味分子的完整 800 維 EVA 或計算 IR 特徵、訓練折 16 成分 PCA 與隨機特徵對照之 R² 比較。點估計變化不能確立跨模型與保留驗證的穩定改善。","Table 23. R² comparison after retraining on the same 67-odorant, 1,608-pair measured/computed-spectrum overlap. Differences in spectral range, dimension and normalization remain, so the comparison does not isolate source accuracy.":"表 23。在相同 67 氣味、1,608 配對的實測／計算光譜交集重訓後比較 R²。光譜範圍、維度及正規化仍不同，因此不能單獨辨識來源準確性。","Table 24. R² results for frozen 256-dimensional OpenPOM features on 109 odorants, including fingerprint replacement, feature addition, random controls and a second fixed checkpoint. Effects depend on the response model; downstream holdout does not guarantee unseen molecules in upstream pretraining.":"表 24。109 種氣味分子的凍結 256 維 OpenPOM 特徵 R²，包含指紋替換、特徵加入、隨機對照與第二固定檢查點。效應依反應模型而異；下游保留驗證不保證上游預訓練未見過這些分子。","Table 16. Experimental cryo-EM references used for the OR10–Orco studies: odorant-free 8V00 and o-cresol-bound 8V02. Both combine Aedes aegypti OR10 with Apocrypta bakeri Orco; they are structural references rather than target Drosophila receptor measurements.":"表 16。OR10–Orco 研究使用的實驗冷凍電顯參考：無氣味分子 8V00 與鄰甲酚結合 8V02，皆結合埃及斑蚊 OR10 與 Apocrypta bakeri Orco。它們是結構參考，而非目標果蠅受體量測。","Table 27. Unresolved Orco sequence segments in the experimental 8V02 and 8V00 references, with the total residues rebuilt across each complex. Rebuilt coordinates are starting hypotheses rather than experimentally resolved loop conformations.":"表 27。實驗 8V02、8V00 參考中未解析的 Orco 序列區段，以及每複合體重建殘基總數。重建座標是起始假設，不是實驗解析的環區構形。","Table 28. Bound-state MD readouts in the prespecified 3–5 ns and 15–20 ns windows, summarized as mean ± SD across trajectory-level averages. Frames are correlated; continued rebuilt-region drift prevents these diagnostics from establishing equilibrium.":"表 28。預先指定 3–5 ns 與 15–20 ns 視窗的結合態 MD 讀出，以軌跡層級平均值的平均 ± SD 摘要。影格互相關；重建區域持續漂移，使診斷不能確立平衡。","Table 25. Or22a and Or35a substitutions included in the first computational structural screen. These are modeled constructs; similar predicted structures do not establish expression, stability or receptor function.":"表 25。首次計算結構篩查納入的 Or22a 與 Or35a 替換。這些是建模構築；相似預測結構不能確立表現、穩定性或受體功能。","Table 26. The selected eight mold-related and eight control odorants used in the docking panel-preference calculation. Preference refers to this score comparison and panel, not demonstrated mold specificity or receptor activation.":"表 26。對接面板偏好計算所選八種黴菌相關與八種對照氣味分子。偏好僅指此分數比較與面板，不是已證實的黴菌專一性或受體活化。","Table 30. Durations of baseline, receptor-distance guidance, target holding and bias removal in the three guided protocols. These schedules control receptor distances rather than pulling the ligand directly.":"表 30。三種導引流程的基準、受體距離導引、目標保持及移除偏壓時長。時程控制受體距離，並非直接拉動配體。","Table 31. Centerline lengths and peak positive-repulsion scores for two whole-ligand corridors in the fixed 63.2 ns snapshot. Protein-only and protein-plus-lipid scores diagnose clashes; they are not free-energy barriers or observed ligand passage.":"表 31。固定 63.2 ns 快照中兩條完整配體通道的中心線長度與正排斥峰值分數。僅蛋白與蛋白加脂質分數用於診斷碰撞，並非自由能障礙或已觀測配體通過。","Table 29. Mean per-molecule protein-contact time fractions for completed, checked 2 ns trajectories with one or twenty o-cresol molecules in starting models A and B. This incomplete exploratory comparison measures surface contact, not sustained pocket entry, a concentration–response curve or an association rate.":"表 29。起始模型 A、B 中一個或二十個鄰甲酚分子、已完成核對的 2 ns 軌跡之每分子平均蛋白接觸時間比例。此未完成探索比較衡量表面接觸，不是持續進入口袋、濃度反應曲線或結合速率。","Table 32. Inference boundaries for prediction, mutation, starting structures and molecular pathways, paired with the comparisons defined to address them.":"表 32。預測、突變、起始結構與分子路徑的推論界限，及為處理這些界限所定義的比較。","· Planned":"· 規劃中","Select a block to trace its expression pathway. CMV and BGH poly(A) are shared pcDNA3.1(+) backbone features; the catalogue identifies the registered AeroSense parts.":"選取區塊追蹤其表現路徑。CMV 與 BGH poly(A) 是共用 pcDNA3.1(+) 骨架特徵；目錄標明已登錄的 AeroSense 元件。","The sensing and reporting modules":"感測與報導模組","Select any protein to highlight its matching translation product. Tuning OR and Orco are at the membrane. Intracellular GCaMP6f is linked to Orco; mCherry is separate. Conceptual topology, not an atomic structure or subunit count.":"選取任一蛋白，凸顯對應轉譯產物。調諧 OR 與 Orco 位於膜上；細胞內 GCaMP6f 連結 Orco，mCherry 則獨立存在。此為概念拓樸，不是原子結構或次單元數。","Select a protein to highlight its translation product. The diagram represents the designed topology; structural and functional evidence is documented separately.":"選取蛋白以凸顯其轉譯產物。圖示代表設計拓樸；結構與功能證據另行記錄。","The 25-part documentation connects design, construction records, microscopy and the two exploratory odor tests. Original RFU exports and microscopy TIFFs:":"25 個元件的文件連結設計、構築紀錄、顯微影像與兩項探索氣味測試。原始 RFU 匯出與顯微 TIFF：","Test 1 well summary (CSV)":"Test 1 孔位摘要（CSV）","Test 1 control contrasts (CSV)":"Test 1 對照對比（CSV）","Highlight Orco channel partner":"凸顯 Orco 通道夥伴","Highlight flexible linker":"凸顯柔性連接序列","Highlight GCaMP6f calcium reporter":"凸顯 GCaMP6f 鈣離子報導蛋白","Highlight separate mCherry expression marker":"凸顯獨立 mCherry 表現標記","Copy BBa_269VSDDR":"複製 BBa_269VSDDR","Dynamics and DoOR":"動態與 DoOR","Three light-sheet recordings show regional signals during odor delivery. Colony plates and DNA gels document construct preparation; microscopy fields and two kinetic odor assays show reporter-associated fluorescence alongside their controls.":"三段光片紀錄呈現氣味輸送期間的區域訊號。菌落盤與 DNA 膠記錄構築製備；顯微視野及兩項動態氣味試驗，與各自對照一起呈現報導相關螢光。","AeroSense approaches odor sensing as a pattern distributed across channels. We examined that principle by following regional fluorescence during odor delivery. TH-GFP reveals labeled structures; GH146-GCaMP6f records regional fluorescence across seven odor presentations. The two GH146 recordings come from the same fly.":"AeroSense 將氣味感測視為跨通道分布的模式。我們追蹤氣味輸送時的區域螢光，以檢視此原理。TH-GFP 呈現標記結構；GH146-GCaMP6f 記錄七次氣味呈現的區域螢光。兩段 GH146 紀錄來自同一果蠅。","defines the measured regions; the recordings show their image context, and":"界定量測區域；影像紀錄呈現其背景，而","compares regional time courses with whole-image means.":"將區域時間曲線與全影像平均比較。","In the shared three-odor sequence, the middle and upper GH146 regions showed mean local ΔF/F₀ changes of +1.73% to +2.67%, while the right region ranged from −0.61% to +0.48%. Across the four additional odor windows, regional means ranged from −1.00% to +1.56%.":"在共用三氣味序列中，中間與上方 GH146 區域的平均局部 ΔF/F₀ 變化為 +1.73% 至 +2.67%，右側為 −0.61% 至 +0.48%。另四個氣味視窗的區域平均介於 −1.00% 至 +1.56%。","Figures 3 and 4":"圖 3 與圖 4","align each odor window to stimulus onset and its own pre-odor baseline, allowing the regional patterns to be compared locally.":"將各氣味視窗對齊刺激起始及自身氣味前基線，以比較局部區域模式。","The engineered-cell experiments required twelve vector constructs. We selected isolated colonies for plasmid preparation and subsequent DNA checks.":"工程細胞實驗需要十二個載體構築。我們挑選分離菌落，進行質體製備與後續 DNA 檢查。","Figures 5–7":"圖 5–7","show colony plates from this twelve-vector set; the markings identify the colonies selected for follow-up.":"呈現十二載體組的菌落盤；標記指出後續使用的菌落。","Before transfection, we checked whether DNA was detectable in the plasmid preparations and whether paired samples showed comparable migration patterns.":"轉染前，我們檢查質體製備中能否偵測 DNA，以及配對樣本的泳動模式是否相近。","groups the undigested preparations by construct label beside the Bio-1Kb™ Mass DNA Ladder (PROTECH).":"依構築標籤排列未切割製備，旁列 Bio-1Kb™ Mass DNA Ladder（PROTECH）。","The construct design pairs mCherry with the OR cassette and GCaMP6f with the calcium-reporting module. Before testing fluorescence kinetics, we examined the reporter channels alongside cell density and the nuclear reference.":"構築設計將 mCherry 與 OR 表現盒配對、GCaMP6f 與鈣離子報導模組配對。測試螢光動態前，我們將報導通道與細胞密度及細胞核參考一併檢視。","shows matched brightfield, DAPI, RED and GREEN images from each field.":"呈現各視野匹配的明視野、DAPI、RED 與 GREEN 影像。","We quantified the fraction of eligible DAPI objects exceeding the blank-derived reporter threshold in each channel.":"我們量化各通道合格 DAPI 物件中，超過空白導出報導閾值的比例。","shows individual technical fields and the pooled fraction, calculated as total positive objects divided by total eligible objects. The complete counts and denominators are retained in Supplementary data, Table 1.":"呈現個別技術視野與合併比例，後者為陽性物件總數除以合格物件總數。完整計數與分母保留於補充資料表 1。","The blank yielded 1/170 eligible objects above each channel threshold. The mCherry-free Orco-only condition yielded 0/342 RED-positive and 24/342 GREEN-positive objects, separating the two reporter channels within this image set.":"空白條件各通道皆有 1/170 合格物件超過閾值。未含 mCherry 的僅 Orco 條件，RED 陽性為 0/342、GREEN 為 24/342，在此影像集中區分兩個報導通道。","We followed fluorescence over time in ten OR + ORCO conditions, ORCO-only cells and the control condition specified for each test.":"我們追蹤十種 OR + ORCO、僅 ORCO 細胞，以及各測試指定對照條件的螢光時間變化。","Figures 11–14":"圖 11–14","show Test 1 and Test 2 time courses, condition comparisons, control-referenced maps and the Test 2 VUAA1-referenced map.":"呈現 Test 1、Test 2 時間序列、條件比較、對照參考圖及 Test 2 VUAA1 參考圖。","Test 2 contains 72 wells and 1,440 readings across ten OR + ORCO conditions, ORCO-only cells and the blank control. Each construct × stimulus has one well.":"Test 2 包含十種 OR + ORCO、僅 ORCO 細胞及空白對照，共 72 孔、1,440 筆讀值。各構築 × 刺激只有一孔。","VUAA1 is an established Orco agonist used in heterologous receptor assays.":"VUAA1 是已知 Orco 致效劑，用於異源受體試驗。","Normalized VUAA1 and control time courses in Test 1 and Test 2. Test 1 uses each well’s paired baseline; Test 2 uses the first post-addition reading. Each trace represents one well, and panels have independent vertical scales.":"Test 1、Test 2 正規化 VUAA1 與對照時間曲線。Test 1 使用各孔配對基線；Test 2 使用加液後首筆讀值。每條曲線代表一孔，各面板垂直尺度獨立。","In Test 2, ten of twelve VUAA1 time courses end above their first reading, while eleven conditions have a positive corrected change. Or7a + ORCO and the blank control end lower; a positive corrected score does not necessarily mean that the measured trace rises.":"Test 2 十二條 VUAA1 曲線中，十條終點高於首筆讀值，十一種條件有正校正變化。Or7a + ORCO 與空白終點較低；正校正分數不一定代表實測曲線上升。","VUAA1 signals and control behavior":"VUAA1 訊號與對照行為","compares all twelve conditions. In Test 2, corrected changes are +36.67 pp for Or98a + ORCO, +18.69 pp for ORCO only and −0.11 pp for the blank control.":"比較全部十二種條件。Test 2 校正變化：Or98a + ORCO 為 +36.67 pp、僅 ORCO +18.69 pp、空白 −0.11 pp。","All twelve conditions. Test 1 shows peak test excursions (%), while Test 2 shows corrected changes (pp); these test-specific summaries are displayed separately.":"全部十二種條件。Test 1 呈現測試峰值變化（%），Test 2 呈現校正變化（pp）；各測試專屬摘要分開顯示。","Test 1 includes a large positive buffer-control signal, whereas the twelve Test 2 DMSO-control scores range from −1.79 to −0.31 pp. The corrected values are descriptive results from individual wells, rather than activation thresholds.":"Test 1 有很大的正緩衝液對照訊號；Test 2 十二個 DMSO 對照分數介於 −1.79 至 −0.31 pp。校正值為個別孔的描述性結果，不是活化門檻。","Responses relative to assay controls":"相對試驗對照的反應","adds the six-stimulus Test 2 screen to the original response maps. Test 2 corrected VUAA1 values range from −0.11 to +39.23 pp. Valeric acid spans −0.77 to +8.17 pp; the other three odor rows range from −2.06 to +1.36 pp. We show vehicle subtraction and the blank adjustment separately so that control-dependent changes remain visible.":"在原始反應圖加入六刺激 Test 2 篩查。Test 2 校正 VUAA1 為 −0.11 至 +39.23 pp；戊酸 −0.77 至 +8.17 pp；另三氣味列 −2.06 至 +1.36 pp。我們分開呈現溶劑相減與空白調整，使對照依賴的變化保持可見。","Response maps with Test 1 on the left and Test 2 on the right, receptors in rows and stimuli in columns, on a shared −60 to +60 pp scale. The first ten receptor labels denote OR + ORCO; hatched Test 1 isopentyl-acetate cells remain excluded, and separate-well control subtraction does not establish receptor specificity.":"反應圖左為 Test 1、右為 Test 2，列為受體、欄為刺激，共用 −60 至 +60 pp 尺度。前十受體標籤表示 OR + ORCO；斜線 Test 1 乙酸異戊酯資料格仍排除於分析，獨立孔對照相減不能確立受體專一性。","Responses relative to each construct’s VUAA1 reference":"相對各構築 VUAA1 參考的反應","compares each Test 2 odor response with the VUAA1 reference for the same construct, after subtracting its DMSO control. Construct-specific VUAA1 referencing has been used in heterologous receptor assays.":"扣除 DMSO 後，將各 Test 2 氣味反應與相同構築的 VUAA1 參考比較。構築專屬 VUAA1 參考曾用於異源受體試驗。","Test 2 VUAA1-referenced responses, with DMSO set to 0 and VUAA1 to 1 for each construct and one well per condition; The ten tuning OR conditions coexpress ORCO. Orange cells retain negative ratios; †Or7a has a small VUAA1 reference (2.19 pp), making its ratios particularly sensitive to that reference.":"Test 2 VUAA1 參考反應：各構築將 DMSO 設為 0、VUAA1 設為 1，每條件一孔；十種調諧 OR 皆共表現 ORCO。橘色保留負比值；†Or7a 的 VUAA1 參考很小（2.19 pp），使比值對參考特別敏感。","post-addition fluorescence dynamics and the DoOR reference":"加液後螢光動態與 DoOR 參考","A separate analysis of the retained post-addition fluorescence readings compares four odorant profiles across ten OR + ORCO conditions with the DoOR receptor database. The two views below place measured, vehicle-referenced fluorescence changes beside the receptor patterns used to inform our decoding work. The analysis uses the experimenter-confirmed channel labels and source-cell mapping in the post-addition fluorescence workbook; it reuses the Test 2 post-addition fluorescence records.":"獨立分析保留的加液後螢光讀值，將十種 OR + ORCO 條件的四氣味輪廓與 DoOR 受體資料庫比較。下方兩種視圖把實測、溶劑參考螢光變化與啟發解碼工作的受體模式並列。分析使用實驗者確認的工作簿通道標籤及來源儲存格對應，重用 Test 2 加液後紀錄。","shows distinct profiles across the four odorants. Valeric acid has the largest positive contrast, +6.97 percentage points (pp) for the supplied Or22a channel, followed by +3.02 pp for Or67a and +2.98 pp for Or35a. Isopentyl acetate is highest for Or42a (+1.35 pp), while pentyl acetate is highest for Or67a (+1.74 pp). Values retain their signs and are shown on a common fluorescence scale.":"呈現四種氣味分子的不同輪廓。戊酸在所提供 Or22a 通道的正對比最大（+6.97 百分點），其次 Or67a +3.02 pp、Or35a +2.98 pp。乙酸異戊酯以 Or42a 最高（+1.35 pp），乙酸戊酯以 Or67a 最高（+1.74 pp）。數值保留正負號，使用共用螢光尺度。","post-addition fluorescence odorant-minus-DMSO contrasts (top, pp) and DoOR consensus minus receptor-specific spontaneous firing rate, SFR (bottom, DoOR units). The scales differ between panels. Each experimental condition has one well; all ten tuning OR conditions coexpress ORCO. The grey cell is the missing Or42a–valeric acid DoOR value. The fluorescence contrast compares early and late three-reading means;":"加液後螢光的氣味減 DMSO 對比（上，pp），以及 DoOR 共識減去受體自發放電率 SFR（下，DoOR 單位）。面板尺度不同。每實驗條件一孔，十種調諧 OR 皆共表現 ORCO。灰格為缺少的 Or42a–戊酸 DoOR 值。螢光對比比較早期與晚期各三筆平均；","Experiments gives the calculation":"實驗頁提供計算方式",". DoOR-derived material:":"。DoOR 衍生素材：","The across-receptor comparisons show weak positive association with DoOR for 2-heptanone (Pearson r = +0.317; Spearman ρ = +0.406), isopentyl acetate (r = +0.325; ρ = +0.442) and valeric acid (r = +0.211; ρ = +0.283). Pentyl acetate is close to zero (r = −0.002; ρ = +0.006). Thus, the experimental profiles share part of the database ordering for three odorants, with agreement depending on the odorant.":"跨受體比較顯示與 DoOR 弱正相關：2-庚酮 Pearson r = +0.317、Spearman ρ = +0.406；乙酸異戊酯 r = +0.325、ρ = +0.442；戊酸 r = +0.211、ρ = +0.283。乙酸戊酯近零（r = −0.002、ρ = +0.006）。因此三種氣味分子的實驗輪廓部分共享資料庫排序，一致程度依氣味分子而異。","Each point is one receptor–odorant pair. Correlations are calculated separately within each odorant: n = 10 receptors, except valeric acid (n = 9 because Or42a is missing from DoOR). ORCO-only and blank controls are retained in the analysis package and excluded from these tuning-OR correlations. Values use the supplied three-point-window calculation. DoOR-derived material:":"每點是一組受體–氣味配對。各氣味分別計算相關：n = 10 受體，戊酸因 DoOR 缺 Or42a 而為 n = 9。僅 ORCO 與空白保留於分析套件，排除於調諧 OR 相關。數值採所提供三點視窗計算。DoOR 衍生素材：","The Test 2 VUAA1 time courses show within-acquisition rises in most receptor conditions. After subtracting each well’s F0 change, eleven conditions are positive and the blank value is close to zero. Test 1 and Test 2 use different control designs and calculations, so they provide separate observations rather than interchangeable estimates.":"Test 2 多數受體條件的 VUAA1 在擷取內上升。扣除各孔 F0 變化後，十一條件為正，空白近零。Test 1 與 Test 2 對照及計算不同，屬獨立觀察，不能互換估計。","In Test 1, the ORCO-only VUAA1 well showed an 11.86% fluorescence excursion, compared with 0.98% in the untransfected well. The 35.25% excursion in a buffer-only well shows why a rise alone cannot establish ligand-specific activation.":"Test 1 僅 ORCO 的 VUAA1 孔螢光變化為 11.86%，未轉染孔為 0.98%。純緩衝液孔變化達 35.25%，說明僅憑上升不能確立配體專一性活化。","The fixed-cell screen at 44–48 h and Test 1 at approximately 72 h are separate pre-selection records. Their position in the workflow does not establish that they came from the same cell batch.":"44–48 小時固定細胞篩查與約 72 小時 Test 1 是分開的篩選前紀錄。流程位置不能確立其來自同一細胞批次。","Test 1 used a laboratory plate reader. These results characterize the biological assay; they do not establish the performance of the assembled AeroSense reader.":"Test 1 使用實驗室微孔盤讀取器。結果描述生物試驗，不代表組裝後 AeroSense 讀取器效能。","Control comparisons use separate single wells and describe fluorescence patterns rather than receptor-specific activation. Test 2 includes a DMSO reference; Test 1 lacks a matched vehicle control. Unrecorded gain, cell-state variation and dilution-only concentration records limit interpretation. Vehicle-matched tests at documented doses in independent cultures are needed to separate these effects.":"對照比較使用不同單孔，描述螢光模式而非受體專一性活化。Test 2 有 DMSO 參考，Test 1 缺匹配溶劑對照。未記錄增益、細胞狀態變異與僅記稀釋倍數的濃度資料限制解讀。需獨立培養、記錄劑量且匹配溶劑的測試，才能分離這些效應。","The post-addition fluorescence comparison provides an exploratory connection between the cell measurements and the DoOR reference used in Model. Its metric is C = D":"加液後螢光比較提供細胞量測與模型所用 DoOR 參考的探索性連結。其指標為 C = D",", based on early and late post-addition fluorescence means; it is distinct from the F0-subtracted S values and VUAA1-referenced N ratios above. Positive C can represent a smaller decline than DMSO, rather than a rising trace. The experimenter confirmed matched DMSO fraction and addition volume, while gain consistency and addition-to-first-read delay remain unconfirmed. The experimenter-confirmed post-addition fluorescence channel map supersedes the earlier Test 2 receptor labels; the underlying fluorescence readings are unchanged.":"，依加液後早期與晚期螢光平均計算，與上方扣除 F0 的 S 及 VUAA1 參考 N 不同。正 C 可能只是下降比 DMSO 少，不代表曲線上升。實驗者確認 DMSO 比例與加液量匹配，增益一致性及加液至首讀延遲仍未確認。實驗者確認的加液後通道圖取代早期 Test 2 受體標籤；底層讀值不變。","The first three odorants show weak positive cross-platform agreement, while pentyl acetate does not. Leaving one receptor out gives Pearson ranges of +0.080 to +0.502, +0.198 to +0.488, +0.169 to +0.550 and −0.284 to +0.182, respectively. These ranges describe sensitivity to receptor selection, not confidence intervals. One well per condition, shared DMSO references and different measurement platforms limit transfer claims; timepoints do not increase biological n. This reanalysis does not provide an independent experimental validation, receptor-specific activation test or demonstrated fluorescence-to-odor classifier.":"前三氣味呈弱正跨平台一致，乙酸戊酯則否。留一受體分析的 Pearson 範圍依序為 +0.080 至 +0.502、+0.198 至 +0.488、+0.169 至 +0.550、−0.284 至 +0.182。這些是對受體選擇的敏感度，不是信賴區間。每條件一孔、共享 DMSO 與平台差異限制轉移主張；時間點不增加生物 n。本重分析不提供獨立實驗驗證、受體專一活化測試或已證實的螢光轉氣味分類器。","The odor assays provide time-resolved evidence of VUAA1-associated fluorescence. In Test 2, F0-subtracted VUAA1 changes are +36.67 pp for Or98a + ORCO, +17.52 pp for Or85b + ORCO, +29.46 pp for Or35a + ORCO, and +18.69 pp for ORCO only, compared with −0.11 pp in the blank control. The control maps and retained raw records make these observations inspectable.":"氣味試驗提供 VUAA1 相關螢光的時間解析證據。Test 2 扣除 F0 後，VUAA1 變化為 Or98a + ORCO +36.67 pp、Or85b + ORCO +17.52 pp、Or35a + ORCO +29.46 pp、僅 ORCO +18.69 pp，空白則 −0.11 pp。對照圖與保留原始紀錄使觀察可供檢查。","The post-addition fluorescence reanalysis adds odorant-dependent comparisons with DoOR: weak positive across-receptor associations for three odorants and near-zero association for pentyl acetate. The shared reference makes the measured profiles and their correspondence to the decoding database directly inspectable.":"加液後重分析加入依氣味而異的 DoOR 比較：三種氣味跨受體弱正相關，乙酸戊酯近零。共用參考讓實測輪廓及其與解碼資料庫的對應可直接檢視。","Test 2 odor-assay archive":"Test 2 氣味試驗封存資料","The complete Test 2 raw-data package is prepared locally for Zenodo; no public deposit has been verified. The package contains twelve unchanged XLSX exports, checksums, 1,440 observations with source-cell references, 72 corrected summaries, matched-window sensitivity values and reproducible analysis scripts. The earlier mean-ratio calculation is retained only as a secondary audit metric. All corrected values are available in the supplementary tables.":"完整 Test 2 原始資料包已於本機為 Zenodo 準備，尚無經核實的公開存放。包含十二份未變更 XLSX、校驗碼、1,440 筆具來源儲存格的觀測、72 份校正摘要、匹配視窗敏感度值及重現分析程式。早期平均比值僅保留為次要稽核指標，全部校正值可於補充表格取得。","Test 2 correction and VUAA1-reference source":"Test 2 校正與 VUAA1 參考來源","Corrected Test 2 changes · CSV":"Test 2 校正變化 · CSV","Corrected Test 2 observations · CSV":"Test 2 校正觀測 · CSV","Corrected Test 2 summary · JSON":"Test 2 校正摘要 · JSON","Corrected Test 2 VUAA1-referenced scores · CSV":"Test 2 校正 VUAA1 參考分數 · CSV","Corrected Test 2 well summary · CSV":"Test 2 校正孔位摘要 · CSV","Complete odor-assay curves":"完整氣味試驗曲線","The complete-curve analysis preserves the original acquisition boundaries and checks every plotted reading against the canonical exports. The scalable figure, chart-data tables and endpoint audit accompany the single reproducible builder.":"完整曲線分析保留原擷取邊界，並將每個繪圖讀值與標準原始匯出核對。可縮放圖、繪圖資料表與終點稽核隨單一可重現建構程式提供。","Full-size vector figure · SVG":"完整尺寸向量圖 · SVG","All 5,280 raw curve readings · CSV":"全部 5,280 筆原始曲線讀值 · CSV","Test 2 referenced time courses · CSV":"Test 2 參考時間曲線 · CSV","endpoint checks · CSV":"終點檢查 · CSV","Test 1 peak-metric checks · CSV":"Test 1 峰值指標檢查 · CSV","Original acquisition source checksums · JSON":"原始擷取來源校驗碼 · JSON","Original complete-curve analysis source":"原始完整曲線分析來源","Original complete-curve reproduction guide":"原始完整曲線重現指南","Test 1 kinetic assay":"Test 1 動態試驗","Test 1 source and archive —":"Test 1 來源與封存資料 —","Test 1 analysis source — GitLab":"Test 1 分析來源 — GitLab","Full raw-data archive availability":"完整原始資料封存可用性","— the complete archive preserves 32 exact instrument exports, filename map, source analysis, tidy data, independent calculations, English figures and executed methods. The numerical analysis uses only Python’s standard library. Original inputs are preserved, including the source report whose claims are audited.":"— 完整封存保留 32 份逐位元相同儀器匯出、檔名對應、來源分析、整齊資料、獨立計算、英文圖表與實際方法。數值分析只用 Python 標準函式庫。原始輸入均保留，包括接受主張稽核的來源報告。","The dataset contains 100 individual-channel images across 25 fields, 12 pre-existing merges and the experimental workbook. Individual channels are 2592 × 1944 pixels; fluorescence images are 8-bit pseudocolored exports. Measurements use the individual channels and the condition and field identifiers in the supplied source folders. The WL-MIC-01 reanalysis retains the original acquisition and single-experiment scope. Acquisition metadata, processing parameters and source-file checksums accompany the analysis.":"資料集含 25 視野的 100 張單通道影像、12 張既有合成圖與實驗工作簿。單通道為 2592 × 1944 像素，螢光影像為 8 位元偽彩色匯出。量測採單通道及來源資料夾條件／視野識別。WL-MIC-01 重分析保留原擷取與單次實驗範圍，附擷取中繼資料、處理參數及來源校驗碼。","Original TIFF archive availability":"原始 TIFF 封存可用性","Files —":"檔案 —","Microscopy analysis source — GitLab":"顯微影像分析來源 — GitLab","Browse files —":"瀏覽檔案 —","CSV — archive availability":"CSV — 封存可用性","Microscopy analysis report · PDF":"顯微影像分析報告 · PDF","XLSX — archive availability":"XLSX — 封存可用性","GH146 numerical dataset — archive availability":"GH146 數值資料集 — 封存可用性","TH numerical dataset — archive availability":"TH 數值資料集 — 封存可用性","Watch TH-GFP recording — Video Universe":"觀看 TH-GFP 紀錄 — Video Universe","Watch GH146-GCaMP6f, three odors — Video Universe":"觀看 GH146-GCaMP6f 三氣味紀錄 — Video Universe","Watch GH146-GCaMP6f, four odors — Video Universe":"觀看 GH146-GCaMP6f 四氣味紀錄 — Video Universe","Measured segmentation parameters · JSON":"實測分割參數 · JSON","Light-sheet plotting source":"光片繪圖來源","post-addition fluorescence dynamic comparison":"加液後螢光動態比較","The complete archive includes the 1,080-reading source workbook with cell references, all 72 dynamic summaries, 48 vehicle contrasts, DoOR provenance, missing-value records and leave-one-receptor-out checks.":"完整封存包含 1,080 讀值且附儲存格來源的工作簿、全部 72 動態摘要、48 溶劑對比、DoOR 來源、缺值紀錄與留一受體檢查。","Analysis code, validation code and reproduction guide — GitLab":"分析程式、驗證程式與重現指南 — GitLab",". The complete data package is retained in the prepared research archive; public deposit status is described in the archive availability record. The existing reference-pattern backend Pearson function independently reproduced the four reported coefficients.":"。完整資料包保留於已準備的研究封存，公開存放狀態見可用性紀錄。現有參考模式後端的 Pearson 函式獨立重現四個回報係數。","An image can look broadly fluorescent even when little signal is locally distinguishable around a resolved object. To examine that difference,":"影像可能廣泛發螢光，但在解析物件周圍能局部區分的訊號很少。為檢視此差異，","compares the median field-level fluorescent-area percentage with the pooled positive-object fraction. The area denominator is the analyzed image pixels outside the fixed annotation exclusion; the object denominator is the eligible DAPI objects across the acquired fields. This asks whether broad area and localized object contrast vary together, rather than assuming they measure the same property.":"比較視野層級螢光面積百分比中位數與合併陽性物件比例。面積分母為固定註記排除區外的分析像素；物件分母為所有擷取視野的合格 DAPI 物件。此比較詢問廣泛面積與局部物件對比是否共同變動，而非假定兩者量測同一屬性。","Complete odor-assay time courses":"完整氣味試驗時間曲線","Open the vector figure at full size to inspect every cell condition and acquisition. The four Test 1 panels and two Test 2 panels retain all 5,280 raw readings; the right column contains 990 Test 2 normalized points.":"開啟完整尺寸向量圖，檢視每個細胞條件與擷取。Test 1 四面板與 Test 2 兩面板保留全部 5,280 原始讀值；右欄包含 990 個 Test 2 正規化點。","Complete raw time courses for Test 1 and Test 2, with all stimuli and controls. Dashed Test 1 curves remain visible despite their exclusion from corrected metrics for reported gain mismatch. Acquisition times restart at zero; raw panels share a vertical scale within each test and cell condition. Test 2 N(t) uses a fixed endpoint VUAA1 reference, so only its final VUAA1 point is set to 1. All 66 eligible final points match":"Test 1、Test 2 全部刺激與對照的完整原始時間曲線。Test 1 虛線曲線雖因回報增益不匹配而排除於校正指標，仍保持可見。各擷取從零計時；同一測試與細胞條件的原始面板共用垂直尺度。Test 2 N(t) 使用固定終點 VUAA1 參考，故只有最後 VUAA1 點設為 1。全部 66 個合格終點皆符合",". Starting offsets, negative values and values above 1 are retained. Each trace is one well; the Test 2 blank has raw curves but no construct-referenced ratio.":"。起始偏移、負值與大於 1 的值保留。每曲線一孔；Test 2 空白有原始曲線，但無構築參考比值。","The measured 48 s F0 endpoint change is subtracted as a constant from each post-addition trajectory; no F0 trace is extended to 168 s. Or7a has the smallest VUAA1-minus-DMSO reference (2.19 pp), making its ratios sensitive to that denominator.":"將實測 48 秒 F0 終點變化作為常數，從每條加液後曲線扣除；未將 F0 曲線延伸至 168 秒。Or7a 的 VUAA1 減 DMSO 參考最小（2.19 pp），使比值對分母敏感。","Trajectory definition and measurement scope":"曲線定義與量測範圍","Curve tables, endpoint checks and reproduction source":"曲線表、終點檢查與重現來源","Test 2 odor assay: all 72 corrected values":"Test 2 氣味試驗：全部 72 個校正值","Each table follows the Test 2 plate order. S uses post-addition 0–168 s minus F0 0–48 s. S48 uses both acquisitions over 0–48 s. Values are percentage points; one well contributes to each condition. Negative values and all controls are retained.":"各表依 Test 2 孔盤順序。S 為加液後 0–168 秒減 F0 0–48 秒；S48 兩次擷取皆採 0–48 秒。單位百分點，各條件一孔，保留負值與全部對照。","F0-subtracted change S (pp)":"扣除 F0 的變化 S（pp）","Pentyl acetate":"乙酸戊酯","DMSO control":"DMSO 對照","Blank":"空白","DMSO-subtracted change (pp)":"扣除 DMSO 的變化（pp）","DMSO and blank double difference (pp)":"DMSO 與空白雙重差分（pp）","Matched 0–48 s change S48 (pp)":"匹配 0–48 秒變化 S48（pp）","VUAA1-reference normalization":"VUAA1 參考正規化","For Test 2, S is the F0-subtracted change defined above. For each construct c and stimulus s, N(s,c) = [S(s,c) − S(DMSO,c)] / [S(VUAA1,c) − S(DMSO,c)]. This sets the measured DMSO and VUAA1 reference wells to 0 and 1; it does not impose a biological response bound. Negative ratios and ratios above 1 remain valid numerical outcomes and are not clipped.":"Test 2 的 S 為上述扣除 F0 的變化。對構築 c 與刺激 s，N(s,c) = [S(s,c) − S(DMSO,c)] / [S(VUAA1,c) − S(DMSO,c)]。這將實測 DMSO 與 VUAA1 參考孔設為 0、1，但不限制生物反應範圍。負比值及大於 1 的比值均為有效數值結果，不截幅。","All eleven Test 2 receptor-containing denominators are positive (2.19–39.54 pp). Seven of the 44 odor ratios are negative, and none exceeds 1. Or7a’s denominator is only 2.19 pp, compared with at least 9.43 pp for the other constructs; its valeric-acid ratio of 0.972 comes from a 2.13 pp vehicle-subtracted response. The blank control is omitted from the construct-referenced ratio.":"Test 2 十一個含受體分母皆為正（2.19–39.54 pp）。44 個氣味比值中七個為負，無大於 1。Or7a 分母僅 2.19 pp，其他構築至少 9.43 pp；其戊酸比值 0.972 來自扣溶劑後 2.13 pp 反應。空白不列入構築參考比值。","Test 1 is not shown in this normalized map: eight of its eleven buffer-referenced VUAA1 denominators are nonpositive, and its buffer row is not a matched DMSO vehicle. Direct and control-referenced ratios for both tests are retained in the research audit. These single-well ratios cannot remove well-to-well transfection differences or supply uncertainty estimates.":"此正規化圖不含 Test 1：其十一個緩衝液參考 VUAA1 分母有八個非正，且緩衝液列並非匹配 DMSO。兩項測試的直接與對照參考比值保留於研究稽核。單孔比值不能消除孔間轉染差異或提供不確定性估計。","Test 2 VUAA1-referenced ratios":"Test 2 VUAA1 參考比值","Processing definitions":"處理定義","For Test 2, we calculate the endpoint change within each acquisition and subtract the F0 change from the post-addition change. S is expressed in percentage points (pp). For Or98a + ORCO with VUAA1, +34.09% − (−2.57%) gives +36.67 pp using unrounded values. ORCO only gives +18.69 pp, while the blank control gives −0.11 pp.":"Test 2 計算各次擷取內的終點變化，從加液後變化扣除 F0 變化。S 單位為百分點（pp）。Or98a + ORCO 的 VUAA1 以未四捨五入值計算，+34.09% −（−2.57%）得到 +36.67 pp；僅 ORCO +18.69 pp，空白 −0.11 pp。","The Test 2 subtraction compares a 168 s post-addition window with a 48 s F0 window. It is a descriptive disturbance correction, not a fitted bleaching correction. A matched 0–48 s calculation is included in the numerical audit: the eleven receptor-containing VUAA1 conditions remain positive, while the blank value is −7.83 pp. For VUAA1, the shorter window preserves the direction but changes the magnitude.":"Test 2 相減比較 168 秒加液後與 48 秒 F0 視窗，是描述性擾動修正，不是擬合漂白修正。數值稽核另含匹配 0–48 秒計算：十一個含受體 VUAA1 條件仍為正，空白 −7.83 pp。較短視窗保留 VUAA1 方向，但改變幅度。","Control behavior remains important. In Test 1, the Or35a + ORCO buffer-only well had a 35.25% excursion. In Test 2, all twelve DMSO-control S values lie between −1.79 and −0.31 pp. Or7a + ORCO has a small positive S of +0.40 pp even though its post-addition signal falls by 1.47%, because F0 falls further. These examples show why both subtraction components accompany the corrected values.":"對照行為仍然重要。Test 1 的 Or35a + ORCO 純緩衝液孔變化為 35.25%。Test 2 十二個 DMSO 對照 S 皆介於 −1.79、−0.31 pp。Or7a + ORCO 加液後訊號雖降 1.47%，因 F0 降更多，仍得小正 S +0.40 pp。這說明校正值必須附上兩個相減項。","For Test 1, the same between-well operations use its buffer-corrected excursion and buffer-only row. The four-acquisition Test 1 protocol and the two-acquisition Test 2 protocol have different within-well definitions; their magnitudes are not interchangeable. The original earlier numerical tables are retained in the audit.":"Test 1 的相同孔間運算採緩衝液校正變化與純緩衝液列。四次擷取 Test 1 與兩次擷取 Test 2 的孔內定義不同，幅度不可互換。原早期數值表保留於稽核。","View the full processing components":"檢視完整處理項目","VUAA1 and control time courses in Test 1 and Test 2":"Test 1、Test 2 的 VUAA1 與對照時間曲線","All twelve conditions in Test 1 and Test 2":"Test 1、Test 2 全部十二種條件","Corrected response maps from both odor assays":"兩項氣味試驗的校正反應圖","Vehicle and blank control contrasts from both assays":"兩項試驗的溶劑與空白對照對比","Test 2 odor responses normalized to the DMSO-subtracted VUAA1 response of each construct":"Test 2 氣味反應，以各構築扣除 DMSO 後的 VUAA1 反應正規化","Four odorant profiles across ten receptors: post-addition fluorescence changes minus matched DMSO, alongside DoOR consensus minus receptor spontaneous firing rate":"十種受體的四氣味輪廓：加液後螢光變化減匹配 DMSO，並列 DoOR 共識減受體自發放電率","Per-odorant scatter plots comparing post-addition fluorescence contrasts with DoOR minus spontaneous firing rate, with Pearson and Spearman correlations":"各氣味散點圖比較加液後螢光對比與 DoOR 減自發放電率，附 Pearson、Spearman 相關","Open complete odor-assay vector figure at full size":"開啟完整尺寸氣味試驗向量圖","All twelve cell conditions with four Test 1 raw acquisitions, two Test 2 raw acquisitions and Test 2 VUAA1-referenced time courses":"全部十二細胞條件，含四次 Test 1 原始擷取、兩次 Test 2 原始擷取及 Test 2 VUAA1 參考時間曲線","VUAA1 has limited public toxicology and follows the concentrated VOC and DMSO stock controls in":"VUAA1 公開毒理資訊有限，遵循濃縮 VOC 與 DMSO 原液管制，見",". Inventory completeness and electroporation are covered by":"。庫存完整性與電穿孔見","Cartridge sealing, leak isolation and laboratory-only live-cell use are covered by":"感測匣密封、洩漏隔離與僅限實驗室的活細胞使用見","; living-cell distribution by":"；活細胞分發見",". Autoclave and sharps controls are listed under":"。高壓滅菌與尖銳物管制列於","Safe construction combines biological containment, organism and part selection, chemical controls, equipment procedures and waste inactivation. Reported laboratory practice and design controls are identified separately in the risk register.":"安全製作結合生物圍堵、生物與元件選擇、化學管制、設備程序及廢棄物去活化。風險登錄分別標示回報的實驗室實務與設計管制。","The inventory covers cloning, HEK293 sensing and the separate":"清單涵蓋克隆、HEK293 感測及獨立的","imaging study. White List eligibility, Check-In, vendor pathogen testing and institutional biosafety level are separate determinations. The actual fly stock and preparation require their own identity and oversight records. Competition status must be checked against the applicable iGEM rules and official team submissions.":"影像研究。白名單資格、Check-In、供應商病原檢測與機構生物安全等級是不同判定。實際果蠅品系與製備需自己的身分及監督紀錄。競賽狀態須依適用 iGEM 規則與官方團隊提交資料核對。","The transimpedance amplifier starts from an LMP7721-class design with R":"跨阻放大器以 LMP7721 類設計起步，R","= 100 MΩ. Picoampere-scale leakage can resemble photocurrent at this impedance. Controlling moisture, contamination, flux residue and unguarded paths therefore protects the biological interpretation as well as the analog signal.":"= 100 MΩ。在此阻抗下，皮安培尺度漏電可能貌似光電流。因此控制濕氣、污染、助焊劑殘留及未護環路徑，既保護類比訊號，也保護生物學解釋。","Validate a sealed cartridge, including leak and failure tests and isolation from food, users, the environment and reusable electronics.":"驗證密封感測匣，包括洩漏、失效測試，以及與食品、使用者、環境及可重用電子系統的隔離。","Define transport and disposal for intact and damaged cartridges, and a user workflow that preserves the distinction between detection, measurement validity and confirmation.":"定義完整及損壞感測匣的運輸與處置，並建立清楚區分偵測、量測有效性及確認的使用流程。","Obtain the competent authority’s regulatory determination before deployment; laboratory containment does not itself authorize a living-cell product.":"部署前取得主管機關法規判定；實驗室圍堵本身不代表活細胞產品獲准使用。","Validate real-world performance and retain a confirmatory-testing policy for high-risk or invalid outputs.":"驗證真實環境效能，並對高風險或無效輸出保留確認性檢驗政策。","Education records the 300-response public survey and learning activities; Human Practices records industry and mentor input. Participant data are handled separately from laboratory measurements.":"教育頁記錄 300 份公眾調查與學習活動，人文實踐頁記錄產業與導師意見。參與者資料與實驗量測分開處理。","The current dual-use assessment covers contained laboratory chassis, insect olfactory receptors, VOC stocks and a reconfigurable sensing architecture. Its modularity creates low but non-zero dual-use relevance. Broader pathogen-associated VOC detection or other sensitive applications require renewed review.":"目前雙重用途評估涵蓋受控實驗室宿主、昆蟲嗅覺受體、VOC 原液及可重組感測架構。模組化帶來低但非零的雙重用途相關性。更廣泛的病原相關 VOC 偵測或其他敏感應用需重新審查。","The rubric supports activity-specific review; the 30 hazards have not been assigned signed likelihood or severity scores. Reported implementation does not establish residual risk, and no row is marked as a verified outcome.":"準則支援活動專屬審查；30 項危害尚未配置簽核的可能性或嚴重度分數。回報已執行不代表殘餘風險已確立，沒有任何列標示為已驗證成果。","Compliance and oversight":"合規與監督","Institutional procedures govern containment, training, chemical handling and disposal. iGEM Project Safety and Check-In forms address competition review; White List eligibility and institutional biosafety level are separate determinations. Each activity must meet its applicable requirements before work begins.":"機構程序規範圍堵、訓練、化學處理及廢棄。iGEM Project Safety 與 Check-In 表單處理競賽審查；白名單資格與機構生物安全等級屬不同判定。各活動開始前須符合適用要求。","Keep the activity-specific risk assessment, operator training and authorization, chemical SDS and waste records with the laboratory. A component datasheet or a wiki description does not demonstrate control performance.":"活動專屬風險評估、操作訓練與授權、化學 SDS 及廢棄紀錄應保留於實驗室。元件規格書或 Wiki 描述不能證明管制效能。","AeroSafe connects the material inventory, contained laboratory practices, reader-quality controls and interpretation rules to the risk register. Its reusable contribution is the hazard → consequence → control → verification record, together with explicit triggers for renewed review when organisms, receptor targets or deployment change.":"AeroSafe 將材料清單、受控實驗室實務、讀取器品管及解讀規則連結至風險登錄。可重用貢獻為危害 → 後果 → 管制 → 驗證紀錄，以及生物、受體目標或部署變更時重新審查的明確觸發條件。","The linked records distinguish reported laboratory practice, design controls and uses outside the current scope. Residual risk still requires activity-specific assessment; the register does not label untested controls as verified.":"連結紀錄區分回報的實驗室實務、設計管制與目前範圍外用途。殘餘風險仍需活動專屬評估；登錄不將未測管制標為已驗證。","11-point BP review · pitch-deck review · NTHU Garage 18th cohort":"11 項商業計畫審查 · 提案簡報審查 · 清華創業車庫第 18 期","Shelf-hole parameter sweep — AeroSense":"平台孔洞參數掃描 — AeroSense","Hardware decision":"硬體決策","Source CSV":"來源 CSV","Shelf-hole parameter sweep":"平台孔洞參數掃描","Each dot is one of 18 recorded parameter cases. Two additional grid refinements are listed separately below. Different shelf heights can share x/y coordinates; use the case selector to inspect every result. Solver convergence within one grid does not establish mesh independence; local metrics remain grid-sensitive. The plot connects no dots and fits no surface.":"每點代表 18 個已記錄參數案例之一，另兩項網格細化檢查列於下方。不同平台高度可能有相同 x/y 座標，請用案例選單檢視全部結果。單一網格內求解收斂不代表網格獨立性；局部指標仍對網格敏感。圖不連接各點，也不擬合曲面。","Rotate with drag or the keyboard-accessible sliders. Choose a case to inspect its exact saved values. All 18 cases remain readable in the table below when JavaScript is off.":"拖曳或使用可鍵盤操作的滑桿旋轉，選案例檢視確切儲存值。關閉 JavaScript 時，下表仍可閱讀全部 18 案例。","Rotation":"旋轉","Tilt":"傾斜","Inspect one recorded case":"檢視一個已記錄案例","Selected result":"所選結果","Complete recorded data":"完整紀錄資料","Unchanged delivered CSV values; no interpolated or newly simulated results":"原交付 CSV 值，未插值或新增模擬","case":"案例","diameter_mm":"孔徑（mm）","pitch_mm":"孔距（mm）","nominal_lattice_density_per_mm2":"名目晶格密度（mm⁻²）","hole_count":"孔數","global_hole_density_per_mm2":"整體孔密度（mm⁻²）","plate_bottom_z_mm":"板底 z（mm）","inlet_center_to_plate_top_mm":"入口中心至板頂（mm）","lower_gap_mm":"下方間隙（mm）","plate_thickness_mm":"板厚（mm）","open_area_fraction":"開孔面積比例","dx_mm":"網格間距（mm）","diameter_cells":"孔徑網格數","web_cells":"孔間實體網格數","lower_gap_cells":"下方間隙網格數","converged":"已收斂","J_ratio_to_open":"通量相對開放狀態比","near_liquid_P95_ratio_to_open":"近液面 P95 相對開放狀態比","pressure_Pa":"壓力（Pa）","mouth_flux_CV":"口部通量 CV","mass_imbalance":"質量不平衡","velocity_relative_change":"速度相對變化","raw_json":"原始 JSON","Separate grid-refinement checks":"獨立網格細化檢查","These two checks rerun selected geometries at 0.2 mm instead of the 0.3 mm parameter-sweep grid. They are not additional designs or proof of global mesh convergence.":"兩項檢查將選定幾何從參數掃描的 0.3 mm 網格改為 0.2 mm 重跑。它們不是新增設計，也非整體網格收斂證明。","Saved refinement values from hole_sweep_summary.json":"hole_sweep_summary.json 中儲存的細化值","Case":"案例","Flux ratio, 0.3 mm":"通量比，0.3 mm","Flux ratio, 0.2 mm":"通量比，0.2 mm","Speed ratio, 0.2 mm":"速度比，0.2 mm","Content is available under":"內容授權採用",". View the":"。檢視","wiki source on iGEM GitLab":"iGEM GitLab 上的 Wiki 原始碼","Operating-point sweep — AeroSense":"操作點掃描 — AeroSense","Operating-point sweep":"操作點掃描","Each dot is one recorded Q–D case. The third axis is the slowest gas-interface t90, not liquid delivery or cell response. The 3 mL/min, D = 20 mm²/s candidate is provisional. The historical 100 µL geometry/headspace assumption conflicts with the reported physical fill and must be resolved before adopting the operating point.":"每點代表一個已記錄 Q–D 案例。第三軸為最慢氣體界面 t90，不是液體輸送或細胞反應。3 mL/min、D = 20 mm²/s 候選為暫定。歷史 100 µL 幾何／頂空假設與回報實際填充不符，採用操作點前須解決。","Rotate with drag or the keyboard-accessible sliders. Choose a case to inspect its exact saved values. All 21 cases remain readable in the table below when JavaScript is off.":"拖曳或使用可鍵盤操作的滑桿旋轉，選案例檢視確切儲存值。關閉 JavaScript 時，下表仍可閱讀全部 21 案例。","Q_mL_min":"流量 Q（mL/min）","Dgas_mm2_s":"氣體擴散係數（mm²/s）","gas_speed_p95_mm_s":"氣體速度 P95（mm/s）","port_mean_speed_mm_s":"埠口平均速度（mm/s）","port_Re":"埠口雷諾數","chamber_pressure_drop_Pa":"腔室壓降（Pa）","Supplementary data · cassette features":"補充資料 · 表現盒特徵","Label + mark carry meaning; color is only a secondary scan aid.":"標籤與記號承載意義；顏色僅輔助快速辨讀。","Three print batches; source resin and machine-time formulas":"三個列印批次；來源樹脂與機時公式","13 required purchase lines at used quantity, including the custom-filter allowance":"13 項必要採購按使用量計價，包含客製濾光片預留款","Required printing + used purchase quantities":"必要列印與實際使用採購數量","Two-board development quote divided by two; design and setup included":"兩片板開發報價除以二，包含設計與開辦費","Device development budget; excluded costs remain below":"裝置開發預算；排除成本仍列於下方","Whole-pack cash outlay for purchases only, before printing and":"僅採購的整包現金支出，尚未計入列印與","10 shared development / gas / measurement lines; may be borrowed":"10 項共用開發／氣體／量測項目，可借用",", valve development and environmental sensing; excluded":"、閥門開發與環境感測；排除","The workbook uses fixed USD inputs. Its retained":"工作簿採固定美元輸入。所保留的","Green fluorescent protein, a genetically encoded reporter that makes labeled cells or proteins visible. GFP alone is not a calcium-activity indicator.":"綠色螢光蛋白，是讓標記細胞或蛋白可見的基因編碼報導蛋白。GFP 本身不是鈣離子活動指標。","A Drosophila GAL4 driver labeling many antennal-lobe projection neurons, as well as additional cells including APL. It is not exclusively specific to projection neurons.":"果蠅 GAL4 驅動系統，標記許多觸角葉投射神經元及 APL 等其他細胞，並非專一標記投射神經元。","Tyrosine hydroxylase, an enzyme required for dopamine synthesis. TH-based drivers label dopamine-associated neuronal populations; the label itself does not measure dopamine release.":"酪胺酸羥化酶，合成多巴胺所需酵素。TH 驅動系統標記多巴胺相關神經元群；標記本身不量測多巴胺釋放。","Pipeline Cleanup, Baseline Confirmation,…":"流程整理、基準確認…","Selected case":"所選案例","Reset view":"重設視角","Rotatable scatter plot of saved simulation cases; use the selector and table for exact values":"可旋轉的已存模擬案例散點圖；使用選單與表格檢視精確值","Saved simulation results are in the table below.":"已存模擬結果列於下表。","View data and source files":"檢視資料與來源檔案","Hole diameter (mm)":"孔徑（mm）","Pitch (mm)":"孔距（mm）","Flux / open reference":"通量／開放參考","Flow Q (mL/min)":"流量 Q（mL/min）","Gas D (mm²/s)":"氣體 D（mm²/s）","Slowest t90 (s)":"最慢 t90（秒）","58 fluorescein acquisitions support four-channel frequency separation, measured cross-talk and additivity comparisons, and concentration checks against prepared standards.":"58 次螢光素擷取支持四通道頻率分離、實測串擾與加成性比較，以及對照已配製標準品的濃度檢查。","A blank CSV, JSON Schema and instructions define sample identity, calibration, quality control and raw/processed signal fields for shared records.":"空白 CSV、JSON Schema 與說明文件定義共用紀錄中的樣品身分、校正、品質控制，以及原始與處理後訊號欄位。","A reusable blank template connects stakeholder observations, insights, design decisions, supporting evidence and re-evaluation.":"可重複使用的空白範本串連利害關係人的觀察、洞見、設計決策、支持證據與再評估。","Assembled reader":"組裝完成的讀取器","Chemical handling covers concentrated VOC stocks, VUAA1 and DMSO, with source-specific safety review, ventilation, protective equipment and waste management.":"化學品操作涵蓋高濃度 VOC 儲備液、VUAA1 與 DMSO，並納入各來源的安全審查、通風、防護裝備與廢棄物管理。","Compare continuous, binned and spiking-network representations across 91 odorants, ten receptors and five chemical families.":"針對 91 種氣味分子、10 種受體與 5 個化學家族，比較連續值、分箱及脈衝神經網路的表徵方式。","Compare time courses and control-referenced response maps across ten OR + ORCO conditions, ORCO-only cells and untransfected cells.":"比較 10 種 OR + ORCO 條件、僅表現 ORCO 的細胞與未轉染細胞的時間曲線，以及以對照為基準的反應圖。","DoOR chemical-family classification":"DoOR 化學家族分類","Each construct uses its own DMSO and VUAA1 controls to scale the Test 2 response map, with DMSO at 0 and VUAA1 at 1.":"各構築體分別使用自身的 DMSO 與 VUAA1 對照縮放 Test 2 反應圖，將 DMSO 設為 0、VUAA1 設為 1。","Engineering · Odor decoding":"工程設計 · 氣味解碼","Figure 14 · VUAA1-referenced responses":"圖 14 · 以 VUAA1 為基準的反應","Figure 18 · Living-cell integration":"圖 18 · 活細胞整合","Find endpoint-image and Test 1/Test 2 kinetic analyses, reader source files, metadata contracts and reusable recording templates.":"查閱終點影像與 Test 1／Test 2 動力學分析、讀取器原始檔、中繼資料契約及可重複使用的紀錄範本。","Find the acquisition record (32 exports, 3,840 readings), published analysis tables and source code; raw inputs remain in the prepared research archive.":"查閱擷取紀錄（32 份匯出檔、3,840 筆讀值）、已發布分析表與原始碼；原始輸入資料保留於已整理的研究資料包。","Four wells compare cells-plus-medium and VUAA1 time courses, normalized to each trace's first reading, with a late-window contrast.":"四個培養井比較細胞加培養液與 VUAA1 的時間曲線，各曲線以首筆讀值正規化，並比較後段時間窗。","Hardware Cycle 6 · Photodiode amplifier gain":"硬體循環 6 · 光電二極體放大器增益","Interface and firmware":"介面與韌體","Model design, build, test and learn":"模型的設計、建構、測試與學習","Model · Odor decoding":"模型 · 氣味解碼","Odor testing · Test 1 and Test 2":"氣味測試 · Test 1 與 Test 2","Reuse the assembled four-channel reader's CAD, firmware, manuals and analysis of 58 fluorescein acquisitions, including measured cross-talk and calibration checks.":"沿用已組裝四通道讀取器的 CAD、韌體、手冊，以及 58 次螢光素擷取的分析，包含實測串擾與校正檢查。","Ten physical photographs connect the PCB, printed enclosure, well carrier, gas tubing and fan to the CAD assembly.":"10 張實體照片將 PCB、列印外殼、培養井載座、氣體管線與風扇對應至 CAD 組裝模型。","The earlier integration archive records PCB layout, CAD and software. Subsequent board tests and gain diagnosis are documented in Hardware Cycle 6.":"較早的整合封存紀錄包含 PCB 佈局、CAD 與軟體；後續電路板測試及增益診斷記載於硬體循環 6。","Three engineering cycles examine sparse odor encoding, network readout and adaptation from gas sensors to receptor-response data.":"三個工程循環探討稀疏氣味編碼、網路讀出，以及由氣體感測器資料轉用受體反應資料的調整。","Three illumination conditions gave ADC code 32767 and approximately 3.15 V at the ADC input. iST proposed lower TIA gain; saturation remains a working explanation pending resistor replacement and verification.":"三種照明條件均得到 ADC 碼值 32767，ADC 輸入端約為 3.15 V。iST 建議降低 TIA 增益；飽和仍是待驗證的解釋，須更換電阻後確認。","Training-set PCA and quantile bins encode gas-sensor measurements into projection-neuron activity for the PN–KC–MBON network.":"以訓練集的 PCA 與分位數分箱，將氣體感測量測值編碼為 PN–KC–MBON 網路的投射神經元活動。","UCI gas sensing and sparse neural encoding":"UCI 氣體感測與稀疏神經編碼"});
